(4430924, 638594, 674, '<td valign="top">I think he is saying get me out of here</td>', 'I think he is saying get me out of here', '2008-01-28 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4430925, 638666, 18450, '<td valign="top">When you''re shooting directly into the light like this it''s really hard to not underexpose your subject (the bird) and lose all the details, it''s also nearly impossible to not get that purple fringing where the dark edges meet the light. If you go round the other side of the tree with the sun on your back you can usually avoid it. Not easy with birds I know, they often don''t wait for you to find the right spot.</td>', 'When you''re shooting directly into the light like this it''s really hard to not underexpose your subject (the bird) and lose all the details, it''s also nearly impossible to not get that purple fringing where the dark edges meet the light. If you go round the other side of the tree with the sun on your back you can usually avoid it. Not easy with birds I know, they often don''t wait for you to find the right spot.', '2008-01-28 00:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4430929, 637467, 674, '<td valign="top">wow what a bad hair day!</td>', 'wow what a bad hair day!', '2008-01-28 00:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
