(4431487, 637302, 68035, '<td valign="top">Beautiful in its simplicity and great sharpness on the seagull.  One minor point that it looks (and please note this is a comment from an amateur) like you may have adjusted the blue/cyan hue/sat in a way that make the sky appear a little grainy and perhaps it could have done with a little noise reduction on this element to smooth it out a touch.  Even with this very minor point still gets a 7 from me</td>', 'Beautiful in its simplicity and great sharpness on the seagull.  One minor point that it looks (and please note this is a comment from an amateur) like you may have adjusted the blue/cyan hue/sat in a way that make the sky appear a little grainy and perhaps it could have done with a little noise reduction on this element to smooth it out a touch.  Even with this very minor point still gets a 7 from me', '2008-01-28 04:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431489, 638925, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning sharpness and colours, possibly a shame that you dont get to see all of the reflection but nonetheless has a real wow factor</td>', 'Stunning sharpness and colours, possibly a shame that you dont get to see all of the reflection but nonetheless has a real wow factor', '2008-01-28 04:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431491, 638587, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and some nice pop on the red of the beaks, the whites seem a little blown on my monitor</td>', 'Lovely composition and some nice pop on the red of the beaks, the whites seem a little blown on my monitor', '2008-01-28 04:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431493, 638858, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great photo but perhaps could have done with the contrast levels adjusting slightly to give the image a little more ''pop''</td>', 'Great photo but perhaps could have done with the contrast levels adjusting slightly to give the image a little more ''pop''', '2008-01-28 04:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431494, 637259, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great action shot although I would have liked to see a touch more sharpness of the two birds (though I appreciate that in getting the shot off it would have been hard to fine tune the focus)</td>', 'Great action shot although I would have liked to see a touch more sharpness of the two birds (though I appreciate that in getting the shot off it would have been hard to fine tune the focus)', '2008-01-28 05:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431495, 638972, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and colour on the leading pigeon.  Its a shame that the angle of the fence/shot means you could not crop out the third bird as this is somewhat distracting from what is a very good image</td>', 'Great sharpness and colour on the leading pigeon.  Its a shame that the angle of the fence/shot means you could not crop out the third bird as this is somewhat distracting from what is a very good image', '2008-01-28 05:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431496, 638695, 68035, '<td valign="top">Brilliant image and black and white conversion which both brings out the strength of the black and white plummage whilst at the same time endowing them with a softness which is visually very appealing.  The framing you have used works very well</td>', 'Brilliant image and black and white conversion which both brings out the strength of the black and white plummage whilst at the same time endowing them with a softness which is visually very appealing.  The framing you have used works very well', '2008-01-28 05:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431498, 638895, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great job in terms of sharpness and colouring and I love the way you have caught all the head plaummage in the frame</td>', 'Great job in terms of sharpness and colouring and I love the way you have caught all the head plaummage in the frame', '2008-01-28 05:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431505, 637422, 37252, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF and sharp focus in all the right places</td>', 'Excellent DOF and sharp focus in all the right places', '2008-01-28 05:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431509, 638925, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful duck. I wish the reflection had not been cut off though. Nice DOF. The colors are perfect - not over saturated. Focus is sharp with details brought out nicely.</td>', 'Beautiful duck. I wish the reflection had not been cut off though. Nice DOF. The colors are perfect - not over saturated. Focus is sharp with details brought out nicely.', '2008-01-28 05:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431523, 637564, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and action capture.</td>', 'Nice perspective and action capture.', '2008-01-28 05:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
