(4431538, 636550, 49109, '<td valign="top">and (lens) size does matter! very good focused shot. composition is a bit unweighted, had preferred a portrait orientation to emphasize his majesty</td>', 'and (lens) size does matter! very good focused shot. composition is a bit unweighted, had preferred a portrait orientation to emphasize his majesty', '2008-01-28 05:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
