(4431714, 637538, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness on the eye and interesting framing with the branch.  Sky is a little flat but I doubt the bird was willing to hang around til some nice cloud formations drifted by.  Bird blends a little into the tree, especially on the left.  Good for reality, not so dramatic for a picture.  Maybe some selective dodging/burning might make him stand out more.</td>', 'Nice sharpness on the eye and interesting framing with the branch.  Sky is a little flat but I doubt the bird was willing to hang around til some nice cloud formations drifted by.  Bird blends a little into the tree, especially on the left.  Good for reality, not so dramatic for a picture.  Maybe some selective dodging/burning might make him stand out more.', '2008-01-28 07:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
