(4431728, 638722, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love the one looking right at me from amongst the fray.  And, oh, look, there''s one with his beak around another one''s head, and the victim is squawking!  And the 3 up front intently dividing the spoils.  Lots of great mini-scenes in this.  You really captured the moment wonderfully well.</td>', 'I love the one looking right at me from amongst the fray.  And, oh, look, there''s one with his beak around another one''s head, and the victim is squawking!  And the 3 up front intently dividing the spoils.  Lots of great mini-scenes in this.  You really captured the moment wonderfully well.', '2008-01-28 07:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
