(4431735, 638912, 65234, '<td valign="top">OOB, certainly.  The shot is well-composed but a bit drab; maybe some increases in saturation and contrast ... or maybe I don''t really want to see the duct-taped diaper any better than I already can!</td>', 'OOB, certainly.  The shot is well-composed but a bit drab; maybe some increases in saturation and contrast ... or maybe I don''t really want to see the duct-taped diaper any better than I already can!', '2008-01-28 08:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
