(4431751, 638782, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very abstract water but overwhelming in patterns and color for the poor duck.  I think for this challenge I would prefer to see more duck and less water.  You have detail on him and the duck''s reflection is particularly clear, but it''s not quite enough for me to get past the water (which is the color of my car''s antifreeze, now that I look at it some more).</td>', 'Very abstract water but overwhelming in patterns and color for the poor duck.  I think for this challenge I would prefer to see more duck and less water.  You have detail on him and the duck''s reflection is particularly clear, but it''s not quite enough for me to get past the water (which is the color of my car''s antifreeze, now that I look at it some more).', '2008-01-28 08:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431754, 638661, 65234, '<td valign="top">Chickadee chillin''; I like it.  Excellent detail and clarity and nice framing with the branches.</td>', 'Chickadee chillin''; I like it.  Excellent detail and clarity and nice framing with the branches.', '2008-01-28 08:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
