(4431798, 639014, 65234, '<td valign="top">A Red-bellied Woodpecker!  One my my favorite dumb bird names; did they somehow miss seeing that distinctive red on his head?!<br/> <br/>I digress.  Nice detail and nice angle to the composition.  Background sets him off well.  Could maybe stand a bit of dodging on his chest to really bring him out, but nice capture overall.</td>', 'A Red-bellied Woodpecker!  One my my favorite dumb bird names; did they somehow miss seeing that distinctive red on his head?! I digress.  Nice detail and nice angle to the composition.  Background sets him off well.  Could maybe stand a bit of dodging on his chest to really bring him out, but nice capture overall.', '2008-01-28 08:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431800, 639031, 88241, '<td valign="top">Looks a little overexposed.</td>', 'Looks a little overexposed.', '2008-01-28 08:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431802, 638537, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good light, detail and composition.  Could use a bit more eye catchlight to add some life to him.</td>', 'Good light, detail and composition.  Could use a bit more eye catchlight to add some life to him.', '2008-01-28 08:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431804, 638286, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute pose :-)  Whites are a little blown; I might have tried to do something with the ones in the background so the bird stood out even more.</td>', 'Very cute pose :-)  Whites are a little blown; I might have tried to do something with the ones in the background so the bird stood out even more.', '2008-01-28 08:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431810, 638767, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice Mallard, especially in the eye and that lovely sheen on his head and chest.  Rather classic not-looking-at-the-camera pose.  I like his shadow; would have preferred both his feet and the whole shadow make it into the shot but that''s picky.</td>', 'Very nice Mallard, especially in the eye and that lovely sheen on his head and chest.  Rather classic not-looking-at-the-camera pose.  I like his shadow; would have preferred both his feet and the whole shadow make it into the shot but that''s picky.', '2008-01-28 08:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431820, 638302, 65234, '<td valign="top">You picked a flamingo with nice patterns in his back and tail feathers.  Good detail on the bird, but the orange in the background is not setting him off as well as it could; I might try some desaturation on the background to show him off better.</td>', 'You picked a flamingo with nice patterns in his back and tail feathers.  Good detail on the bird, but the orange in the background is not setting him off as well as it could; I might try some desaturation on the background to show him off better.', '2008-01-28 08:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431826, 638097, 65234, '<td valign="top">''Fraid I''m going to have to go with the "too much processing" crowd.  It just doesn''t look like a photo to me.  That said, the tones are nice and I might like it as a painting, but with a much darker frame (that''s too muddy a brown to appeal to me).</td>', '''Fraid I''m going to have to go with the "too much processing" crowd.  It just doesn''t look like a photo to me.  That said, the tones are nice and I might like it as a painting, but with a much darker frame (that''s too muddy a brown to appeal to me).', '2008-01-28 08:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431833, 637207, 65234, '<td valign="top">Essence of bird.  Composition is great and I like that they appear to be at different heights in the sky.  Unique take on the challenge, but I like it.</td>', 'Essence of bird.  Composition is great and I like that they appear to be at different heights in the sky.  Unique take on the challenge, but I like it.', '2008-01-28 08:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431836, 638122, 65234, '<td valign="top">The pigeon in front is great because he''s looking at us, which is fun.  The one in back isn''t doing much for me.  I think I would have been tempted to rotate this a bit and crop him out, but then I can be ruthless sometimes.</td>', 'The pigeon in front is great because he''s looking at us, which is fun.  The one in back isn''t doing much for me.  I think I would have been tempted to rotate this a bit and crop him out, but then I can be ruthless sometimes.', '2008-01-28 08:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431840, 638986, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice motion shot with just the one skate in focus.  OOB interpretation of the challenge, and a well done one.</td>', 'Very nice motion shot with just the one skate in focus.  OOB interpretation of the challenge, and a well done one.', '2008-01-28 08:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431841, 638274, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, really :-(  Poor bird.  Looks dejected and I can''t even see his face.</td>', 'Aw, really :-(  Poor bird.  Looks dejected and I can''t even see his face.', '2008-01-28 08:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431842, 637259, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome moment to capture; just wish it were clearer.</td>', 'Awesome moment to capture; just wish it were clearer.', '2008-01-28 08:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431843, 638705, 65234, '<td valign="top">Poor little thing is so small in this big world.</td>', 'Poor little thing is so small in this big world.', '2008-01-28 08:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431847, 638607, 65234, '<td valign="top">They''re doing some serious shredding of that sisal.  The one on the right looks like he''s thinking up something dastardly to do.</td>', 'They''re doing some serious shredding of that sisal.  The one on the right looks like he''s thinking up something dastardly to do.', '2008-01-28 08:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431852, 638611, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of the eagle figure and really nice job with the border.  The globe (it looks like) he''s standing on is very bright and draws attention from the more subtle lighting on the bird.</td>', 'Nice picture of the eagle figure and really nice job with the border.  The globe (it looks like) he''s standing on is very bright and draws attention from the more subtle lighting on the bird.', '2008-01-28 08:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431859, 638270, 65234, '<td valign="top">The eye in the poster behind him is freaky.  Nice detail on the pigeon; Not sure if I like the fact that the strong verticals give him 3 different backgrounds.</td>', 'The eye in the poster behind him is freaky.  Nice detail on the pigeon; Not sure if I like the fact that the strong verticals give him 3 different backgrounds.', '2008-01-28 08:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431863, 638895, 65234, '<td valign="top">That seems like a good name for her.  Very nice detail on her eye and crown feathers.</td>', 'That seems like a good name for her.  Very nice detail on her eye and crown feathers.', '2008-01-28 08:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431864, 638611, 87538, '<td valign="top">I do not care for the editing done to this image.</td>', 'I do not care for the editing done to this image.', '2008-01-28 08:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431870, 638306, 65234, '<td valign="top">The males are cooler :-)  Too bad you didn''t get her beak more prominently; but she doesn''t look as silly this way, which is probably to her benefit.  I like what you did with the PP quite a bit.</td>', 'The males are cooler :-)  Too bad you didn''t get her beak more prominently; but she doesn''t look as silly this way, which is probably to her benefit.  I like what you did with the PP quite a bit.', '2008-01-28 08:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431873, 638267, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great detail (feathers even look wet) and lovely color and bokeh in the background to set him off.  Maybe could use a smidge more DOF to get all the neck feathers in focus.</td>', 'Great detail (feathers even look wet) and lovely color and bokeh in the background to set him off.  Maybe could use a smidge more DOF to get all the neck feathers in focus.', '2008-01-28 08:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431880, 638655, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, it''s a little Nuthatch!  I love those guys.  Very nice pinks and greens to set him off and nice composition.  A little more detail on him (especially a catchlight in the eye) would make this even better, IMO.</td>', 'Aw, it''s a little Nuthatch!  I love those guys.  Very nice pinks and greens to set him off and nice composition.  A little more detail on him (especially a catchlight in the eye) would make this even better, IMO.', '2008-01-28 08:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431884, 637564, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- I''m betting this may have a ribbon on it next week!</td>', 'Wow -- I''m betting this may have a ribbon on it next week!', '2008-01-28 09:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431886, 638116, 65234, '<td valign="top">I love wetlands :-)  Birdy heaven.  Not a lot of detail on individual birds but this looks very much like a place I''d love to visit.  I might play with burning selectivey to get a little more shadow in the woods and the ice.</td>', 'I love wetlands :-)  Birdy heaven.  Not a lot of detail on individual birds but this looks very much like a place I''d love to visit.  I might play with burning selectivey to get a little more shadow in the woods and the ice.', '2008-01-28 09:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431890, 638646, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute pose.  Bird looks a little too smooth in the body and upper wing, especially in comparison to the noise in the background.</td>', 'Cute pose.  Bird looks a little too smooth in the body and upper wing, especially in comparison to the noise in the background.', '2008-01-28 09:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4431900, 638808, 16488, '<td valign="top">Chickadees, how bold they are! Love the motion in the wings.</td>', 'Chickadees, how bold they are! Love the motion in the wings.', '2008-01-28 09:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
