(4434070, 638863, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great sky and nice detail on the birds.  I don''t think I like the inclusion of the boat so much.</td>', 'Great sky and nice detail on the birds.  I don''t think I like the inclusion of the boat so much.', '2008-01-28 17:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
