(4434084, 639037, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice colors on the wee one.  Not really a fan of the border as it draws my attention from the bird.</td>', 'Nice colors on the wee one.  Not really a fan of the border as it draws my attention from the bird.', '2008-01-28 17:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
