(4434093, 638595, 71239, '<td valign="top">Simple composition but very effective and nice presentation in the frame.  Good PP to make the dove stand out.  One of my favourites in a very strong field.</td>', 'Simple composition but very effective and nice presentation in the frame.  Good PP to make the dove stand out.  One of my favourites in a very strong field.', '2008-01-28 17:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
