(4434095, 638232, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite regal.  I like the composition to show off the bird''s elegant curves.</td>', 'Quite regal.  I like the composition to show off the bird''s elegant curves.', '2008-01-28 17:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434097, 638578, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s an unusual bird (to me).  Very nice detail on the eye and head.</td>', 'That''s an unusual bird (to me).  Very nice detail on the eye and head.', '2008-01-28 17:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434104, 638135, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s taking a little bow; cute :-)  Like the bits of snow on its beak, too.  Would prefer the whole tail in the image but that''s a relative nit.</td>', 'Looks like it''s taking a little bow; cute :-)  Like the bits of snow on its beak, too.  Would prefer the whole tail in the image but that''s a relative nit.', '2008-01-28 17:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434105, 638383, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Almost everything I like about it is provided by the bird though (i.e. attractiveness/uniqueness). The composition and POV suggests hastiness rather than craftmanship. Although you did get the shot so that''s important. The thing is your title suggests more than what is delivered here and why I expected more. Perhaps a lower POV would have captured that story better (i.e. show more of the surrounding elements) and at the same time given this composition more harmony with the subject.<br/> <br/>Just my opinion of course. It''s a good photo. I just think it can be better. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice capture. Almost everything I like about it is provided by the bird though (i.e. attractiveness/uniqueness). The composition and POV suggests hastiness rather than craftmanship. Although you did get the shot so that''s important. The thing is your title suggests more than what is delivered here and why I expected more. Perhaps a lower POV would have captured that story better (i.e. show more of the surrounding elements) and at the same time given this composition more harmony with the subject. Just my opinion of course. It''s a good photo. I just think it can be better. Good luck.', '2008-01-28 17:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434108, 638855, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great pose, even if it is less diginified than what I''ve come to expect from swans.  Nice lighting/exposure.</td>', 'Great pose, even if it is less diginified than what I''ve come to expect from swans.  Nice lighting/exposure.', '2008-01-28 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434112, 638673, 71239, '<td valign="top">This is really nicely composed shot, interestingly framed with the tree and it looks like beautifully balanced flash to lift the brest and add catchlight.  Great colour palette too.</td>', 'This is really nicely composed shot, interestingly framed with the tree and it looks like beautifully balanced flash to lift the brest and add catchlight.  Great colour palette too.', '2008-01-28 17:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434113, 638306, 71239, '<td valign="top">Highly unusual treatment, but creatively balances the body pattern and ripples to great effect.</td>', 'Highly unusual treatment, but creatively balances the body pattern and ripples to great effect.', '2008-01-28 17:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434114, 638094, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute pose and nice composition with the trees off to one side.  Body and head look a little too smooth (i.e., plastic) for my taste.</td>', 'Cute pose and nice composition with the trees off to one side.  Body and head look a little too smooth (i.e., plastic) for my taste.', '2008-01-28 17:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434119, 638884, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a happy, curious little bird.  Very cute pose you captured; nice detail and color.</td>', 'Looks like a happy, curious little bird.  Very cute pose you captured; nice detail and color.', '2008-01-28 17:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434123, 638210, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the shapes. It gives it a rawness that lends itself well to conveying an animal (basic) instinct that is suggested here.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the shapes. It gives it a rawness that lends itself well to conveying an animal (basic) instinct that is suggested here.', '2008-01-28 17:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434127, 638664, 65234, '<td valign="top">That looks like a baby Timneh.  Cute pose but the flash shadows and reflection are a little harsh.</td>', 'That looks like a baby Timneh.  Cute pose but the flash shadows and reflection are a little harsh.', '2008-01-28 17:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434132, 638777, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty funny pose :-)  Not sure what I think of the olive green (water?) background; it looks unreal.</td>', 'That''s a pretty funny pose :-)  Not sure what I think of the olive green (water?) background; it looks unreal.', '2008-01-28 17:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434136, 638901, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Some photos when you look at them you think there was probably a better moment missed but here this shows the critical moment between tiny bird and big bad peanut. Ok I''m being a little silly but I do like it.</td>', 'Very cute. Some photos when you look at them you think there was probably a better moment missed but here this shows the critical moment between tiny bird and big bad peanut. Ok I''m being a little silly but I do like it.', '2008-01-28 17:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434143, 638637, 41337, '<td valign="top">She looks proud. Not crazy about the background though.</td>', 'She looks proud. Not crazy about the background though.', '2008-01-28 17:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434153, 638915, 78110, '<td valign="top">hehe..nice one and nice title :)</td>', 'hehe..nice one and nice title :)', '2008-01-28 17:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434156, 638987, 78110, '<td valign="top">wow..perfect!</td>', 'wow..perfect!', '2008-01-28 17:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434159, 638832, 51597, '<td valign="top">Different perspective catchy title..</td>', 'Different perspective catchy title..', '2008-01-28 17:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434163, 638038, 85886, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite of the Bald Eagle shots submitted because of the closeness to the bird and the detail.  There''s a certain intimacy about this shot that separates it from the others for me.  I think it''s all in the fantastic detail and sparkle of the bird''s eye.</td>', 'This is my favourite of the Bald Eagle shots submitted because of the closeness to the bird and the detail.  There''s a certain intimacy about this shot that separates it from the others for me.  I think it''s all in the fantastic detail and sparkle of the bird''s eye.', '2008-01-28 17:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434164, 637912, 85886, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job in pp.  Love your vision and the accentuation of the existing colours.  Really striking and individual.</td>', 'Fantastic job in pp.  Love your vision and the accentuation of the existing colours.  Really striking and individual.', '2008-01-28 17:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434167, 637533, 85886, '<td valign="top">Good shot, dopey title.  The bird doesn''t have to be pin sharp for this shot, and the important part - the head - is in focus.  The movement in the wings just adds to the shot by implying movement and flights.  The crop/framing is also lovely with the internal symmetry of that window ledge.  Great textures on the wall too.  Don''t be so hard on yourself :)</td>', 'Good shot, dopey title.  The bird doesn''t have to be pin sharp for this shot, and the important part - the head - is in focus.  The movement in the wings just adds to the shot by implying movement and flights.  The crop/framing is also lovely with the internal symmetry of that window ledge.  Great textures on the wall too.  Don''t be so hard on yourself :)', '2008-01-28 17:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434168, 638929, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  At first I didn''t see the bread and was captivated (and impressed) by the sharpness of all the birds faces...then I saw the bread and it really made the photo.  Innovative and well executed.</td>', 'Great shot.  At first I didn''t see the bread and was captivated (and impressed) by the sharpness of all the birds faces...then I saw the bread and it really made the photo.  Innovative and well executed.', '2008-01-28 17:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434169, 638411, 85886, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Really works in black and white.  Also the only apparently non-Zoo or portrait bald eagle which is really refreshing to see.  Nice context and excellent definition.  Well done!</td>', 'Great shot.  Really works in black and white.  Also the only apparently non-Zoo or portrait bald eagle which is really refreshing to see.  Nice context and excellent definition.  Well done!', '2008-01-28 17:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434170, 638440, 51597, '<td valign="top">Pidgeons are a bird that is often overlooked  perhaps b/c city life ..<br/> <br/>Beautiful colors nice pose well presented.</td>', 'Pidgeons are a bird that is often overlooked  perhaps b/c city life .. Beautiful colors nice pose well presented.', '2008-01-28 17:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434172, 638130, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity here. The softness enhances the subject but it may be too soft as to suggest technical mistake but for me it''s fine. I do wish that dark reflection at the top was kept out of the shot either by waiting for the swan to move way from it or by cropping most of it. I think had you been able to do that and have a sharper shot (a prerequisite at DPC) this would have scored very well.</td>', 'I like the simplicity here. The softness enhances the subject but it may be too soft as to suggest technical mistake but for me it''s fine. I do wish that dark reflection at the top was kept out of the shot either by waiting for the swan to move way from it or by cropping most of it. I think had you been able to do that and have a sharper shot (a prerequisite at DPC) this would have scored very well.', '2008-01-28 17:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434179, 636871, 32848, '<td valign="top">I like the title!</td>', 'I like the title!', '2008-01-28 17:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434184, 638488, 87808, '<td valign="top">a 10 straight across the board, totally fabulous capture, well done.<br/> <br/>I hace come back to add to his picture.  The blues are intense, the legs are primeval, the shape of his wings whilst it is beating has created such a huge concave there that your eyes are drawn to them and certainly would be more drawn  to them than just being straight out in flight.  This was a brilliant shot, I totally love it.</td>', 'a 10 straight across the board, totally fabulous capture, well done. I hace come back to add to his picture.  The blues are intense, the legs are primeval, the shape of his wings whilst it is beating has created such a huge concave there that your eyes are drawn to them and certainly would be more drawn  to them than just being straight out in flight.  This was a brilliant shot, I totally love it.', '2008-01-28 17:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434185, 638038, 51597, '<td valign="top">They paid the price.. This works well from the top lft corner.. <br/> <br/>Excellent detail..</td>', 'They paid the price.. This works well from the top lft corner..  Excellent detail..', '2008-01-28 17:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4434186, 639017, 87808, '<td valign="top">well how fabulous is this shot.  crisp, clean, amazing colours not over processed.  10 straight across the board for this one.  well done<br/> <br/>this is my 4th or 5th time, re looking at this shot and have to comment again, I really like the background, it totally adds to the blueness of the bird.  I like that it is blurry, if it was crisp I think this would have been a flat photo.  Well done again</td>', 'well how fabulous is this shot.  crisp, clean, amazing colours not over processed.  10 straight across the board for this one.  well done this is my 4th or 5th time, re looking at this shot and have to comment again, I really like the background, it totally adds to the blueness of the bird.  I like that it is blurry, if it was crisp I think this would have been a flat photo.  Well done again', '2008-01-28 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
