(4435489, 638876, 68035, '<td valign="top">A wonderful action shot which has been caught very well technically.  I love the fact that you caught all the wings of the two protagonists and that you can follow the eyelines completely.  Very sharp and great dof<br/> <br/>A story captured in a single frame<br/> <br/>Brilliant</td>', 'A wonderful action shot which has been caught very well technically.  I love the fact that you caught all the wings of the two protagonists and that you can follow the eyelines completely.  Very sharp and great dof A story captured in a single frame Brilliant', '2008-01-29 01:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435492, 638209, 68035, '<td valign="top">There are some incredible shots of birds of prey in this challenge but this is (imo) the best of them.  Pin sharp, great dof anf a wonderful range of earthtones together with an expression on the bird of great intensity<br/> <br/>Brilliant</td>', 'There are some incredible shots of birds of prey in this challenge but this is (imo) the best of them.  Pin sharp, great dof anf a wonderful range of earthtones together with an expression on the bird of great intensity Brilliant', '2008-01-29 01:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435495, 637389, 68035, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of a duck in flight.  Love the composition of the shot and the gentle motion blur on the wings.  I like what appears to be the reflected setting sun in the water as well which gives the shot a sense of time</td>', 'Lovely capture of a duck in flight.  Love the composition of the shot and the gentle motion blur on the wings.  I like what appears to be the reflected setting sun in the water as well which gives the shot a sense of time', '2008-01-29 01:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435499, 639049, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well regardless of all the incredible close ups of birds in the challenge this shot has to be one of my favourites.  Fantastic capture and I love that you have both caught so many bird in the shot and the way that they form a what looks like a lazy scrawll acros the sky but which simultaeneously has a pattern and form to it<br/> <br/>Great B&amp;W coversion as well, the noise and softness adds wonderfully to the ambience of the picture<br/> <br/>Bump to 9</td>', 'Well regardless of all the incredible close ups of birds in the challenge this shot has to be one of my favourites.  Fantastic capture and I love that you have both caught so many bird in the shot and the way that they form a what looks like a lazy scrawll acros the sky but which simultaeneously has a pattern and form to it Great B&W coversion as well, the noise and softness adds wonderfully to the ambience of the picture Bump to 9', '2008-01-29 01:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
