(4435586, 637478, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Looks very sharp for a shot with a big DOF and fast action. The muted background really makes these guys stand out. You should go very well with this one.</td>', 'Great capture. Looks very sharp for a shot with a big DOF and fast action. The muted background really makes these guys stand out. You should go very well with this one.', '2008-01-29 03:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
