(4435596, 638943, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s that time of year where they are in pairs where I am, too.  Nice natural environment shot - the blend in with their surroundings which is good for them, not as good for us as photographers.  I do like the gray of the water.</td>', 'It''s that time of year where they are in pairs where I am, too.  Nice natural environment shot - the blend in with their surroundings which is good for them, not as good for us as photographers.  I do like the gray of the water.', '2008-01-29 03:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
