(4435712, 638241, 30982, '<td valign="top">A pretty bird - can''t say I''ve seen one of these before.  Nice soft light on him/her.</td>', 'A pretty bird - can''t say I''ve seen one of these before.  Nice soft light on him/her.', '2008-01-29 07:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435713, 638594, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely textbook pose!</td>', 'Lovely textbook pose!', '2008-01-29 07:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435714, 638686, 30982, '<td valign="top">He (or she - they have the same markings more or less) is actually a goose, not a duck.  An Egyptian goose, to be more specific.  I shoot a lot of these guys at a pond nearby and I originally mistook it for a duck as well.  Very solid composition to show the full bird, but a tad underexposed/lacking in contrast.  You may want to try a levels adjustment to bring up the highlights, and contrast adjustment as well.</td>', 'He (or she - they have the same markings more or less) is actually a goose, not a duck.  An Egyptian goose, to be more specific.  I shoot a lot of these guys at a pond nearby and I originally mistook it for a duck as well.  Very solid composition to show the full bird, but a tad underexposed/lacking in contrast.  You may want to try a levels adjustment to bring up the highlights, and contrast adjustment as well.', '2008-01-29 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435716, 638611, 30982, '<td valign="top">While some may see this as a bit of a cheat (it''s not a live bird) I think it meets the challenge well and is a pretty rendition of the sculpture.</td>', 'While some may see this as a bit of a cheat (it''s not a live bird) I think it meets the challenge well and is a pretty rendition of the sculpture.', '2008-01-29 07:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435718, 638595, 30982, '<td valign="top">Classic and quite lovely.  Really a lovely sky against which to shoot - and a very lovely bird.  Imparts a nice sense of peace and freedom.</td>', 'Classic and quite lovely.  Really a lovely sky against which to shoot - and a very lovely bird.  Imparts a nice sense of peace and freedom.', '2008-01-29 07:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435719, 638962, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Nice way to sneak an awesome land/seascape into the challenge.  :-)  I do like the ghosted gulls.</td>', 'Sweet!  Nice way to sneak an awesome land/seascape into the challenge.  :-)  I do like the ghosted gulls.', '2008-01-29 07:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435721, 638709, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a nice painterly sense to it.  I think you could crop off the crossbars on the top and have a bit stronger composition, but the diagonal of the bird and the direct gaze contribute well to this.</td>', 'Has a nice painterly sense to it.  I think you could crop off the crossbars on the top and have a bit stronger composition, but the diagonal of the bird and the direct gaze contribute well to this.', '2008-01-29 07:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435722, 638058, 30982, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a Vegas showgirl.  Nice pose!</td>', 'Reminds me of a Vegas showgirl.  Nice pose!', '2008-01-29 07:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435728, 638541, 30982, '<td valign="top">The strong light works well to allow you to have a dark background against which to showcase the light colored bird, but at the same time it along with the bird''s head and eye being centered creates a bit of a static image.  All depends on what your focus is for the presentation.</td>', 'The strong light works well to allow you to have a dark background against which to showcase the light colored bird, but at the same time it along with the bird''s head and eye being centered creates a bit of a static image.  All depends on what your focus is for the presentation.', '2008-01-29 07:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435729, 638135, 53147, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit too tight on the crop and too shallow a DOF. Good feather detail on what is sharp in focus. A decent shot overall, just lacking the wow power of some of the other entries.</td>', 'Maybe a bit too tight on the crop and too shallow a DOF. Good feather detail on what is sharp in focus. A decent shot overall, just lacking the wow power of some of the other entries.', '2008-01-29 07:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435730, 638547, 30982, '<td valign="top">Just a tad fuzzy but I really like the contrast of the ice and the water - makes for a very nice setting to display the duck.</td>', 'Just a tad fuzzy but I really like the contrast of the ice and the water - makes for a very nice setting to display the duck.', '2008-01-29 07:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435731, 639013, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good simple image. The negative space works - though I wish it wasnt as grainy as it is. A couple rounds of NI just on the sky could have made it smooth. Great light and detail on the gull.</td>', 'Good simple image. The negative space works - though I wish it wasnt as grainy as it is. A couple rounds of NI just on the sky could have made it smooth. Great light and detail on the gull.', '2008-01-29 07:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435733, 638547, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good colors but the overuse of NI or whatever noise program just gives it all a plasticky feel to it.</td>', 'Good colors but the overuse of NI or whatever noise program just gives it all a plasticky feel to it.', '2008-01-29 07:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435735, 639037, 30982, '<td valign="top">They don''t sit very often - very nice catch of this little guy!  Amazing purple in the feathers - very nicely offset with the gold (Mother Nature is an excellent color coordinator sometimes).  A touch of noise reduction (Neat Image or Noise Ninja or the like) would smooth out the background a bit, helping even more to highlight the detail and color of the feathers.</td>', 'They don''t sit very often - very nice catch of this little guy!  Amazing purple in the feathers - very nicely offset with the gold (Mother Nature is an excellent color coordinator sometimes).  A touch of noise reduction (Neat Image or Noise Ninja or the like) would smooth out the background a bit, helping even more to highlight the detail and color of the feathers.', '2008-01-29 07:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435736, 638979, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good stop motion capture, but his position doesnt grab me. I want to see more surface area of the bird.</td>', 'Good stop motion capture, but his position doesnt grab me. I want to see more surface area of the bird.', '2008-01-29 07:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435738, 638411, 30982, '<td valign="top">Marvelous capture, excellent detail, and works well in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Marvelous capture, excellent detail, and works well in B&W.', '2008-01-29 07:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435740, 637302, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice simple image. I wish the background was a bit less grainy.</td>', 'Nice simple image. I wish the background was a bit less grainy.', '2008-01-29 07:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435741, 638996, 30982, '<td valign="top">Like the opening number of a ballet.  I like this alot.</td>', 'Like the opening number of a ballet.  I like this alot.', '2008-01-29 07:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435743, 638234, 53147, '<td valign="top">My first reaction to this was "Why hello there!". Cool pose and striking gaze. Great vibrant colors. Bumping up 1.</td>', 'My first reaction to this was "Why hello there!". Cool pose and striking gaze. Great vibrant colors. Bumping up 1.', '2008-01-29 07:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435744, 638997, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cool looking bird. I like how his lower feathers are sweeping out the way they are. I think this could have been more striking as a black and white shot.</td>', 'Cool looking bird. I like how his lower feathers are sweeping out the way they are. I think this could have been more striking as a black and white shot.', '2008-01-29 07:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435745, 638883, 30982, '<td valign="top">I remarked on another eagle that he looked like an old guy in a brown feather suit.  This one (it must be the headshot approach) reminds me a portrait of the CEO of a large, rich corporation, that you''d see hanging on the wall of the boardroom.</td>', 'I remarked on another eagle that he looked like an old guy in a brown feather suit.  This one (it must be the headshot approach) reminds me a portrait of the CEO of a large, rich corporation, that you''d see hanging on the wall of the boardroom.', '2008-01-29 07:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435746, 637385, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Background is a tad noisy but the bird has great focus and detail.</td>', 'Great colors. Background is a tad noisy but the bird has great focus and detail.', '2008-01-29 07:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435747, 638094, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simplicity and elegance.  A simple bird, elegant in flight, offset by it''s natural environment (a sky and a tree!).  I like it.</td>', 'Simplicity and elegance.  A simple bird, elegant in flight, offset by it''s natural environment (a sky and a tree!).  I like it.', '2008-01-29 07:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435748, 638076, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cool bird, a bit soft in the focus.</td>', 'Cool bird, a bit soft in the focus.', '2008-01-29 07:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435750, 638865, 30982, '<td valign="top">You may get hammered for blowing the whites, but this wouldn''t be NEARLY as cool if you hadn''t!  And this is way cool.</td>', 'You may get hammered for blowing the whites, but this wouldn''t be NEARLY as cool if you hadn''t!  And this is way cool.', '2008-01-29 07:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435751, 637594, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cool location. Nice detail on the bird. Just has a good feel about it.</td>', 'Cool location. Nice detail on the bird. Just has a good feel about it.', '2008-01-29 07:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435752, 637868, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation!  Very birdlike in the facial expression, even without the paint, though that adds quite nicely.  Very well done shot as well.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation!  Very birdlike in the facial expression, even without the paint, though that adds quite nicely.  Very well done shot as well.', '2008-01-29 07:17:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4435753, 638969, 53147, '<td valign="top">Tough when these little boogers are buried in the branches. WIsh he was a bit more in focus, but I understand the challenges of shooting these guys.</td>', 'Tough when these little boogers are buried in the branches. WIsh he was a bit more in focus, but I understand the challenges of shooting these guys.', '2008-01-29 07:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435755, 638646, 53147, '<td valign="top">Something odd about the editing on this one. Maybe over sharpened some? Good "pose" and capture though.</td>', 'Something odd about the editing on this one. Maybe over sharpened some? Good "pose" and capture though.', '2008-01-29 07:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435759, 638613, 53147, '<td valign="top">Cool looking bird. I like how you got him framed in well with the branches rather than him behind the branches. A little dodging on his face could have brought out the details of his eyes.</td>', 'Cool looking bird. I like how you got him framed in well with the branches rather than him behind the branches. A little dodging on his face could have brought out the details of his eyes.', '2008-01-29 07:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435761, 639030, 53147, '<td valign="top">Colors are a bit over the top but overall works well. Very nice silhouette.</td>', 'Colors are a bit over the top but overall works well. Very nice silhouette.', '2008-01-29 07:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435762, 638985, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like how the whole bird is in the frame (no cropped tail like many of the others). I like the branch bokeh background. Birdie looks maybe a bit oversharpened, but a good capture overall. Bumping up 1.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like how the whole bird is in the frame (no cropped tail like many of the others). I like the branch bokeh background. Birdie looks maybe a bit oversharpened, but a good capture overall. Bumping up 1.', '2008-01-29 07:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435790, 638899, 43774, '<td valign="top">A lovely composition, the white on blue looks pleasing.</td>', 'A lovely composition, the white on blue looks pleasing.', '2008-01-29 07:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435791, 638722, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very good action shot, I like the colours in this.</td>', 'A very good action shot, I like the colours in this.', '2008-01-29 07:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435793, 638267, 43774, '<td valign="top">What a cool looking bird, no idea what this is. Great composition.</td>', 'What a cool looking bird, no idea what this is. Great composition.', '2008-01-29 07:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435795, 637977, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear, gorgeous colours that really stand out against the black background.</td>', 'Very sharp and clear, gorgeous colours that really stand out against the black background.', '2008-01-29 07:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435797, 638904, 43774, '<td valign="top">Ah the poor Muscovy Duck......not the prettiest duck around is it? A very good portrait, you got nice and close so we can see all the details.</td>', 'Ah the poor Muscovy Duck......not the prettiest duck around is it? A very good portrait, you got nice and close so we can see all the details.', '2008-01-29 07:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435798, 638707, 43774, '<td valign="top">You''re right, they can be beautiful. I like the composition here, he looks stately.</td>', 'You''re right, they can be beautiful. I like the composition here, he looks stately.', '2008-01-29 07:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435799, 637899, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is this a European Robin? Such a pretty little bird. I really like the compositon here. It does seem a little washed out, though, maybe more contrast would help.</td>', 'Is this a European Robin? Such a pretty little bird. I really like the compositon here. It does seem a little washed out, though, maybe more contrast would help.', '2008-01-29 07:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435800, 639014, 43774, '<td valign="top">So clear and sharp! And a very nice composition of the woodpecker too.</td>', 'So clear and sharp! And a very nice composition of the woodpecker too.', '2008-01-29 07:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435802, 638017, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and majestic, it almost doesn''t look real. Nice photo.</td>', 'Very beautiful and majestic, it almost doesn''t look real. Nice photo.', '2008-01-29 07:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435805, 637385, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen one of these before. Amazing colours, very good photo, you got close.</td>', 'I''ve never seen one of these before. Amazing colours, very good photo, you got close.', '2008-01-29 07:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435806, 638135, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cute bird, chickadees are sweet. It looks very nice in the snow, the light is perfect.</td>', 'Very cute bird, chickadees are sweet. It looks very nice in the snow, the light is perfect.', '2008-01-29 08:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435807, 638007, 43774, '<td valign="top">A wonderful photo showing its habitat, it really blends in well doesn''t it?</td>', 'A wonderful photo showing its habitat, it really blends in well doesn''t it?', '2008-01-29 08:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435808, 638960, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Your lighting is perfect here and the black background sets off the bird well.</td>', 'Very cute. Your lighting is perfect here and the black background sets off the bird well.', '2008-01-29 08:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435809, 639023, 43774, '<td valign="top">A wonderful action photo, it is not easy to get birds in flight.</td>', 'A wonderful action photo, it is not easy to get birds in flight.', '2008-01-29 08:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435812, 638536, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a bird like this before, is it a Quail? A very good photo, nice and clear with good colours.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a bird like this before, is it a Quail? A very good photo, nice and clear with good colours.', '2008-01-29 08:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435814, 637467, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is this an Emu? Cute photo, it''s like he''s laughing.</td>', 'Is this an Emu? Cute photo, it''s like he''s laughing.', '2008-01-29 08:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435815, 637325, 43774, '<td valign="top">You''ve really captured the colours of the Mallard well.</td>', 'You''ve really captured the colours of the Mallard well.', '2008-01-29 08:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435817, 638861, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is very clear, the colours are wonderful, I really like the bit of yellow around the beak.</td>', 'This is very clear, the colours are wonderful, I really like the bit of yellow around the beak.', '2008-01-29 08:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435820, 638816, 30982, '<td valign="top">She looks just a tad embarassed at the antics, like "I know, I know, but I''m stuck with him".  :-)  A fun shot.</td>', 'She looks just a tad embarassed at the antics, like "I know, I know, but I''m stuck with him".  :-)  A fun shot.', '2008-01-29 08:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435821, 638633, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and clean - the color of the background suits this very well.</td>', 'Simple and clean - the color of the background suits this very well.', '2008-01-29 08:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435823, 638578, 43774, '<td valign="top">So clear, a lovely composition with the back of the bird providing a nice background</td>', 'So clear, a lovely composition with the back of the bird providing a nice background', '2008-01-29 08:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435824, 638661, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cute, nice and clear.</td>', 'Very cute, nice and clear.', '2008-01-29 08:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435825, 638995, 30982, '<td valign="top">That''s one well trained bird!</td>', 'That''s one well trained bird!', '2008-01-29 08:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435827, 638768, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh! I forget the scale for scoring dives these days.  But yes, a nice entry on this one.</td>', 'Heh! I forget the scale for scoring dives these days.  But yes, a nice entry on this one.', '2008-01-29 08:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435828, 638270, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is funny and surreal all at once. It''s like the bird is being watched, or someone is afraid of the bird, it''s so many things at once.</td>', 'This is funny and surreal all at once. It''s like the bird is being watched, or someone is afraid of the bird, it''s so many things at once.', '2008-01-29 08:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435830, 638883, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the feathers, good composition.</td>', 'Nice detail in the feathers, good composition.', '2008-01-29 08:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435831, 638827, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool looking bird, love the colours.</td>', 'Cool looking bird, love the colours.', '2008-01-29 08:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435832, 638754, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s a different looking pigeon than the ones I''m used to seeing.  He''s colored well to blend in with his native surroundings.</td>', 'It''s a different looking pigeon than the ones I''m used to seeing.  He''s colored well to blend in with his native surroundings.', '2008-01-29 08:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435833, 638607, 43774, '<td valign="top">So colourful, a nice photo.</td>', 'So colourful, a nice photo.', '2008-01-29 08:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435836, 638209, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear and detailed, good colours, a good photo.</td>', 'Very clear and detailed, good colours, a good photo.', '2008-01-29 08:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435837, 637428, 30982, '<td valign="top">This shot is a good one to show how they tuck their feet in during flight.</td>', 'This shot is a good one to show how they tuck their feet in during flight.', '2008-01-29 08:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435838, 638455, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and composition. Is this your''s Bear? Are these wild swans?</td>', 'Lovely colours and composition. Is this your''s Bear? Are these wild swans?', '2008-01-29 08:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435843, 638916, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing capture and I am wondering if this is a wild or captive eagle....you got so close! It looks like you added some artificial lighting or vignetting and I am not sure I like that but I like everything else.</td>', 'This is an amazing capture and I am wondering if this is a wild or captive eagle....you got so close! It looks like you added some artificial lighting or vignetting and I am not sure I like that but I like everything else.', '2008-01-29 08:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435844, 638622, 43774, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait of Mr. and Mrs. Mallard, very nice light and colours.</td>', 'A lovely portrait of Mr. and Mrs. Mallard, very nice light and colours.', '2008-01-29 08:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435846, 638537, 43774, '<td valign="top">And a beautiful heron it is! A very nice composition.</td>', 'And a beautiful heron it is! A very nice composition.', '2008-01-29 08:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435848, 638987, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the pose/capture. I''ve never seen a hummingbird before and I can imagine they are hard to capture in flight.</td>', 'Love the pose/capture. I''ve never seen a hummingbird before and I can imagine they are hard to capture in flight.', '2008-01-29 08:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435849, 638987, 30982, '<td valign="top">Joyful, light, and delicate!  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Joyful, light, and delicate!  Very nicely done.', '2008-01-29 08:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435851, 638038, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very nice portrait and composition. The beak on Eagles just amazes me.</td>', 'A very nice portrait and composition. The beak on Eagles just amazes me.', '2008-01-29 08:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435852, 638876, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wonderful action shot, very clear and detailed.</td>', 'Wonderful action shot, very clear and detailed.', '2008-01-29 08:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435853, 638650, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure on the bird.  Is the reflection is coaxed a bit in post?  Amazing clarity, and it''s gorgeous just the same.</td>', 'Excellent exposure on the bird.  Is the reflection is coaxed a bit in post?  Amazing clarity, and it''s gorgeous just the same.', '2008-01-29 08:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435855, 637393, 43774, '<td valign="top">So cute! A very good composition showing the bird in its natural surroundings. Is this a sparrow of some sort?</td>', 'So cute! A very good composition showing the bird in its natural surroundings. Is this a sparrow of some sort?', '2008-01-29 08:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435856, 637977, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, how sweet!  He looks so shy.  Wonderful title.</td>', 'Oh, how sweet!  He looks so shy.  Wonderful title.', '2008-01-29 08:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435857, 638411, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely action shot, this can''t be easy to get.</td>', 'Lovely action shot, this can''t be easy to get.', '2008-01-29 08:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435858, 639013, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here.</td>', 'I really like the composition here.', '2008-01-29 08:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435859, 638777, 43774, '<td valign="top">Such a cool photo, wow he''s got a big bill. Very clear and detailed.</td>', 'Such a cool photo, wow he''s got a big bill. Very clear and detailed.', '2008-01-29 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435882, 638274, 30982, '<td valign="top">This was the first thumbnail I checked when glancing through the challenge.  It''s sad and poignant and I love that you did it in B&amp;W and did not include the whole bird.  Excellent.</td>', 'This was the first thumbnail I checked when glancing through the challenge.  It''s sad and poignant and I love that you did it in B&W and did not include the whole bird.  Excellent.', '2008-01-29 08:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435884, 638722, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well done - great color and clarity, excellent composition for a frenzy.  Love the two mouths approaching from underneath and the guy looking in from the bend of the wings.</td>', 'Very well done - great color and clarity, excellent composition for a frenzy.  Love the two mouths approaching from underneath and the guy looking in from the bend of the wings.', '2008-01-29 08:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435885, 638905, 30982, '<td valign="top">They remind me of spectators - parents - at a kids'' soccer match.</td>', 'They remind me of spectators - parents - at a kids'' soccer match.', '2008-01-29 08:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435888, 638111, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good clarity here.  Comosition would have been a bit better without the guy trying to get into the shot on the left, but I do like the guy sneaking in underneath.</td>', 'Good clarity here.  Comosition would have been a bit better without the guy trying to get into the shot on the left, but I do like the guy sneaking in underneath.', '2008-01-29 08:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435890, 638820, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a colorful thing!  I like how the feather are so "dressy" on the front.  Nicely captured to show off this pretty bird.</td>', 'What a colorful thing!  I like how the feather are so "dressy" on the front.  Nicely captured to show off this pretty bird.', '2008-01-29 08:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435891, 638997, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good capture in a natural setting.</td>', 'A good capture in a natural setting.', '2008-01-29 08:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435894, 638666, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of green and blue "fringing" around the branches that I think is called "chromic abberation" or some such thing but is the result of shooting in a very bright light situation.  Your best bet is to try underexposing a bit, or maybe use a neutral density filter (or so I''ve heard) to combat this.</td>', 'There''s a lot of green and blue "fringing" around the branches that I think is called "chromic abberation" or some such thing but is the result of shooting in a very bright light situation.  Your best bet is to try underexposing a bit, or maybe use a neutral density filter (or so I''ve heard) to combat this.', '2008-01-29 08:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435896, 638039, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s a different approach!  Technicals as far as focus and clarity are good.  I like how the shadow provides a perch for the "bird".</td>', 'It''s a different approach!  Technicals as far as focus and clarity are good.  I like how the shadow provides a perch for the "bird".', '2008-01-29 08:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435898, 638343, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clean and soft and gentle.  Nicely presented.  She may be plainer than her male counterpart, but she has a quiet beauty of her own.</td>', 'Clean and soft and gentle.  Nicely presented.  She may be plainer than her male counterpart, but she has a quiet beauty of her own.', '2008-01-29 08:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435902, 638684, 30982, '<td valign="top">Your title suits this very well - it does appear very graceful by virtue of the lovely curved composition, the turn of the head.  Excellent detail.</td>', 'Your title suits this very well - it does appear very graceful by virtue of the lovely curved composition, the turn of the head.  Excellent detail.', '2008-01-29 08:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435903, 638475, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how it blends in so nicely with its surroundings colorwise, yet is quite clear as the point of focus in the picture.</td>', 'I like how it blends in so nicely with its surroundings colorwise, yet is quite clear as the point of focus in the picture.', '2008-01-29 08:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435905, 638782, 30982, '<td valign="top">The water is gorgeous!  Detail on the duck is pretty good, too.  A very lovely canvas.</td>', 'The water is gorgeous!  Detail on the duck is pretty good, too.  A very lovely canvas.', '2008-01-29 08:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435907, 638903, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good detail, nice presentation.  The bokeh and setting contribute well to this.</td>', 'Good detail, nice presentation.  The bokeh and setting contribute well to this.', '2008-01-29 08:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435909, 638596, 30982, '<td valign="top">The softness and warmth are wonderful.  I love the independent statement of the one duck, while the others carry on, he''s considering other options.</td>', 'The softness and warmth are wonderful.  I love the independent statement of the one duck, while the others carry on, he''s considering other options.', '2008-01-29 08:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435922, 638491, 30982, '<td valign="top">Warmly minimal.  From a technical standpoint, there''s a bit of haloing around the bird - which may well be semi-natural given the contrasting shapes/colors, but if not you may want to fix it if you intend to keep/print the shot (which I recommend.)</td>', 'Warmly minimal.  From a technical standpoint, there''s a bit of haloing around the bird - which may well be semi-natural given the contrasting shapes/colors, but if not you may want to fix it if you intend to keep/print the shot (which I recommend.)', '2008-01-29 08:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435928, 638922, 30982, '<td valign="top">This scares me.  I''d imagine it might scare small children as well.  But then you see the giraffe and zebra legs and realize that any parrot/giraffe/zebra combination couldn''t possibly be harmful.  Or could it??</td>', 'This scares me.  I''d imagine it might scare small children as well.  But then you see the giraffe and zebra legs and realize that any parrot/giraffe/zebra combination couldn''t possibly be harmful.  Or could it??', '2008-01-29 08:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
