(4435934, 638662, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good in-flight capture.  Kinda hard to separate these guys from the background, but I''m pretty sure nature intended it that way to some extent.  I like the way the purple feathers on the wing kinda look like aircraft flaps.  Or is that vice versa?</td>', 'Good in-flight capture.  Kinda hard to separate these guys from the background, but I''m pretty sure nature intended it that way to some extent.  I like the way the purple feathers on the wing kinda look like aircraft flaps.  Or is that vice versa?', '2008-01-29 08:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435935, 638782, 79955, '<td valign="top">The colors captured in this image is fabulous</td>', 'The colors captured in this image is fabulous', '2008-01-29 08:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4435939, 638985, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s neat to see the feather detail above the beak - not sure I''ve seen that before!  Good use of natural framing while still keeping your bird as the foreground presentation.</td>', 'It''s neat to see the feather detail above the beak - not sure I''ve seen that before!  Good use of natural framing while still keeping your bird as the foreground presentation.', '2008-01-29 08:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
