(4436182, 639014, 88010, '<td valign="top">Focus is ok and the composition is ok but I think with backlighting you need to lighten it up a bit. Also the catchlight in the eye is weak. God catchlight really adds life to animal portraits.</td>', 'Focus is ok and the composition is ok but I think with backlighting you need to lighten it up a bit. Also the catchlight in the eye is weak. God catchlight really adds life to animal portraits.', '2008-01-29 10:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436186, 638655, 88010, '<td valign="top">I love watching these little guys go up and down the trunks. This shot is very out of focus, plus the background is too bright and the colors in the background detract from the bird and last of all he is too small in the frame.</td>', 'I love watching these little guys go up and down the trunks. This shot is very out of focus, plus the background is too bright and the colors in the background detract from the bird and last of all he is too small in the frame.', '2008-01-29 10:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436194, 638929, 88010, '<td valign="top">Kind of a high key bird shot action shot. great idea, good composition. I would prefer to see them a little sharper by using a faster shutter speed and of course the slice of bread really ruins the shot ( I know it''s part of the title but still ).</td>', 'Kind of a high key bird shot action shot. great idea, good composition. I would prefer to see them a little sharper by using a faster shutter speed and of course the slice of bread really ruins the shot ( I know it''s part of the title but still ).', '2008-01-29 10:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436202, 639046, 88010, '<td valign="top">I like to look at photo''s and ask what the main character is. In this shot the main character sems to be the long hillside that dominates the center of the photo. I would define this as a scenic shot that has a few geese in it, I would not say it''s about the geese at all.</td>', 'I like to look at photo''s and ask what the main character is. In this shot the main character sems to be the long hillside that dominates the center of the photo. I would define this as a scenic shot that has a few geese in it, I would not say it''s about the geese at all.', '2008-01-29 10:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436205, 638316, 88010, '<td valign="top">It''s unfortunate that we can see the pattern of the fence in the background. Also, the feathers are lacking in detail from overexposure or too much contrast or a little of both. It''s much too bright.</td>', 'It''s unfortunate that we can see the pattern of the fence in the background. Also, the feathers are lacking in detail from overexposure or too much contrast or a little of both. It''s much too bright.', '2008-01-29 10:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436209, 638969, 88010, '<td valign="top">This is exactly how cardinals in my area act too. They hide in the bushes. He is a little on the soft focused side, and the branches look like they have been sharpened too much. Your colors and saturation are perfect and yor composition is wonderful.</td>', 'This is exactly how cardinals in my area act too. They hide in the bushes. He is a little on the soft focused side, and the branches look like they have been sharpened too much. Your colors and saturation are perfect and yor composition is wonderful.', '2008-01-29 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436212, 637542, 88010, '<td valign="top">The feather detail in the whites are blown out with too much contrast or overexposure. The focus is a little soft. It would also look better in landscape instead of portrait because the subjet is long not tall.</td>', 'The feather detail in the whites are blown out with too much contrast or overexposure. The focus is a little soft. It would also look better in landscape instead of portrait because the subjet is long not tall.', '2008-01-29 10:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436217, 638094, 88010, '<td valign="top">decent shot of a moving bird. Focus is acceptable, dof OK, colors and contrast ok. But the tree really draws the eye off to the left. A more even background, eiother all tree or all sky would have improved this otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'decent shot of a moving bird. Focus is acceptable, dof OK, colors and contrast ok. But the tree really draws the eye off to the left. A more even background, eiother all tree or all sky would have improved this otherwise nice shot.', '2008-01-29 10:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436219, 637564, 88010, '<td valign="top">Goos action shot on this duck. Contrast is a little too high as it blows out detail in the whites, but otherwise a good shot with nice saturation, composition and colors.</td>', 'Goos action shot on this duck. Contrast is a little too high as it blows out detail in the whites, but otherwise a good shot with nice saturation, composition and colors.', '2008-01-29 10:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436221, 638058, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up/portrait shot. good colors and contrast and something most other bird shots are missing and that is a nice catchlight in the eye.Focus is good on the eye right whee it nees to be. The best I''ve seen so far, but also the first domesticated shot I''ve seen.</td>', 'Nice close-up/portrait shot. good colors and contrast and something most other bird shots are missing and that is a nice catchlight in the eye.Focus is good on the eye right whee it nees to be. The best I''ve seen so far, but also the first domesticated shot I''ve seen.', '2008-01-29 10:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436223, 638816, 88010, '<td valign="top">Well, bottoms up. Nice catch. Good colors and contrast and not over-saturated. Focus is good. Catchlight in the eyes is missing, this can be done with fill flash and that would have helped ballance the light with this shot. As it is the whites are a bit blown out.</td>', 'Well, bottoms up. Nice catch. Good colors and contrast and not over-saturated. Focus is good. Catchlight in the eyes is missing, this can be done with fill flash and that would have helped ballance the light with this shot. As it is the whites are a bit blown out.', '2008-01-29 10:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436224, 637454, 88010, '<td valign="top">The bird is very soft and not focused well. Colors and contrast ok. Composition ok but really not all that interesting. The bird almost looks afraid and not all that happy with the situation.</td>', 'The bird is very soft and not focused well. Colors and contrast ok. Composition ok but really not all that interesting. The bird almost looks afraid and not all that happy with the situation.', '2008-01-29 10:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436227, 638646, 88010, '<td valign="top">The best flight shot I''ve seen so far. It would be better if the bird were a little higher and had even background behind it ( the wing dips into the dark area) by shooting from a lower viewpoint that could have been acheived. Also the eye has no catchlight which is very important in nature shots. Otherwise a really nice shot.</td>', 'The best flight shot I''ve seen so far. It would be better if the bird were a little higher and had even background behind it ( the wing dips into the dark area) by shooting from a lower viewpoint that could have been acheived. Also the eye has no catchlight which is very important in nature shots. Otherwise a really nice shot.', '2008-01-29 10:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436231, 638754, 80908, '<td valign="top">A little too centred for the composition, and not quite as sharp as it could be. Nice timing though.</td>', 'A little too centred for the composition, and not quite as sharp as it could be. Nice timing though.', '2008-01-29 10:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
