(4436467, 638241, 51597, '<td valign="top">He has character!!  Nice capture of Mr. Red Poll @ the lunch bar..</td>', 'He has character!!  Nice capture of Mr. Red Poll @ the lunch bar..', '2008-01-29 12:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436472, 637977, 51597, '<td valign="top">Very handsome indeed...</td>', 'Very handsome indeed...', '2008-01-29 12:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436473, 638468, 88010, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot, good colors and contrast and saturation. It''s a bit soft, but I guess that could be low megapix or too much crop. Otherwise a very nice photo. Nice catchlight in the eyes !!!</td>', 'wonderful shot, good colors and contrast and saturation. It''s a bit soft, but I guess that could be low megapix or too much crop. Otherwise a very nice photo. Nice catchlight in the eyes !!!', '2008-01-29 12:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436477, 638682, 88010, '<td valign="top">Good composition on this two point landing. cantrast and colors look right, a little hot on the top side burning out detail in the feathers and a little soft. A fill flash would have added a catchlight in the eyes and really helped this shot. Otherwise very nice.</td>', 'Good composition on this two point landing. cantrast and colors look right, a little hot on the top side burning out detail in the feathers and a little soft. A fill flash would have added a catchlight in the eyes and really helped this shot. Otherwise very nice.', '2008-01-29 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436480, 638975, 88010, '<td valign="top">A bit soft. Very nice colors. Maybe too much background and that allows the background to dominate the photo. I think landscape would have worked better than portrait here.</td>', 'A bit soft. Very nice colors. Maybe too much background and that allows the background to dominate the photo. I think landscape would have worked better than portrait here.', '2008-01-29 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436486, 638991, 88010, '<td valign="top">A fur ball with eyes and beak. Nice composition, good colors and contrast. A little soft in the focus as I can''t really make out a lot of detail in the feathers but better than many I''ve seen today. Nice work.</td>', 'A fur ball with eyes and beak. Nice composition, good colors and contrast. A little soft in the focus as I can''t really make out a lot of detail in the feathers but better than many I''ve seen today. Nice work.', '2008-01-29 12:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436493, 639027, 88010, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft or too much crop. Colors and contrast are ok. Compositon might be a little too centered top to bottom for the three geese.</td>', 'Focus is a little soft or too much crop. Colors and contrast are ok. Compositon might be a little too centered top to bottom for the three geese.', '2008-01-29 12:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436498, 638998, 88010, '<td valign="top">Focus on the head is one of the better I''ve seen today, it''s nice and crisp. The composition is a little too far right , another words he has more space behind him than in front of him, giving us the feeling he is leaving the frame of the photo. What is better is when the subject is moving within the photo and has more room in front of   him than behind. The exposure is about one stop overexposed leaving little detail in the white feathers. Other than that a good shot.</td>', 'Focus on the head is one of the better I''ve seen today, it''s nice and crisp. The composition is a little too far right , another words he has more space behind him than in front of him, giving us the feeling he is leaving the frame of the photo. What is better is when the subject is moving within the photo and has more room in front of   him than behind. The exposure is about one stop overexposed leaving little detail in the white feathers. Other than that a good shot.', '2008-01-29 12:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436502, 638286, 88010, '<td valign="top">A rather cute pose. Good catchlight in the eye. I wish he was turned just slightly so we could see the beak a little beter, but....it is what it is. Focus, color and saturation all seem just fine. Nice job.</td>', 'A rather cute pose. Good catchlight in the eye. I wish he was turned just slightly so we could see the beak a little beter, but....it is what it is. Focus, color and saturation all seem just fine. Nice job.', '2008-01-29 12:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436521, 638769, 18216, '<td valign="top">I love pidgeons! Nice clear shot of their orange eyes!</td>', 'I love pidgeons! Nice clear shot of their orange eyes!', '2008-01-29 12:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436524, 639013, 18216, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and pose!</td>', 'Nice framing and pose!', '2008-01-29 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436525, 639036, 18216, '<td valign="top">So inquisitive looking! Nice capture of the birds personality.</td>', 'So inquisitive looking! Nice capture of the birds personality.', '2008-01-29 12:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436526, 638957, 88010, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft around the eyes, but nice catchlight in the eyes. Colors might be a bit over-saturated for my taste. And I wish he was off to the right of the screen since he is moving left. That way he is moving into the scene and not out of the center of the photo.</td>', 'Focus is soft around the eyes, but nice catchlight in the eyes. Colors might be a bit over-saturated for my taste. And I wish he was off to the right of the screen since he is moving left. That way he is moving into the scene and not out of the center of the photo.', '2008-01-29 12:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436530, 638987, 18216, '<td valign="top">Wow. Just...Wow. I''ve tried to get a shot like this - I guess this inspires me to keep trying! 10</td>', 'Wow. Just...Wow. I''ve tried to get a shot like this - I guess this inspires me to keep trying! 10', '2008-01-29 12:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436533, 638735, 18216, '<td valign="top">How precious! I really like the glint in the eye.</td>', 'How precious! I really like the glint in the eye.', '2008-01-29 12:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436536, 638865, 18216, '<td valign="top">How awesome! definate poster quality. Please let us know where and how you got this shot!</td>', 'How awesome! definate poster quality. Please let us know where and how you got this shot!', '2008-01-29 12:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436538, 637564, 18216, '<td valign="top">great action shot. I had to look twice to see that there ARE feet!</td>', 'great action shot. I had to look twice to see that there ARE feet!', '2008-01-29 12:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436539, 637538, 18216, '<td valign="top">I love the way that the hawk blends in his/her environment. Nice eye!</td>', 'I love the way that the hawk blends in his/her environment. Nice eye!', '2008-01-29 12:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436543, 638793, 18216, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot of the bird. I wish the background were a different color so that the beak stood out more. Still, very nice.</td>', 'Nice clear shot of the bird. I wish the background were a different color so that the beak stood out more. Still, very nice.', '2008-01-29 13:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436546, 637844, 18216, '<td valign="top">nice saturation of color! this birds looks very calm.</td>', 'nice saturation of color! this birds looks very calm.', '2008-01-29 13:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436548, 638924, 18216, '<td valign="top">I can see that it is cold! All fluffed up, isnt he/her? nice placement of the bird in this picture.</td>', 'I can see that it is cold! All fluffed up, isnt he/her? nice placement of the bird in this picture.', '2008-01-29 13:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436552, 639009, 18216, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity of the face and feathers!</td>', 'I love the clarity of the face and feathers!', '2008-01-29 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436554, 638827, 18216, '<td valign="top">This bird is posing for you! Nice colors and placement.</td>', 'This bird is posing for you! Nice colors and placement.', '2008-01-29 13:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436555, 638997, 18216, '<td valign="top">Cute title. The fanned out feathers was the first thing I noticed. I can see this on a poster or postcard!</td>', 'Cute title. The fanned out feathers was the first thing I noticed. I can see this on a poster or postcard!', '2008-01-29 13:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436560, 639049, 18216, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see your title until after I gazed at the picture for a few minutes. Exactly what I was thinking! You''ve made this a very interesting shot. Nice desaturation and focus. 10</td>', 'I didn''t see your title until after I gazed at the picture for a few minutes. Exactly what I was thinking! You''ve made this a very interesting shot. Nice desaturation and focus. 10', '2008-01-29 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436563, 638943, 18216, '<td valign="top">How precious! I like that I can also see their reflection in the water.</td>', 'How precious! I like that I can also see their reflection in the water.', '2008-01-29 13:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436564, 638537, 18216, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and crop. I really enjoy the contrast between the shadows and light.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and crop. I really enjoy the contrast between the shadows and light.', '2008-01-29 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436567, 637385, 18216, '<td valign="top">Wow. So beautiful and ugly at the same time! Great colors and detail. Facinating to look at!</td>', 'Wow. So beautiful and ugly at the same time! Great colors and detail. Facinating to look at!', '2008-01-29 13:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436569, 637389, 18216, '<td valign="top">I really like the motion shots. Good job on getting the focus on the head!</td>', 'I really like the motion shots. Good job on getting the focus on the head!', '2008-01-29 13:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436570, 638130, 18216, '<td valign="top">very etheral. I like the colors of black and white with a hint of color on the bill.</td>', 'very etheral. I like the colors of black and white with a hint of color on the bill.', '2008-01-29 13:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436571, 637980, 18216, '<td valign="top">looking right at you! How cool!</td>', 'looking right at you! How cool!', '2008-01-29 13:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436577, 638812, 18216, '<td valign="top">Is that the nest on the ground? very interesting bird - nicely done. I would have perhaps vropped a bit differently - put the bird more to the right so we get more of an idea of what it is looking at.  Just a thought...</td>', 'Is that the nest on the ground? very interesting bird - nicely done. I would have perhaps vropped a bit differently - put the bird more to the right so we get more of an idea of what it is looking at.  Just a thought...', '2008-01-29 13:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436581, 638922, 18216, '<td valign="top">Without the reflection, this could have been a more interesting shot.</td>', 'Without the reflection, this could have been a more interesting shot.', '2008-01-29 13:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436582, 637467, 18216, '<td valign="top">funny title to match the head! Very nice job in getting the entire head in focus.</td>', 'funny title to match the head! Very nice job in getting the entire head in focus.', '2008-01-29 13:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436586, 636618, 18216, '<td valign="top">I see the curiousity in the bird! Nice colors! I''m glad there wasnt a flash glare! Nice.</td>', 'I see the curiousity in the bird! Nice colors! I''m glad there wasnt a flash glare! Nice.', '2008-01-29 13:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436589, 637956, 18216, '<td valign="top">The details in the shot makes it awesome. Nice job!</td>', 'The details in the shot makes it awesome. Nice job!', '2008-01-29 13:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436592, 638777, 18216, '<td valign="top">Nice timeing! This shot makes me laugh every time I see it!</td>', 'Nice timeing! This shot makes me laugh every time I see it!', '2008-01-29 13:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436593, 637478, 18216, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus on this motion shot! Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful focus on this motion shot! Nicely done.', '2008-01-29 13:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436594, 638076, 43774, '<td valign="top">A fascinating looking bird, a good composition with him almost coming out of the frame to us.</td>', 'A fascinating looking bird, a good composition with him almost coming out of the frame to us.', '2008-01-29 13:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436598, 638225, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours in the peacock, you captured it''s grandness well.</td>', 'Beautiful colours in the peacock, you captured it''s grandness well.', '2008-01-29 13:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436599, 638475, 43774, '<td valign="top">And a colourful background too....nice!</td>', 'And a colourful background too....nice!', '2008-01-29 13:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436602, 638488, 43774, '<td valign="top">Yes, very prehistoric looking! Lovely in flight capture, that can''t be easy.</td>', 'Yes, very prehistoric looking! Lovely in flight capture, that can''t be easy.', '2008-01-29 13:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436605, 638755, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute title, they''re all lined up for him.</td>', 'Cute title, they''re all lined up for him.', '2008-01-29 13:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436607, 638232, 43774, '<td valign="top">A dramatic photo, maybe a little too dark for some. Good composition.</td>', 'A dramatic photo, maybe a little too dark for some. Good composition.', '2008-01-29 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436608, 638928, 43774, '<td valign="top">It almost blends into the rocks, a good habitat photo.</td>', 'It almost blends into the rocks, a good habitat photo.', '2008-01-29 13:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436609, 638316, 43774, '<td valign="top">Fierce looking bird. A bit bright but a good composition.</td>', 'Fierce looking bird. A bit bright but a good composition.', '2008-01-29 13:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436612, 638881, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo, good detail and composition.</td>', 'A very nice photo, good detail and composition.', '2008-01-29 13:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436614, 638915, 43774, '<td valign="top">A gull and a Merganser (I think, could be a Grebe), nice capture!</td>', 'A gull and a Merganser (I think, could be a Grebe), nice capture!', '2008-01-29 13:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436615, 638680, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very good colours, a nice minimalistic photo.</td>', 'Very good colours, a nice minimalistic photo.', '2008-01-29 13:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436619, 638087, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear and detailed, very good photo.</td>', 'Very clear and detailed, very good photo.', '2008-01-29 13:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436620, 637453, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the bluish tones in this.</td>', 'I like the bluish tones in this.', '2008-01-29 13:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436621, 637422, 43774, '<td valign="top">A cute little bird and a good capture to get him with a seed/berry in his mouth.</td>', 'A cute little bird and a good capture to get him with a seed/berry in his mouth.', '2008-01-29 13:20:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4436623, 638997, 43774, '<td valign="top">That is a lovely bird and you''ve caught some nice details in the feathers.</td>', 'That is a lovely bird and you''ve caught some nice details in the feathers.', '2008-01-29 13:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436624, 637594, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, nice photo. Lucky for him someone is looking out for him and providing him with all those seeds.</td>', 'Very clear, nice photo. Lucky for him someone is looking out for him and providing him with all those seeds.', '2008-01-29 13:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436625, 638547, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. A little too much saturation and maybe too much sharpening, but other than that nice. Good catchlight in the eye. Maybe cropped a little too tight as he has no place to go. I think he should have more open space in front of him to accentuate the feeling that he might move that way. As it is the end of the pic is right at his nose and it sort of imprisons him there.</td>', 'Nice capture. A little too much saturation and maybe too much sharpening, but other than that nice. Good catchlight in the eye. Maybe cropped a little too tight as he has no place to go. I think he should have more open space in front of him to accentuate the feeling that he might move that way. As it is the end of the pic is right at his nose and it sort of imprisons him there.', '2008-01-29 13:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436626, 639031, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love wood ducks, they are so colourful! This is a very clear photo.</td>', 'I love wood ducks, they are so colourful! This is a very clear photo.', '2008-01-29 13:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436628, 638924, 43774, '<td valign="top">Yes, it must be cold the way the bird is all puffed up. Not sure what type of bird this is, maybe a sparrow? I like the composition.</td>', 'Yes, it must be cold the way the bird is all puffed up. Not sure what type of bird this is, maybe a sparrow? I like the composition.', '2008-01-29 13:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436633, 637589, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour. Shame about that one little twig in front.</td>', 'Very nice colour. Shame about that one little twig in front.', '2008-01-29 13:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436634, 638135, 88010, '<td valign="top">Cropped a littel too tight, the focus is a bit soft. he needs a catchlight in the eye ( this can be done with fill flash). And he is too far to the right not leaving him any room to move within the framing of the photo. colors, contrast and exposure are excellent.</td>', 'Cropped a littel too tight, the focus is a bit soft. he needs a catchlight in the eye ( this can be done with fill flash). And he is too far to the right not leaving him any room to move within the framing of the photo. colors, contrast and exposure are excellent.', '2008-01-29 13:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436635, 639009, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is this an eagle? A nice photo, it really stands out against the blue sky.</td>', 'Is this an eagle? A nice photo, it really stands out against the blue sky.', '2008-01-29 13:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436637, 638286, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute! I don''t think I would have picked up on that if not for your title. Very nice colours, the background has almost the same colours as the blue jay.</td>', 'Cute! I don''t think I would have picked up on that if not for your title. Very nice colours, the background has almost the same colours as the blue jay.', '2008-01-29 13:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436638, 638942, 43774, '<td valign="top">A pretty pose, very demure looking.</td>', 'A pretty pose, very demure looking.', '2008-01-29 13:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436639, 637470, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute title! Nice detail in the feathers.</td>', 'Cute title! Nice detail in the feathers.', '2008-01-29 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436641, 638755, 88010, '<td valign="top">Good title :)<br/>I would crop out about inch off the top, just above the last bird in line, leaving less dead spce at the top. Good exposure, colors and contrast. Nice job.</td>', 'Good title :)I would crop out about inch off the top, just above the last bird in line, leaving less dead spce at the top. Good exposure, colors and contrast. Nice job.', '2008-01-29 13:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436643, 636961, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The birds are flying close together but we can see from the shadows that there are two.</td>', 'Very nice! The birds are flying close together but we can see from the shadows that there are two.', '2008-01-29 13:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436646, 637815, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF to separate the bird from the background, nice comparison between the gull and the surfer.</td>', 'Nice DOF to separate the bird from the background, nice comparison between the gull and the surfer.', '2008-01-29 13:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436649, 638793, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail in the bird, shame the head almost gets lost in the background.</td>', 'Very nice detail in the bird, shame the head almost gets lost in the background.', '2008-01-29 13:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436650, 637814, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very good. Even though the subject takes up very little of the composition he still becomes the main subject. Good use of B&amp;W , nice contrast, focus looks ok. Nice job.</td>', 'Very good. Even though the subject takes up very little of the composition he still becomes the main subject. Good use of B&W , nice contrast, focus looks ok. Nice job.', '2008-01-29 13:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436651, 638094, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''m looking at the birdie! :) A very good in flight capture, I can never seem to get those.</td>', 'I''m looking at the birdie! :) A very good in flight capture, I can never seem to get those.', '2008-01-29 13:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436653, 638686, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool looking duck, I''ve never seen one like that before. Love the surroundings.</td>', 'Cool looking duck, I''ve never seen one like that before. Love the surroundings.', '2008-01-29 13:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436655, 638468, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see more of the bird but I can see where you are going with this, showing us the bird and the bees and the habitat.</td>', 'I''d love to see more of the bird but I can see where you are going with this, showing us the bird and the bees and the habitat.', '2008-01-29 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436658, 638730, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and it really stands out against the dark background.</td>', 'Nice colours and it really stands out against the dark background.', '2008-01-29 13:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436661, 637207, 88010, '<td valign="top">I guess this falls into the abstract world. Birdwise, it falls short of holding interest for me, the birds are just too small and don''t seem to be the real subject.</td>', 'I guess this falls into the abstract world. Birdwise, it falls short of holding interest for me, the birds are just too small and don''t seem to be the real subject.', '2008-01-29 13:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436662, 638440, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very good detail and colours, good contrast too.</td>', 'Very good detail and colours, good contrast too.', '2008-01-29 13:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436663, 638129, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute nature shot. Is that a goose or a duck?</td>', 'Cute nature shot. Is that a goose or a duck?', '2008-01-29 13:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436664, 638972, 43774, '<td valign="top">I love the falling snow! Very good colours.</td>', 'I love the falling snow! Very good colours.', '2008-01-29 13:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436667, 639034, 88010, '<td valign="top">A little soft, probably due to cropping or something like that. colors contrast and exposure all look good. I''m not big on "feeder" bird pics. I would prefer you had taken a log or something and baited them to that for a more natural affect.</td>', 'A little soft, probably due to cropping or something like that. colors contrast and exposure all look good. I''m not big on "feeder" bird pics. I would prefer you had taken a log or something and baited them to that for a more natural affect.', '2008-01-29 13:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436671, 638986, 77543, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture but I don''t see how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is a great picture but I don''t see how it meets the challenge.', '2008-01-29 13:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436672, 638129, 88010, '<td valign="top">While the title could lead to an interesting story, the bird itself is very small in the frame. Isn''t quite sharp or recognizable.</td>', 'While the title could lead to an interesting story, the bird itself is very small in the frame. Isn''t quite sharp or recognizable.', '2008-01-29 13:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436702, 638929, 84438, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You actually made seagulls look nice. :)  Good job!</td>', 'Wow.  You actually made seagulls look nice. :)  Good job!', '2008-01-29 13:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436705, 638862, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, and I like the shallow DOF.</td>', 'Nice focus, and I like the shallow DOF.', '2008-01-29 13:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436706, 638925, 84438, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2008-01-29 13:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436712, 638664, 84438, '<td valign="top">A nice photo.  The lighting is too harsh, obviously taken with a flash.  The background and cage does not add much to the photo in my opinion.</td>', 'A nice photo.  The lighting is too harsh, obviously taken with a flash.  The background and cage does not add much to the photo in my opinion.', '2008-01-29 13:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436736, 638650, 84438, '<td valign="top">Love the colours</td>', 'Love the colours', '2008-01-29 14:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436737, 638865, 60680, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!! Perfect 10 - Blue ribbon</td>', 'Beautiful!!! Perfect 10 - Blue ribbon', '2008-01-29 14:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436739, 638803, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but looks like you did not have enough light to use this fast of a shutter speed</td>', 'Nice capture, but looks like you did not have enough light to use this fast of a shutter speed', '2008-01-29 14:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436741, 638129, 84438, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The negative space really sets this photo off!</td>', 'Beautiful.  The negative space really sets this photo off!', '2008-01-29 14:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436744, 638097, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very unique!  Personally I don''t find the processing to be as appealing, but I understand your desire to try and make your photo stand out (Which is does).</td>', 'Very unique!  Personally I don''t find the processing to be as appealing, but I understand your desire to try and make your photo stand out (Which is does).', '2008-01-29 14:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436788, 638382, 88010, '<td valign="top">Interesting fence. Cute bird. Not quite sharp and crisp. color saturation is a bit too high as well. Exposure on the bird is a little hot as it blows out the details in the highlights.</td>', 'Interesting fence. Cute bird. Not quite sharp and crisp. color saturation is a bit too high as well. Exposure on the bird is a little hot as it blows out the details in the highlights.', '2008-01-29 14:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436792, 637603, 88010, '<td valign="top">This would be great if it just had a little catchlight in the eye. Exposure for the white feathers is perfect.</td>', 'This would be great if it just had a little catchlight in the eye. Exposure for the white feathers is perfect.', '2008-01-29 14:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436798, 638116, 88010, '<td valign="top">A busy photo with a lot going on. Nothing pops into focus though, this would suggest camera movement and a tripod would help that. If a tripod was used maybe a better tripod or a faster shutter speed. I know  I get mirror slap at 1/15 and 1/30 second on my bogen tripod.</td>', 'A busy photo with a lot going on. Nothing pops into focus though, this would suggest camera movement and a tripod would help that. If a tripod was used maybe a better tripod or a faster shutter speed. I know  I get mirror slap at 1/15 and 1/30 second on my bogen tripod.', '2008-01-29 14:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436805, 638737, 88010, '<td valign="top">focus is ok, I can make out feather hairs, good. Color and saturation are good. Composition is ok, but too much blank space above. You might try this on landscape making the photo wider and not taller. And if it had a nice catchlight in the eye this would be one of the better shots I''ve seen today.<br/>Nice job. I started using fill flash on birds to get the catchlight, it works and doesn''t seem to bother them a bit.</td>', 'focus is ok, I can make out feather hairs, good. Color and saturation are good. Composition is ok, but too much blank space above. You might try this on landscape making the photo wider and not taller. And if it had a nice catchlight in the eye this would be one of the better shots I''ve seen today.Nice job. I started using fill flash on birds to get the catchlight, it works and doesn''t seem to bother them a bit.', '2008-01-29 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436828, 638912, 77425, '<td valign="top">Why? why?!</td>', 'Why? why?!', '2008-01-29 14:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436833, 638925, 71239, '<td valign="top">A classic study shot with beautiful complimentary background colours and pattern.</td>', 'A classic study shot with beautiful complimentary background colours and pattern.', '2008-01-29 14:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436838, 638903, 71239, '<td valign="top">Fantastic pose and you''ve nailed the focus.  Interesting depth to the background as well.  I don''t mind the tail being clipped - I think the balance of the shot would be upset if the framing went out right.</td>', 'Fantastic pose and you''ve nailed the focus.  Interesting depth to the background as well.  I don''t mind the tail being clipped - I think the balance of the shot would be upset if the framing went out right.', '2008-01-29 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436849, 639049, 71239, '<td valign="top">Great example of the ''bird in context'' type shot in this challange.  The black and white treatment adds to the cold and misty look.  Definitly needs that number of birds to make the birds the main focal point of the image so kudos for waiting :-)</td>', 'Great example of the ''bird in context'' type shot in this challange.  The black and white treatment adds to the cold and misty look.  Definitly needs that number of birds to make the birds the main focal point of the image so kudos for waiting :-)', '2008-01-29 14:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436855, 638876, 71239, '<td valign="top">Brilliant action capture and sympathetic PP to lift the birds into the foreground.  I like the hopeful spectator bottom right too!</td>', 'Brilliant action capture and sympathetic PP to lift the birds into the foreground.  I like the hopeful spectator bottom right too!', '2008-01-29 14:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436856, 637838, 77425, '<td valign="top">Is it a mount? :) beautiful colors. 9</td>', 'Is it a mount? :) beautiful colors. 9', '2008-01-29 14:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436864, 639049, 3746, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.. I hope no one marks you down for the graininess, to me its juts perfect and adds oodles of atmosphere to the whole image. If there is any justice we will be seeing this on the frontpage. 10</td>', 'I love this shot.. I hope no one marks you down for the graininess, to me its juts perfect and adds oodles of atmosphere to the whole image. If there is any justice we will be seeing this on the frontpage. 10', '2008-01-29 14:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436868, 638578, 71239, '<td valign="top">Came back to this one to bump it up because I really like the composition.  Technically flawless, beautiful control of DOF and graphic sweeps of colour in the background lift this one into the top tier amongst some very strong competition.</td>', 'Came back to this one to bump it up because I really like the composition.  Technically flawless, beautiful control of DOF and graphic sweeps of colour in the background lift this one into the top tier amongst some very strong competition.', '2008-01-29 14:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4436885, 637868, 71239, '<td valign="top">I like the muted skin tones (post processing?) to give punch to the painted mask and the cropping to give the impression of the subject pushing out of the frame to freedom.<br/> <br/>I fear for your score in a closely specified challenge where it could easily be regarded as DNMC, but it remains an accomplished photo regardless of your final score and kudos to you for being brave enough to submit it.</td>', 'I like the muted skin tones (post processing?) to give punch to the painted mask and the cropping to give the impression of the subject pushing out of the frame to freedom. I fear for your score in a closely specified challenge where it could easily be regarded as DNMC, but it remains an accomplished photo regardless of your final score and kudos to you for being brave enough to submit it.', '2008-01-29 15:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
