(4436922, 638986, 71239, '<td valign="top">Intriguing use of motion blur and I''m interested in how the front skate has stayed sharp.  Classic rule-of-thirds composition and a strong blue-to-white contrast (leggings to rink and sleeves to background) make this a graphically strong image.  You certainly convey the desire for speed and flight, and although the link to the challenge may not be strong enough for many this remains an excellent image that you should be proud of.</td>', 'Intriguing use of motion blur and I''m interested in how the front skate has stayed sharp.  Classic rule-of-thirds composition and a strong blue-to-white contrast (leggings to rink and sleeves to background) make this a graphically strong image.  You certainly convey the desire for speed and flight, and although the link to the challenge may not be strong enough for many this remains an excellent image that you should be proud of.', '2008-01-29 15:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
