(4437022, 638142, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this, and I really like the way the white fades out at the top.  A neat community view.  (As an aside, I played a golf course in Virginia that had a LOT of these guys.  I was playing with two Canadians one day and said "You really need to take these guys back" - they replied "Oh no - they are a gift, you must keep them!"  They do make a mess of a golf course, though.)</td>', 'I like the composition of this, and I really like the way the white fades out at the top.  A neat community view.  (As an aside, I played a golf course in Virginia that had a LOT of these guys.  I was playing with two Canadians one day and said "You really need to take these guys back" - they replied "Oh no - they are a gift, you must keep them!"  They do make a mess of a golf course, though.)', '2008-01-29 16:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
