(4437441, 638210, 80058, '<td valign="top">Oh oh oh!! This is THE ONE!!!!!!!! Wow i don''t know where to start... first off this has to be one of the most original shots for the challenge, LOVING how you got the bird from the back... the wings are amazingly symetric (hope im usin the right word lol) the lil legs just leaving the branch, not only shoes motion but its the part that completes the photo for the eyes to understand its a bird! To top it off the branches have a nice balance in them as well curvacious on the top and the bottom one, the black and white conversion is beyond perfect too! Wow I really am in love with this shot!! <br/> <br/>Arghhhh I hope other can see it what I see, you must know how they are... lol sorry I got a lil to excited! <br/> <br/>BEST OF LUCK!!</td>', 'Oh oh oh!! This is THE ONE!!!!!!!! Wow i don''t know where to start... first off this has to be one of the most original shots for the challenge, LOVING how you got the bird from the back... the wings are amazingly symetric (hope im usin the right word lol) the lil legs just leaving the branch, not only shoes motion but its the part that completes the photo for the eyes to understand its a bird! To top it off the branches have a nice balance in them as well curvacious on the top and the bottom one, the black and white conversion is beyond perfect too! Wow I really am in love with this shot!!  Arghhhh I hope other can see it what I see, you must know how they are... lol sorry I got a lil to excited!  BEST OF LUCK!!', '2008-01-29 19:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
