(4437843, 636851, 51597, '<td valign="top">The funniest place to see a boidie.. Good use of humor w the Title..<br/> <br/>Since this little guy is living in the sticks he''s a survivor..<br/> <br/>Well done.. and good eye...</td>', 'The funniest place to see a boidie.. Good use of humor w the Title.. Since this little guy is living in the sticks he''s a survivor.. Well done.. and good eye...', '2008-01-29 22:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
