(4438393, 638820, 53316, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS colors!  Looks like five different paint cans splashed on that bird!</td>', 'GORGEOUS colors!  Looks like five different paint cans splashed on that bird!', '2008-01-30 01:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438523, 638274, 63812, '<td valign="top">:-) nice composition!</td>', ':-) nice composition!', '2008-01-30 03:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438577, 638767, 88010, '<td valign="top">DOF could have been increased a tad to get the rest of the head in focus, but other than that all techs look good. Compositionally I would like to see a little more space aboce the head.</td>', 'DOF could have been increased a tad to get the rest of the head in focus, but other than that all techs look good. Compositionally I would like to see a little more space aboce the head.', '2008-01-30 04:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438580, 637589, 88010, '<td valign="top">This has a little camera blur, but not much. Color, contrast and saturation all look OK. Compositionally I think he is too far to the left anf leaving the frame.</td>', 'This has a little camera blur, but not much. Color, contrast and saturation all look OK. Compositionally I think he is too far to the left anf leaving the frame.', '2008-01-30 04:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438581, 638111, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I wish he had a little space to the right, in front of him, to move into, he is crowding the edge of the composition. Where as he has a lot of room behind him. All technicals look good.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I wish he had a little space to the right, in front of him, to move into, he is crowding the edge of the composition. Where as he has a lot of room behind him. All technicals look good.', '2008-01-30 04:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438582, 638234, 88010, '<td valign="top">All technicals look good, composition looks good. I can''t see any thing that I could help you improve.</td>', 'All technicals look good, composition looks good. I can''t see any thing that I could help you improve.', '2008-01-30 04:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438585, 638803, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice freeze action shot. Good colors and saturation, but the contrast seems a bit high.</td>', 'Nice freeze action shot. Good colors and saturation, but the contrast seems a bit high.', '2008-01-30 04:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438588, 638830, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, focus is close enough ( it doesn''t POP, but close enough). Colors all look natural and not over done. Goos job.</td>', 'Nice shot, focus is close enough ( it doesn''t POP, but close enough). Colors all look natural and not over done. Goos job.', '2008-01-30 04:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438619, 638980, 80908, '<td valign="top">I feel that I have to comment, to explain my low grading here. Distant birds will work, but there need to be more of them.  There is no ''structure'' to this composition. It also needs more contrast and perhaps colour saturation, but mainly it needs a subject. Sorry!</td>', 'I feel that I have to comment, to explain my low grading here. Distant birds will work, but there need to be more of them.  There is no ''structure'' to this composition. It also needs more contrast and perhaps colour saturation, but mainly it needs a subject. Sorry!', '2008-01-30 05:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438620, 639037, 80908, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the frame is actually unecessary as it detracts from the impact of the bird''s colouring. Other than that, perhaps more contrast around the head?</td>', 'Nice photo, the frame is actually unecessary as it detracts from the impact of the bird''s colouring. Other than that, perhaps more contrast around the head?', '2008-01-30 05:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438622, 638957, 80908, '<td valign="top">A little TOO much saturation here - it hurts the eyes!</td>', 'A little TOO much saturation here - it hurts the eyes!', '2008-01-30 05:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438623, 636871, 80908, '<td valign="top">Clever Juxtaposition...</td>', 'Clever Juxtaposition...', '2008-01-30 05:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438626, 639005, 80908, '<td valign="top">The birds... its their dead eyes!! Love it.</td>', 'The birds... its their dead eyes!! Love it.', '2008-01-30 05:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438657, 638393, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good sharp straightforward shot. Centered subject works well. Makes me wonder if this is scoring as well as a past gator. ;)</td>', 'Good sharp straightforward shot. Centered subject works well. Makes me wonder if this is scoring as well as a past gator. ;)', '2008-01-30 06:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438710, 638735, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice bokeh to set the stage for this bird!</td>', 'Very nice bokeh to set the stage for this bird!', '2008-01-30 06:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438713, 637844, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very rich and warm surrounding colors complement the bird wel - and I do like the wind-ruffled feathers.</td>', 'Very rich and warm surrounding colors complement the bird wel - and I do like the wind-ruffled feathers.', '2008-01-30 06:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438716, 636871, 30982, '<td valign="top">The two pole sitters are keeping an eye on their manmade cousins.  Very well seen - I even like the massive yellow saturation.  And I really like the single tree on the right for reasons I can''t explain.</td>', 'The two pole sitters are keeping an eye on their manmade cousins.  Very well seen - I even like the massive yellow saturation.  And I really like the single tree on the right for reasons I can''t explain.', '2008-01-30 06:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438718, 638830, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light!</td>', 'Beautiful light!', '2008-01-30 06:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438724, 639013, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice natural light and color with good detail on the wfeathers - particularly the way the light is shining through the wing edges and tail.</td>', 'Nice natural light and color with good detail on the wfeathers - particularly the way the light is shining through the wing edges and tail.', '2008-01-30 06:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438732, 637454, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the matching t-shirt!  I rarely think of birds as "cuddly" but this dispells that notion.  A bit "fuzzy" - it would benefit from sharper focus, and I''m not sure I like the background so completely black, but this is a nice interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'I like the matching t-shirt!  I rarely think of birds as "cuddly" but this dispells that notion.  A bit "fuzzy" - it would benefit from sharper focus, and I''m not sure I like the background so completely black, but this is a nice interpretation of the challenge.', '2008-01-30 06:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438734, 638924, 30982, '<td valign="top">He looks rather disgruntled - either about the cold or about having his picture taken, can''t tell which!  Nice use of the diagonal to support the composition.</td>', 'He looks rather disgruntled - either about the cold or about having his picture taken, can''t tell which!  Nice use of the diagonal to support the composition.', '2008-01-30 06:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438736, 638707, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think they''re very beautiful in their own way - I love how you''ve showcased him in this shot - seems almost raptor-like in the pose!</td>', 'I think they''re very beautiful in their own way - I love how you''ve showcased him in this shot - seems almost raptor-like in the pose!', '2008-01-30 06:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438738, 638925, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent definitive shot of this species.  Beautiful rich color and very nice detail.  The water forms a wonderful watercolor backdrop to showcase the bird.</td>', 'An excellent definitive shot of this species.  Beautiful rich color and very nice detail.  The water forms a wonderful watercolor backdrop to showcase the bird.', '2008-01-30 06:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438743, 637983, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this!  The diagonals of the limbs supplemented with the horizontal bands of color work very well here - an excellent composition.  I like what you''ve done with the border as well - hopefully you''ll put in your comments how you did it - showcases the shot very well!</td>', 'I quite like this!  The diagonals of the limbs supplemented with the horizontal bands of color work very well here - an excellent composition.  I like what you''ve done with the border as well - hopefully you''ll put in your comments how you did it - showcases the shot very well!', '2008-01-30 06:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438746, 637538, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very good example of how well birds can blend in with their surroundings - his colors match perfectly with the tree and the sky!</td>', 'A very good example of how well birds can blend in with their surroundings - his colors match perfectly with the tree and the sky!', '2008-01-30 06:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438749, 638777, 30982, '<td valign="top">That is a big mouth!  Great pose for the shot.  My only nit is I can''t tell if the background is water or ground - the texture of it seems to have been lost either through the lighting or the processing.</td>', 'That is a big mouth!  Great pose for the shot.  My only nit is I can''t tell if the background is water or ground - the texture of it seems to have been lost either through the lighting or the processing.', '2008-01-30 06:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438755, 638007, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well suited for his environment - he matches his surrounds very nicely!  Nice even light and good work with DOF to set your subject apart enough to be clearly seen despite his best attempts at camoflauge.</td>', 'Very well suited for his environment - he matches his surrounds very nicely!  Nice even light and good work with DOF to set your subject apart enough to be clearly seen despite his best attempts at camoflauge.', '2008-01-30 06:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438757, 638979, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very graceful pose captured - I like the supporting foreground elements and the gray of the water.</td>', 'Very graceful pose captured - I like the supporting foreground elements and the gray of the water.', '2008-01-30 06:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438758, 638826, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice presentation - the diagonal of the branch supports the composition (and the bird!) quite nicely!</td>', 'Very nice presentation - the diagonal of the branch supports the composition (and the bird!) quite nicely!', '2008-01-30 06:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438761, 638964, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think he''s trying to see what aperture you set your camera at, to make sure you got a good shot of him.</td>', 'I think he''s trying to see what aperture you set your camera at, to make sure you got a good shot of him.', '2008-01-30 06:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438766, 638887, 30982, '<td valign="top">The slight bluish tones suit the elegance of this bird.  Perhaps not uberfine detail in the feathers, but good exposure to keep from losing the highlights and the photograph has an almost painterly feel to it.</td>', 'The slight bluish tones suit the elegance of this bird.  Perhaps not uberfine detail in the feathers, but good exposure to keep from losing the highlights and the photograph has an almost painterly feel to it.', '2008-01-30 06:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438772, 638858, 30982, '<td valign="top">A fine natural pose!  This would benefit from a bit more light and contrast - you can try adjusting the levels a bit and maybe a bit of brightness/contrast adjustment.  ''Tis a very regal look you captured!</td>', 'A fine natural pose!  This would benefit from a bit more light and contrast - you can try adjusting the levels a bit and maybe a bit of brightness/contrast adjustment.  ''Tis a very regal look you captured!', '2008-01-30 07:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438773, 638113, 30982, '<td valign="top">Poor thing does indeed look frozen in place!</td>', 'Poor thing does indeed look frozen in place!', '2008-01-30 07:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438781, 637899, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, and I quite like that you caught the bird in song!  Seems to lack just a bit in contrast which makes it seem a little washed out.  Very good color - try adding a bit more contrast (levels, or brightness/contrast adjustments, maybe) and see what you think.</td>', 'Very nicely composed, and I quite like that you caught the bird in song!  Seems to lack just a bit in contrast which makes it seem a little washed out.  Very good color - try adding a bit more contrast (levels, or brightness/contrast adjustments, maybe) and see what you think.', '2008-01-30 07:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438807, 638393, 20530, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Dynamic. Perfect in every way! Besides the great exposure and sharp detail, the movement created by the great composition and timing make this a top-notch image. This is the first shot I opened, but I''d nominate it for a ribbon without seeing the rest.</td>', 'Stunning. Dynamic. Perfect in every way! Besides the great exposure and sharp detail, the movement created by the great composition and timing make this a top-notch image. This is the first shot I opened, but I''d nominate it for a ribbon without seeing the rest.', '2008-01-30 07:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438861, 636739, 30982, '<td valign="top">A serene composition - I like the misty treeline and the sunlit section of clouds.</td>', 'A serene composition - I like the misty treeline and the sunlit section of clouds.', '2008-01-30 07:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438867, 639057, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think I have one of these guys (or a close relative) that sits in the tree behind my house.  He gets that same sort of look when I try to take his picture but leaves before I can get it!  He looks a little washed out and mottled - like maybe the focus was a bit in front of him.</td>', 'I think I have one of these guys (or a close relative) that sits in the tree behind my house.  He gets that same sort of look when I try to take his picture but leaves before I can get it!  He looks a little washed out and mottled - like maybe the focus was a bit in front of him.', '2008-01-30 07:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438871, 637385, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sometimes you wonder what the purpose of all the wild colors is.  This one certainly has his share of them.  The blue section in the red part is nearly 3-D in this picture, particularly if you stare at it for a bit.</td>', 'Sometimes you wonder what the purpose of all the wild colors is.  This one certainly has his share of them.  The blue section in the red part is nearly 3-D in this picture, particularly if you stare at it for a bit.', '2008-01-30 07:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438874, 638810, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very pretty bird with nice coloring, showcased well here.</td>', 'A very pretty bird with nice coloring, showcased well here.', '2008-01-30 07:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438878, 638097, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a glass window - very warm and rich.  Probably too much processing for this crowd (unless it''s a picture of a window!)</td>', 'Looks like a glass window - very warm and rich.  Probably too much processing for this crowd (unless it''s a picture of a window!)', '2008-01-30 07:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438879, 638025, 30982, '<td valign="top">But it''s a nicely detailed and nicely framed (by the water) picture of an ordnary duck!</td>', 'But it''s a nicely detailed and nicely framed (by the water) picture of an ordnary duck!', '2008-01-30 07:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438882, 638817, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve seen one shot this way - I really like it!  And strangely, it has a very California old rock and roll (think Mick Jagger) feel to it.</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve seen one shot this way - I really like it!  And strangely, it has a very California old rock and roll (think Mick Jagger) feel to it.', '2008-01-30 07:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438989, 638916, 88698, '<td valign="top">Great shot! lots of action and atmosphere. Excellent detail and composition.</td>', 'Great shot! lots of action and atmosphere. Excellent detail and composition.', '2008-01-30 08:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4438995, 636450, 88698, '<td valign="top">A classical shot of the cardinal. good for Christmas cards! Nice job.</td>', 'A classical shot of the cardinal. good for Christmas cards! Nice job.', '2008-01-30 08:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439002, 638876, 88698, '<td valign="top">great action shot! Excellent details.</td>', 'great action shot! Excellent details.', '2008-01-30 08:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439009, 638274, 88698, '<td valign="top">Very evocative. Great shot! Something different from the normal headshot.</td>', 'Very evocative. Great shot! Something different from the normal headshot.', '2008-01-30 08:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
