(4439025, 638543, 88698, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Something better than the usual headshot. Too bad the dof is so shallow, but I like the shot.</td>', 'Great idea. Something better than the usual headshot. Too bad the dof is so shallow, but I like the shot.', '2008-01-30 08:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439058, 638820, 87539, '<td valign="top">My first thought when I saw this was WOW!  What beautiful colors and such expression in the bird''s eye.</td>', 'My first thought when I saw this was WOW!  What beautiful colors and such expression in the bird''s eye.', '2008-01-30 08:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439075, 638594, 72929, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors</td>', 'Lovely colors', '2008-01-30 09:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439077, 638343, 72929, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a cardinal. Well composed and sharp!</td>', 'Nice capture of a cardinal. Well composed and sharp!', '2008-01-30 09:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439078, 638737, 72929, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture</td>', 'Awesome capture', '2008-01-30 09:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439082, 638969, 72929, '<td valign="top">Kind of like the birds around my house. They hide in thick trees like this instead of perching on an isolated branch with a nice distant background.</td>', 'Kind of like the birds around my house. They hide in thick trees like this instead of perching on an isolated branch with a nice distant background.', '2008-01-30 09:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439191, 637533, 68256, '<td valign="top">It is a good thing I established my vote before I read your title :)  Actually I really like this composition, it works perfect centered and simple.  I love the wonderful cracks and textures in the wall and the angle of the pigeon.  I''ll give you a 9, but sure don''t like that title.</td>', 'It is a good thing I established my vote before I read your title :)  Actually I really like this composition, it works perfect centered and simple.  I love the wonderful cracks and textures in the wall and the angle of the pigeon.  I''ll give you a 9, but sure don''t like that title.', '2008-01-30 09:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439289, 638972, 30982, '<td valign="top">This reminds me that we humans have it pretty good when it comes to the elements.  I like the variety in markings of the two birds.</td>', 'This reminds me that we humans have it pretty good when it comes to the elements.  I like the variety in markings of the two birds.', '2008-01-30 10:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439293, 637542, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Well, did it?  A busy background takes away from your main subject some, but it is what it is.  The ice serves as a nice reminder that it''s cold out there, too.</td>', 'Heh!  Well, did it?  A busy background takes away from your main subject some, but it is what it is.  The ice serves as a nice reminder that it''s cold out there, too.', '2008-01-30 10:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439295, 638789, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the bird''s coloring - very nice bits of not over the top red.  Good catch in the pose, and nice supporting background.</td>', 'I like the bird''s coloring - very nice bits of not over the top red.  Good catch in the pose, and nice supporting background.', '2008-01-30 10:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439308, 639005, 52336, '<td valign="top">Wow, you just tripled your productivity! ;-)</td>', 'Wow, you just tripled your productivity! ;-)', '2008-01-30 10:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439324, 638893, 61349, '<td valign="top">Is this a stuffed bird?? There looks to be no life in his eyes..</td>', 'Is this a stuffed bird?? There looks to be no life in his eyes..', '2008-01-30 10:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439330, 638122, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good warm colors and I like the two different wing positions captured.</td>', 'Good warm colors and I like the two different wing positions captured.', '2008-01-30 10:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439332, 639008, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how this depicts the natural camoflauge - he certainly does blend well with his surroundings.</td>', 'I like how this depicts the natural camoflauge - he certainly does blend well with his surroundings.', '2008-01-30 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
