(4439350, 638903, 51538, '<td valign="top">Those natural moments are all too difficult to capture - but you managed it.  Nice detail and bokeh. 8.</td>', 'Those natural moments are all too difficult to capture - but you managed it.  Nice detail and bokeh. 8.', '2008-01-30 10:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
