(4439406, 637259, 30982, '<td valign="top">That has got to be a wonderous sight to behold in person!  Good catch of a tough shot.  A bit more clarity/focus would be ideal, but I''m still impressed with getting the shot in the first place.</td>', 'That has got to be a wonderous sight to behold in person!  Good catch of a tough shot.  A bit more clarity/focus would be ideal, but I''m still impressed with getting the shot in the first place.', '2008-01-30 10:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
