(4439565, 638817, 33352, '<td valign="top">Rotation has increased the impact.</td>', 'Rotation has increased the impact.', '2008-01-30 10:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439567, 637533, 36619, '<td valign="top">it''s visual poem. so far my fave! <br/>(oh yeah and the bird is not sharp. don''t want to mess up your prediction, even though i bet you get way more than 9 ;)</td>', 'it''s visual poem. so far my fave! (oh yeah and the bird is not sharp. don''t want to mess up your prediction, even though i bet you get way more than 9 ;)', '2008-01-30 10:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439568, 636739, 33352, '<td valign="top">More scenery than subject.</td>', 'More scenery than subject.', '2008-01-30 10:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439712, 637840, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure. I like the vignetting</td>', 'Nice exposure. I like the vignetting', '2008-01-30 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439716, 638383, 54645, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great capture of the colors. The reflecting water is a bit distracting. Did you use a polarizering filter? 6</td>', 'Wow. Great capture of the colors. The reflecting water is a bit distracting. Did you use a polarizering filter? 6', '2008-01-30 11:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439726, 637456, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great composition, with interesting fore,mid, and background.</td>', 'Great composition, with interesting fore,mid, and background.', '2008-01-30 11:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439736, 638985, 674, '<td valign="top">i like the composition i like the way the bird is looking at you but i donnt like the oversharpening on the bird.</td>', 'i like the composition i like the way the bird is looking at you but i donnt like the oversharpening on the bird.', '2008-01-30 11:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439744, 637913, 674, '<td valign="top">shame on him1 the back bird looks a little unatural not sure what it is.</td>', 'shame on him1 the back bird looks a little unatural not sure what it is.', '2008-01-30 11:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439749, 636450, 34082, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the red and the green.<br/> <br/>Nice picture!</td>', 'I like the contrast between the red and the green. Nice picture!', '2008-01-30 11:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439765, 638270, 8005, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field and sharp image.</td>', 'Nice depth of field and sharp image.', '2008-01-30 11:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439767, 638916, 89170, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo, I''d be stunned if it didn''t take first place.  Great job.</td>', 'Amazing photo, I''d be stunned if it didn''t take first place.  Great job.', '2008-01-30 11:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439793, 638924, 8005, '<td valign="top">Looks over sharpened to me.</td>', 'Looks over sharpened to me.', '2008-01-30 11:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439804, 637912, 8005, '<td valign="top">This is the niceset pigeon photo I have seen so far.</td>', 'This is the niceset pigeon photo I have seen so far.', '2008-01-30 11:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439863, 638491, 88880, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors!</td>', 'Gorgeous colors!', '2008-01-30 12:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439864, 638054, 88880, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Amazing detail!</td>', 'Wow!  Amazing detail!', '2008-01-30 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439878, 639049, 88880, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!</td>', 'This is beautiful!', '2008-01-30 12:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439879, 637393, 88880, '<td valign="top">Can this bird even fly?!  So fat! :)  Great capture!</td>', 'Can this bird even fly?!  So fat! :)  Great capture!', '2008-01-30 12:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439881, 638895, 88880, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2008-01-30 12:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439886, 638995, 88880, '<td valign="top">WOW!</td>', 'WOW!', '2008-01-30 12:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439901, 638809, 88880, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture!</td>', 'Beautiful capture!', '2008-01-30 12:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439911, 638274, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and composition, although I would have still like to have seen the face. 6</td>', 'Nice shot and composition, although I would have still like to have seen the face. 6', '2008-01-30 12:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439912, 638017, 88880, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!</td>', 'Outstanding!', '2008-01-30 12:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439914, 636505, 88880, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  Great capture!</td>', 'This is wonderful.  Great capture!', '2008-01-30 12:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439916, 638928, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and composition. Details of the face seem to be lost due to overexposure.</td>', 'Nice lines and composition. Details of the face seem to be lost due to overexposure.', '2008-01-30 12:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439918, 638915, 54645, '<td valign="top">Very nice.The gull does not seem impressed with the hair. I think the composition would be a bit more interesting with less or more foreground water. It would depend on what''s behind the gull.</td>', 'Very nice.The gull does not seem impressed with the hair. I think the composition would be a bit more interesting with less or more foreground water. It would depend on what''s behind the gull.', '2008-01-30 12:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439919, 638655, 54645, '<td valign="top">Cute little bird. I wonder what''s in his mouth.</td>', 'Cute little bird. I wonder what''s in his mouth.', '2008-01-30 12:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439921, 638782, 88880, '<td valign="top">The water is gorgeous!</td>', 'The water is gorgeous!', '2008-01-30 12:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439923, 638267, 88880, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!</td>', 'Fantastic!', '2008-01-30 12:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439925, 638904, 54645, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m sure there is some sort of dermatologist that can help this guy! Nice picture, excellent DOF, with nice facial detail. The shadow on the chest, and the hot spot near the nare are the only "criticism" I have. Did you use a fill flash? 6</td>', 'Wow, I''m sure there is some sort of dermatologist that can help this guy! Nice picture, excellent DOF, with nice facial detail. The shadow on the chest, and the hot spot near the nare are the only "criticism" I have. Did you use a fill flash? 6', '2008-01-30 12:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439931, 638097, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the watercolor(?) effect. Was this done in photoshop? My only criticism is the with the border merging with the leaves in the top left. For me it detracts from an otherwise very nice image and composition. Good job. 6</td>', 'I like the watercolor(?) effect. Was this done in photoshop? My only criticism is the with the border merging with the leaves in the top left. For me it detracts from an otherwise very nice image and composition. Good job. 6', '2008-01-30 12:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439935, 639036, 54645, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The right eye is a distraction.</td>', 'Interesting composition. The right eye is a distraction.', '2008-01-30 12:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439942, 637949, 54645, '<td valign="top">The bird is great. Nice and sharp. I like the composition. The background has considerable noise for my taste. I like the presentation with the borders.6</td>', 'The bird is great. Nice and sharp. I like the composition. The background has considerable noise for my taste. I like the presentation with the borders.6', '2008-01-30 12:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439944, 638992, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in face.</td>', 'Nice detail in face.', '2008-01-30 12:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439950, 637258, 54645, '<td valign="top">The right side of the composition is distracting for me. What is that on the border?</td>', 'The right side of the composition is distracting for me. What is that on the border?', '2008-01-30 12:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4439976, 638992, 63812, '<td valign="top">WOW!!! Amazing. Incredible sharpness in each detail!</td>', 'WOW!!! Amazing. Incredible sharpness in each detail!', '2008-01-30 12:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440007, 637983, 63812, '<td valign="top">this image is unique in composition and colors. It deserves a place between the first 10.</td>', 'this image is unique in composition and colors. It deserves a place between the first 10.', '2008-01-30 12:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440047, 639044, 63812, '<td valign="top">This image is special. Excellent capture. The distance, angle and the subjects give a sensation of presence and movement here. Congratulations. 10</td>', 'This image is special. Excellent capture. The distance, angle and the subjects give a sensation of presence and movement here. Congratulations. 10', '2008-01-30 13:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440097, 638987, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2008-01-30 13:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440119, 638809, 83313, '<td valign="top">lovely details showing on those neck feathers.</td>', 'lovely details showing on those neck feathers.', '2008-01-30 13:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440128, 637815, 83313, '<td valign="top">It does look like the bird is just surfing the breeze. Bird''s a little small in the frame for major impact, but I do like this.</td>', 'It does look like the bird is just surfing the breeze. Bird''s a little small in the frame for major impact, but I do like this.', '2008-01-30 13:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440129, 638113, 83313, '<td valign="top">The bluish tone really works with the title. It looks cold indeed.</td>', 'The bluish tone really works with the title. It looks cold indeed.', '2008-01-30 13:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440133, 638862, 83313, '<td valign="top">He looks to be eying me with suspicion.</td>', 'He looks to be eying me with suspicion.', '2008-01-30 13:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440141, 638343, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, though the shadows at the top kind of guide my gaze toward her belly instead of her face. DOF is perfect for this sort of shot.</td>', 'Nice, though the shadows at the top kind of guide my gaze toward her belly instead of her face. DOF is perfect for this sort of shot.', '2008-01-30 13:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440147, 638455, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the scene, but the busy and bright background at the top of the frame is drawing my eye away from the swans.</td>', 'I like the scene, but the busy and bright background at the top of the frame is drawing my eye away from the swans.', '2008-01-30 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440160, 638648, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love those eyes! I find the crop a touch too tight on the left side. And a little noise visible on his feathers, though it is not an objectionable amount. It stands out mostly because the background is so smooth that I suspect you did some noise reduction there, but did not do it on the bird in order to keep detail.</td>', 'Love those eyes! I find the crop a touch too tight on the left side. And a little noise visible on his feathers, though it is not an objectionable amount. It stands out mostly because the background is so smooth that I suspect you did some noise reduction there, but did not do it on the bird in order to keep detail.', '2008-01-30 13:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440165, 636618, 30982, '<td valign="top">Indeed he has a very curious look!  This could be bigger - there''s a very good tutorial on how to size your photographs for submission under the "Learn" option on the top menu.</td>', 'Indeed he has a very curious look!  This could be bigger - there''s a very good tutorial on how to size your photographs for submission under the "Learn" option on the top menu.', '2008-01-30 13:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440169, 637911, 30982, '<td valign="top">A great angle to shoot this guy from - give his a very questioning demeanor.  I like the choice to present this in monochrome, too.</td>', 'A great angle to shoot this guy from - give his a very questioning demeanor.  I like the choice to present this in monochrome, too.', '2008-01-30 13:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440174, 637535, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Cool.  Roadkill is pretty much the bird of prey''s equivalent to the human drive-through.</td>', 'LOL!  Cool.  Roadkill is pretty much the bird of prey''s equivalent to the human drive-through.', '2008-01-30 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4440178, 638946, 83313, '<td valign="top">And he''ll probably kick you with his good leg!<br/> <br/>Some blown highlights and a slightly too busy background. Also, the bird is caught in mottled shadows. Using a wider aperture may have given you less DOF and blurred the background more.</td>', 'And he''ll probably kick you with his good leg! Some blown highlights and a slightly too busy background. Also, the bird is caught in mottled shadows. Using a wider aperture may have given you less DOF and blurred the background more.', '2008-01-30 13:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440179, 638986, 30982, '<td valign="top">If she goes really, really fast, she just might achieve take-off!  A friend told me that he told his young children that if they ran hard enough, and flapped hard enough, they could fly.  But he warned them in a long lecture just how far they were allowed to go, and not to fly out of the neighborhood.  They apparently tried all afternoon.</td>', 'If she goes really, really fast, she just might achieve take-off!  A friend told me that he told his young children that if they ran hard enough, and flapped hard enough, they could fly.  But he warned them in a long lecture just how far they were allowed to go, and not to fly out of the neighborhood.  They apparently tried all afternoon.', '2008-01-30 13:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440183, 637980, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Good title - I''m sure birds everywhere were wondering what the heck was going on.  Pretty good capture of this guy - to truly excel, he''d need to be a bit sharper and ideally have some texture to the sky behind.  I do like the light through the wings - that''s always neat to see.</td>', 'Heh!  Good title - I''m sure birds everywhere were wondering what the heck was going on.  Pretty good capture of this guy - to truly excel, he''d need to be a bit sharper and ideally have some texture to the sky behind.  I do like the light through the wings - that''s always neat to see.', '2008-01-30 13:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440187, 638995, 83313, '<td valign="top">Swooooshhhh!!! What an angle. I''d like to know how you shot this.</td>', 'Swooooshhhh!!! What an angle. I''d like to know how you shot this.', '2008-01-30 13:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440188, 637814, 60862, '<td valign="top">Still love this shot. :)  Everyone''s pointing away, no one seems to be interacting ... and the B&amp;W seems just right.</td>', 'Still love this shot. :)  Everyone''s pointing away, no one seems to be interacting ... and the B&W seems just right.', '2008-01-30 13:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440191, 638695, 63812, '<td valign="top">I think if I touch my screen I am going to feel the smoothness  of this white plumage. Very sweet (9)</td>', 'I think if I touch my screen I am going to feel the smoothness  of this white plumage. Very sweet (9)', '2008-01-30 13:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440192, 639009, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and a good shot to show how adaptable these creatures are.  I''ve always wondered how they learn to stay away from the live wires, since it would only take once....</td>', 'Lovely light and a good shot to show how adaptable these creatures are.  I''ve always wondered how they learn to stay away from the live wires, since it would only take once....', '2008-01-30 13:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440196, 638613, 30982, '<td valign="top">He looks shy!  Love the setting and the bokeh - fits his reticent pose and quieter colors very well.</td>', 'He looks shy!  Love the setting and the bokeh - fits his reticent pose and quieter colors very well.', '2008-01-30 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440200, 638893, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks vicious! Great close up details. Colors are bold, but not over-saturated.</td>', 'Looks vicious! Great close up details. Colors are bold, but not over-saturated.', '2008-01-30 13:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440202, 638769, 30982, '<td valign="top">I have lots of shots that look very similar to this - I enjoy chasing the pigeons around.  They may be flying rats, but they''re a whole lot better looking.  Good color on these guys, but a bit busy with no real central point of attention.</td>', 'I have lots of shots that look very similar to this - I enjoy chasing the pigeons around.  They may be flying rats, but they''re a whole lot better looking.  Good color on these guys, but a bit busy with no real central point of attention.', '2008-01-30 13:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440206, 639044, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice light for this shot!  It let you highlight the detail well and capture the birds'' motion cleanly.</td>', 'Very nice light for this shot!  It let you highlight the detail well and capture the birds'' motion cleanly.', '2008-01-30 13:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440211, 638415, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh man, Oscar is a cutie!  Or at least the way you presented him makes him seem that way.  Emus generally aren''t cute.  Excellent detail.</td>', 'Oh man, Oscar is a cutie!  Or at least the way you presented him makes him seem that way.  Emus generally aren''t cute.  Excellent detail.', '2008-01-30 13:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440213, 638547, 83313, '<td valign="top">The duck''s feather details look kind of odd here. Perhaps a result of oversharpening, but I''m not exactly sure.</td>', 'The duck''s feather details look kind of odd here. Perhaps a result of oversharpening, but I''m not exactly sure.', '2008-01-30 13:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440221, 638440, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bold look with mostly subdued colors. Good job on the texture of the feathers as well as the brickwork. A closer crop would have been good, but that''s a personal preference and NOT a criticism of the way you chose to do it.</td>', 'A bold look with mostly subdued colors. Good job on the texture of the feathers as well as the brickwork. A closer crop would have been good, but that''s a personal preference and NOT a criticism of the way you chose to do it.', '2008-01-30 13:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440231, 638817, 83313, '<td valign="top">I love this one. The head down look is great. Reminds me of the villainous vulture characters from some old cartoons. Face is the shadows is the only minor critique I can make, but with animals, you take them how you can get them.</td>', 'I love this one. The head down look is great. Reminds me of the villainous vulture characters from some old cartoons. Face is the shadows is the only minor critique I can make, but with animals, you take them how you can get them.', '2008-01-30 13:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440236, 637838, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love all that detail in the purple feathers. Not fond of the tight crop though.</td>', 'Love all that detail in the purple feathers. Not fond of the tight crop though.', '2008-01-30 13:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440243, 638210, 52500, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture, great timing.  I would have probably given it a bit more contrast, and I don''t like the fading black/gray border thing, but overall it''s really captivating.</td>', 'Fantastic capture, great timing.  I would have probably given it a bit more contrast, and I don''t like the fading black/gray border thing, but overall it''s really captivating.', '2008-01-30 13:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440244, 638787, 83313, '<td valign="top">I can swear I saw this same bird once already. I think a tighter portrait crop would help the image flow a little better.</td>', 'I can swear I saw this same bird once already. I think a tighter portrait crop would help the image flow a little better.', '2008-01-30 13:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440249, 638962, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice enough landscape, though the birds are so small that they are not really the subject.<br/> <br/>This shot is also way more compressed than it needed to be. At only 82k, you could have used a lot less JPEG compression and probably gotten more detail into the shot.</td>', 'A nice enough landscape, though the birds are so small that they are not really the subject. This shot is also way more compressed than it needed to be. At only 82k, you could have used a lot less JPEG compression and probably gotten more detail into the shot.', '2008-01-30 14:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
