(4440488, 638382, 33352, '<td valign="top">Busy photo looses the subject.</td>', 'Busy photo looses the subject.', '2008-01-30 14:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440490, 637385, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, your composition is very strong.  I think if your colors were a little more vivid you might have scored a little higher.</td>', 'Nice focus, your composition is very strong.  I think if your colors were a little more vivid you might have scored a little higher.', '2008-01-30 14:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440491, 639036, 33352, '<td valign="top">Great textures in this with contrasting background.</td>', 'Great textures in this with contrasting background.', '2008-01-30 14:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440493, 638709, 41802, '<td valign="top">I like the look of the bird looking at us.  The lighting is pretty harsh in this shot.</td>', 'I like the look of the bird looking at us.  The lighting is pretty harsh in this shot.', '2008-01-30 14:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440494, 638723, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the action.</td>', 'Nice take on the action.', '2008-01-30 14:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440496, 636851, 41802, '<td valign="top">Ha ha I would have never though to look under the car for the bird. Nice composition and good eye.</td>', 'Ha ha I would have never though to look under the car for the bird. Nice composition and good eye.', '2008-01-30 14:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440497, 638058, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The coloring is nice.</td>', 'Nice composition.  The coloring is nice.', '2008-01-30 14:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440499, 638709, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very clean photo.</td>', 'Very clean photo.', '2008-01-30 14:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440500, 638869, 41802, '<td valign="top">I think the title really makes the image even more interesting.</td>', 'I think the title really makes the image even more interesting.', '2008-01-30 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440501, 638912, 33352, '<td valign="top">DNMC</td>', 'DNMC', '2008-01-30 14:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440503, 638924, 41802, '<td valign="top">Good use of depth of field, I wish the focus was a little stronger.</td>', 'Good use of depth of field, I wish the focus was a little stronger.', '2008-01-30 14:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440504, 638756, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s been into the mattress stuffing again.</td>', 'Looks like he''s been into the mattress stuffing again.', '2008-01-30 14:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440506, 638912, 41802, '<td valign="top">Hmmm really interesting.  I have to give you some point for being creative.</td>', 'Hmmm really interesting.  I have to give you some point for being creative.', '2008-01-30 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440507, 638270, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!!  She doesn''t look like she cares much for pigeons, and the pigeon looks like he just plain doesn''t care!</td>', 'Heh!!  She doesn''t look like she cares much for pigeons, and the pigeon looks like he just plain doesn''t care!', '2008-01-30 14:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440508, 638111, 33352, '<td valign="top">Nice clean photo of the foreground.</td>', 'Nice clean photo of the foreground.', '2008-01-30 14:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440511, 637594, 30982, '<td valign="top">That''s probably one very happy bird.  Very nice setting for the shot.</td>', 'That''s probably one very happy bird.  Very nice setting for the shot.', '2008-01-30 14:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440512, 637980, 41802, '<td valign="top">Good job on this capture, I am sure it was tough to get.  I think there could be a little more clarity on the face.</td>', 'Good job on this capture, I am sure it was tough to get.  I think there could be a little more clarity on the face.', '2008-01-30 14:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440514, 638684, 33352, '<td valign="top">Like the crest above the beak nice contrast of colors.</td>', 'Like the crest above the beak nice contrast of colors.', '2008-01-30 14:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440516, 638705, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow I almost missed the bird with all of the lines in the image.  I really like that I had to stop and look.</td>', 'Wow I almost missed the bird with all of the lines in the image.  I really like that I had to stop and look.', '2008-01-30 14:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440517, 637815, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot!  I like how the bird is not the first thing you see, but becomes the focus of the photograph after a moment.  The art of sailing depicted in two different forms.</td>', 'Sweet shot!  I like how the bird is not the first thing you see, but becomes the focus of the photograph after a moment.  The art of sailing depicted in two different forms.', '2008-01-30 14:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440521, 639049, 33352, '<td valign="top">well shot of a large flock,and processing suites.</td>', 'well shot of a large flock,and processing suites.', '2008-01-30 14:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440522, 638971, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like having the two birds in the shot.  Good use of coloring.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like having the two birds in the shot.  Good use of coloring.', '2008-01-30 14:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440523, 638812, 30982, '<td valign="top">He blends in well with his surroundings - almost too well!</td>', 'He blends in well with his surroundings - almost too well!', '2008-01-30 14:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440524, 636450, 41802, '<td valign="top">Very nice crisp shot.  The clarity is awesome.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice crisp shot.  The clarity is awesome.  Nice composition.', '2008-01-30 14:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440525, 638960, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very clean photo..</td>', 'Very clean photo..', '2008-01-30 14:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440526, 638916, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yuck.  But a very good photograph.</td>', 'Yuck.  But a very good photograph.', '2008-01-30 14:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440527, 638893, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great use of available light to create this intense shot.</td>', 'Great use of available light to create this intense shot.', '2008-01-30 15:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440528, 639014, 33352, '<td valign="top">Like the Dof in this photo.</td>', 'Like the Dof in this photo.', '2008-01-30 15:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440533, 638893, 33352, '<td valign="top">Must be a pet for this close up..</td>', 'Must be a pet for this close up..', '2008-01-30 15:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440534, 637603, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like that the ripples are in the water.</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like that the ripples are in the water.', '2008-01-30 15:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440535, 638979, 33352, '<td valign="top">Lost a little in the water contrast.</td>', 'Lost a little in the water contrast.', '2008-01-30 15:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440536, 638680, 30982, '<td valign="top">Where there''s one, there are always more.  You could try putting him even further down and closer to the left side for an even more minimal approach.  The texture of the water provides a good canvas for this.</td>', 'Where there''s one, there are always more.  You could try putting him even further down and closer to the left side for an even more minimal approach.  The texture of the water provides a good canvas for this.', '2008-01-30 15:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440537, 638899, 41802, '<td valign="top">I really like the placement of the birds, I wish there was a little more focus.</td>', 'I really like the placement of the birds, I wish there was a little more focus.', '2008-01-30 15:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440538, 638097, 33352, '<td valign="top">Not suited by the filter, but effective.</td>', 'Not suited by the filter, but effective.', '2008-01-30 15:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440539, 638455, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautimous!  Lovely blues in the water offset by the oranges of the marsh - and they look like they''re preparing to dance.</td>', 'Beautimous!  Lovely blues in the water offset by the oranges of the marsh - and they look like they''re preparing to dance.', '2008-01-30 15:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440542, 637535, 33352, '<td valign="top">Had to look twice to see the subject.</td>', 'Had to look twice to see the subject.', '2008-01-30 15:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440543, 637288, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the high contrast and brightness of this.  Very cool shot.</td>', 'Love the high contrast and brightness of this.  Very cool shot.', '2008-01-30 15:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440544, 637956, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow I am not sure if it is the perspective but boy is that a big beak.</td>', 'Wow I am not sure if it is the perspective but boy is that a big beak.', '2008-01-30 15:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440545, 639009, 41802, '<td valign="top">Cool upshot.  Nice job keeping all objects in focus.</td>', 'Cool upshot.  Nice job keeping all objects in focus.', '2008-01-30 15:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440546, 637478, 30982, '<td valign="top">This comes up and shows very impressively!  Glad to hear you''re getting such a good score with it, too!  (Comment only, no vote.)</td>', 'This comes up and shows very impressively!  Glad to hear you''re getting such a good score with it, too!  (Comment only, no vote.)', '2008-01-30 15:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440547, 638971, 33352, '<td valign="top">strange choice of processing,effective though.</td>', 'strange choice of processing,effective though.', '2008-01-30 15:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440548, 637389, 33352, '<td valign="top">A nice action shot good colors.</td>', 'A nice action shot good colors.', '2008-01-30 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440550, 638306, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent way to bring out the pattern on the bird - I like the high key approach.</td>', 'Excellent way to bring out the pattern on the bird - I like the high key approach.', '2008-01-30 15:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440553, 638327, 41802, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if you added some soft of filter or something to achieve this shot.  I think I would have scored a little higher without the effect.</td>', 'I am not sure if you added some soft of filter or something to achieve this shot.  I think I would have scored a little higher without the effect.', '2008-01-30 15:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440554, 637838, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow awesome coloring in the feathers.  Nice lighting. The overall composition is great.</td>', 'Wow awesome coloring in the feathers.  Nice lighting. The overall composition is great.', '2008-01-30 15:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440557, 639049, 42013, '<td valign="top">My favorite...I don''t think it is DPC friendly, (whatever that is) and you have some stiff competition in this challenge. The grain, the patterns, the flooded trees = great image!</td>', 'My favorite...I don''t think it is DPC friendly, (whatever that is) and you have some stiff competition in this challenge. The grain, the patterns, the flooded trees = great image!', '2008-01-30 15:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440561, 638987, 42013, '<td valign="top">Cant argue with this fine capture. Sure to finish high!</td>', 'Cant argue with this fine capture. Sure to finish high!', '2008-01-30 15:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440562, 638613, 33352, '<td valign="top">A little lost in the foilage.</td>', 'A little lost in the foilage.', '2008-01-30 15:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440565, 638737, 23002, '<td valign="top">as much as I like the Pirate''s reference, it is a chickadee. LOL</td>', 'as much as I like the Pirate''s reference, it is a chickadee. LOL', '2008-01-30 15:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440566, 638777, 42013, '<td valign="top">LOL funny. Not only a great subject, but technically very well done. Good job!</td>', 'LOL funny. Not only a great subject, but technically very well done. Good job!', '2008-01-30 15:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440567, 637564, 42013, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen this view before...they are always flying away! Cool shot!</td>', 'I''ve never seen this view before...they are always flying away! Cool shot!', '2008-01-30 15:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440569, 638914, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps just a bit soft to really bring out the detail, but the little catchlight in the eye and the single-legged stance gives this guy personality.</td>', 'Perhaps just a bit soft to really bring out the detail, but the little catchlight in the eye and the single-legged stance gives this guy personality.', '2008-01-30 15:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440571, 638415, 33352, '<td valign="top">This is a good take as I know how hard they are to shoot.</td>', 'This is a good take as I know how hard they are to shoot.', '2008-01-30 15:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440575, 639046, 30982, '<td valign="top">The one on the left is apparently in the Goose Witness Protection Program and really didn''t want to be photographed.  The one yelling at him is his mother.  :-)</td>', 'The one on the left is apparently in the Goose Witness Protection Program and really didn''t want to be photographed.  The one yelling at him is his mother.  :-)', '2008-01-30 15:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440577, 638332, 33352, '<td valign="top">would have been good to see the faces.</td>', 'would have been good to see the faces.', '2008-01-30 15:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440580, 638827, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very tropical looking bird - lovely shade of blue and a nice pose.</td>', 'A very tropical looking bird - lovely shade of blue and a nice pose.', '2008-01-30 15:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440581, 638547, 33352, '<td valign="top">Neat image appears to have taken some of the texture.</td>', 'Neat image appears to have taken some of the texture.', '2008-01-30 15:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440585, 638438, 30982, '<td valign="top">She seems pleased with the offering - and it''s an interesting idea for a birdfeeder.  She is a little hard to see at first, though.</td>', 'She seems pleased with the offering - and it''s an interesting idea for a birdfeeder.  She is a little hard to see at first, though.', '2008-01-30 15:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440586, 637594, 33352, '<td valign="top">A little lost in the background.</td>', 'A little lost in the background.', '2008-01-30 15:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440590, 638986, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot.  I''m guessing the metaphorical bird isn''t scoring well, though.  I see the bird, so you''ll get a decent score from me.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot.  I''m guessing the metaphorical bird isn''t scoring well, though.  I see the bird, so you''ll get a decent score from me.', '2008-01-30 15:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440591, 638393, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great title, super sharp, nice pose.  Well done!</td>', 'Great title, super sharp, nice pose.  Well done!', '2008-01-30 15:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440592, 638633, 52500, '<td valign="top">I really like the earthy tones in this.</td>', 'I really like the earthy tones in this.', '2008-01-30 15:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440593, 636505, 52500, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually care much for eagles, but this is just too well done not to give it a high score.</td>', 'I don''t usually care much for eagles, but this is just too well done not to give it a high score.', '2008-01-30 15:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440598, 638781, 52500, '<td valign="top">Holy crap!  What the hell is that thing?</td>', 'Holy crap!  What the hell is that thing?', '2008-01-30 15:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440600, 638209, 52500, '<td valign="top">Holy perfect focus, Batman!</td>', 'Holy perfect focus, Batman!', '2008-01-30 15:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440602, 638306, 52500, '<td valign="top">I love your processing here.  I''m not really sure why, but the effect is striking.</td>', 'I love your processing here.  I''m not really sure why, but the effect is striking.', '2008-01-30 15:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440619, 637352, 43774, '<td valign="top">An artistic high contrast shot, nice!</td>', 'An artistic high contrast shot, nice!', '2008-01-30 15:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440626, 637199, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the seagull''s perch watching over his kingdom.  And I like the spit of sand in the distance that balances with that in the foreground.  I do think the blue may be a bit over the top, though.  Maybe try re-editing it with a bit less saturation, more natural color.</td>', 'I like the seagull''s perch watching over his kingdom.  And I like the spit of sand in the distance that balances with that in the foreground.  I do think the blue may be a bit over the top, though.  Maybe try re-editing it with a bit less saturation, more natural color.', '2008-01-30 15:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440633, 639030, 30982, '<td valign="top">Radiant sky and very nice simple sihouette.  I like the fact the picture is grounded well, too.</td>', 'Radiant sky and very nice simple sihouette.  I like the fact the picture is grounded well, too.', '2008-01-30 15:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440639, 638904, 30982, '<td valign="top">These guys are indeed quite weird looking.  You kinda feel sorry for ''em, but I suspect to each other they''re really quite handsome!  Excellent job of showing the detail.  (I lived in an apartment for a short while, and these guys lived in the pond there.  One day I came home, went inside, and a few minutes later there was a knock at my door.  It was three of these guys.  They literally knocked.  Apparently the former tenant fed them every evening!)</td>', 'These guys are indeed quite weird looking.  You kinda feel sorry for ''em, but I suspect to each other they''re really quite handsome!  Excellent job of showing the detail.  (I lived in an apartment for a short while, and these guys lived in the pond there.  One day I came home, went inside, and a few minutes later there was a knock at my door.  It was three of these guys.  They literally knocked.  Apparently the former tenant fed them every evening!)', '2008-01-30 15:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440643, 637956, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s not the gaze that grabs you, it''s that rather menacing beak!</td>', 'It''s not the gaze that grabs you, it''s that rather menacing beak!', '2008-01-30 15:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440668, 638587, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s kind of a surreal effect here - they almost look like carfully crafted statues on display.  Not sure if that''s what you were going for - probably due to a bit of overexposing the whites of the birds.</td>', 'There''s kind of a surreal effect here - they almost look like carfully crafted statues on display.  Not sure if that''s what you were going for - probably due to a bit of overexposing the whites of the birds.', '2008-01-30 15:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440675, 638116, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a busy afternoon at the park, when everyone brings their kids to play and catches up on the gossip.</td>', 'Looks like a busy afternoon at the park, when everyone brings their kids to play and catches up on the gossip.', '2008-01-30 15:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440680, 638267, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, particularly in the eye, and good rich color.  Looks like a bad hair day, too.  :-)  Seriously, great shot.</td>', 'Excellent detail, particularly in the eye, and good rich color.  Looks like a bad hair day, too.  :-)  Seriously, great shot.', '2008-01-30 15:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440688, 638942, 30982, '<td valign="top">These guys are such elegant posers.  The brightish light steals a bit of detail but allows for nice contrast of the bake against the bird and its surroundings.</td>', 'These guys are such elegant posers.  The brightish light steals a bit of detail but allows for nice contrast of the bake against the bird and its surroundings.', '2008-01-30 15:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440690, 638622, 30982, '<td valign="top">This shows really well how the male stands out but the female blends in.</td>', 'This shows really well how the male stands out but the female blends in.', '2008-01-30 15:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440691, 637453, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very serene and elegant.</td>', 'Very serene and elegant.', '2008-01-30 15:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440693, 639031, 30982, '<td valign="top">He''s tryin but I can still see him!  The colors and markings are quite striking.</td>', 'He''s tryin but I can still see him!  The colors and markings are quite striking.', '2008-01-30 15:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440694, 636505, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail, excellent light.</td>', 'Very nice detail, excellent light.', '2008-01-30 15:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440696, 638915, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!!  The gull looks rather unimpressed.  Lovely metalic look to the water in this.</td>', 'Heh!!  The gull looks rather unimpressed.  Lovely metalic look to the water in this.', '2008-01-30 15:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440699, 638664, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good detail in the bird - very pretty grays.  The use of what appears to be flash makes this a bit harsh.  I like the complimentary reds but the composition seems a bit awkward with the bird kind of cramped in the upper half of the frame, which is cut in half by the perch.</td>', 'Good detail in the bird - very pretty grays.  The use of what appears to be flash makes this a bit harsh.  I like the complimentary reds but the composition seems a bit awkward with the bird kind of cramped in the upper half of the frame, which is cut in half by the perch.', '2008-01-30 15:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440703, 638975, 30982, '<td valign="top">Either that or he had a really bad day.  I like the golds against the rich blues.</td>', 'Either that or he had a really bad day.  I like the golds against the rich blues.', '2008-01-30 15:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440706, 638901, 30982, '<td valign="top">The peanut almost looks as big as the bird!  Excellent shallow DOF shot.</td>', 'The peanut almost looks as big as the bird!  Excellent shallow DOF shot.', '2008-01-30 15:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440712, 638803, 30982, '<td valign="top">The impression I get from this is a night club performer - don''t ask me why.  Maybe the low light (which I like here) or the gold and red in the water that "sets the stage".</td>', 'The impression I get from this is a night club performer - don''t ask me why.  Maybe the low light (which I like here) or the gold and red in the water that "sets the stage".', '2008-01-30 16:00:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4440723, 639027, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the park-like atmosphere - heading to market, chatting about the days events.  A nice pleasant and enjoyable afternoon outing.</td>', 'I like the park-like atmosphere - heading to market, chatting about the days events.  A nice pleasant and enjoyable afternoon outing.', '2008-01-30 16:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440726, 637838, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting and appealing angle for the shot - very nice composition!</td>', 'Interesting and appealing angle for the shot - very nice composition!', '2008-01-30 16:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440727, 638755, 30982, '<td valign="top">More like a heckler.  Bunch of guys watching some sporting event down on the beach... or possibly checking out chicks.  :-)</td>', 'More like a heckler.  Bunch of guys watching some sporting event down on the beach... or possibly checking out chicks.  :-)', '2008-01-30 16:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440731, 638312, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant little fellow!  I didn''t know there were so many different varieties of bluebirds.  Good solid shot of this guy.</td>', 'Very vibrant little fellow!  I didn''t know there were so many different varieties of bluebirds.  Good solid shot of this guy.', '2008-01-30 16:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440734, 638688, 30982, '<td valign="top">That''s an intense stare!  Makes me wonder if this guy is real.  Interesting composition - kinda like he''s peeking out the window at you while the other one is watching TV on a Saturday night.</td>', 'That''s an intense stare!  Makes me wonder if this guy is real.  Interesting composition - kinda like he''s peeking out the window at you while the other one is watching TV on a Saturday night.', '2008-01-30 16:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440737, 637456, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful high key/high contrast/whatever it is.  Love the light hitting the sides of the birds.  To me, has a Mediterranean vacation feel to it, and I''ve never even been to the Mediterranean.</td>', 'Wonderful high key/high contrast/whatever it is.  Love the light hitting the sides of the birds.  To me, has a Mediterranean vacation feel to it, and I''ve never even been to the Mediterranean.', '2008-01-30 16:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440739, 638286, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Not only is this a good capture (the wave is adorable) but I love the blending blues.  Works well.</td>', 'Very cute!  Not only is this a good capture (the wave is adorable) but I love the blending blues.  Works well.', '2008-01-30 16:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440741, 638038, 30982, '<td valign="top">Actually, the eagle hasn''t done a whole lot, other than prevent itself from becoming extinct.  (Sorry, getting a bit slap-happy with comments.)  Regal pose, rich color, excellent detail, strong composition.  This is no doubt kicking butt.</td>', 'Actually, the eagle hasn''t done a whole lot, other than prevent itself from becoming extinct.  (Sorry, getting a bit slap-happy with comments.)  Regal pose, rich color, excellent detail, strong composition.  This is no doubt kicking butt.', '2008-01-30 16:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4440745, 638832, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Love the angle.  Reminds me of 60s California for some reason.  Love thos blue eyes!</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Love the angle.  Reminds me of 60s California for some reason.  Love thos blue eyes!', '2008-01-30 16:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
