(4441711, 638832, 75651, '<td valign="top">Great crop.  Great focus.  Great Capture!!</td>', 'Great crop.  Great focus.  Great Capture!!', '2008-01-30 20:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441715, 638637, 19245, '<td valign="top">extra points for the grass on the beak</td>', 'extra points for the grass on the beak', '2008-01-30 20:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441718, 638755, 75651, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  Love the color.  There is a distracting point that threw me a bit; this is really picky but the angle of the mouth on the main bird, is the same angle that is at the tail of another.  It is really distracting and almost flattens out the photo and takes away from that beautiful eye on the bird.  Love your whites and the composition(aside from the angle thing.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great focus.  Love the color.  There is a distracting point that threw me a bit; this is really picky but the angle of the mouth on the main bird, is the same angle that is at the tail of another.  It is really distracting and almost flattens out the photo and takes away from that beautiful eye on the bird.  Love your whites and the composition(aside from the angle thing.  Nice job.', '2008-01-30 20:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441723, 638087, 19245, '<td valign="top">the plant is a bit distracting.. I like the expression though!</td>', 'the plant is a bit distracting.. I like the expression though!', '2008-01-30 20:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441727, 637913, 75651, '<td valign="top">Not a sight captured everyday that''s for sure.  The background is distracting a bit, but the shallow DOP helps.  Very interseting shot.  Nice</td>', 'Not a sight captured everyday that''s for sure.  The background is distracting a bit, but the shallow DOP helps.  Very interseting shot.  Nice', '2008-01-30 20:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441732, 639031, 33352, '<td valign="top">Great colors, seems to have lost the texture.</td>', 'Great colors, seems to have lost the texture.', '2008-01-30 20:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441742, 638869, 75651, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, nice fous. no Wow-factor though.  I''m definitely scoring you ''Technically'' Great though.</td>', 'Nice framing, nice fous. no Wow-factor though.  I''m definitely scoring you ''Technically'' Great though.', '2008-01-30 20:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441749, 637302, 75651, '<td valign="top">Composition and focus is flawless.  However, it lacks the "WOW".  Still earns the highest ''8'' I can give for a technically shot photograph.  Nice Job</td>', 'Composition and focus is flawless.  However, it lacks the "WOW".  Still earns the highest ''8'' I can give for a technically shot photograph.  Nice Job', '2008-01-30 20:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441751, 638633, 75651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and crisp sharpness and a great muted background to make it pop out.  GREAT!!</td>', 'Beautiful colors and crisp sharpness and a great muted background to make it pop out.  GREAT!!', '2008-01-30 20:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441755, 637259, 19245, '<td valign="top">if this was in focus and cropped tighter it would be a killer shot!</td>', 'if this was in focus and cropped tighter it would be a killer shot!', '2008-01-30 20:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441757, 638969, 75651, '<td valign="top">Classic cardinal, hiding behing the twigs and limbs.  I wish they would just come out of there so we can get some uncluttered photos.  Nice colors  and focus though.  Good Job.</td>', 'Classic cardinal, hiding behing the twigs and limbs.  I wish they would just come out of there so we can get some uncluttered photos.  Nice colors  and focus though.  Good Job.', '2008-01-30 20:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441759, 638536, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very uniwue.  And the texture just Grabs you.  Only thing that may go against others might be the crop. It puts the bird walking out of the photo.  That''s my opinion though so what does it matter.  VERY NICELY DONE!!!!</td>', 'Very uniwue.  And the texture just Grabs you.  Only thing that may go against others might be the crop. It puts the bird walking out of the photo.  That''s my opinion though so what does it matter.  VERY NICELY DONE!!!!', '2008-01-30 20:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441768, 638861, 75651, '<td valign="top">Great focus.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great focus.  Nice job.', '2008-01-30 20:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441783, 638544, 75651, '<td valign="top">Crisp, crisp focus. However-the saturation (or lighting) is a bit much which adds to the colors almost merging together between the whites of the water and the whites of the bird making it a bit complex.</td>', 'Crisp, crisp focus. However-the saturation (or lighting) is a bit much which adds to the colors almost merging together between the whites of the water and the whites of the bird making it a bit complex.', '2008-01-30 21:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441793, 638996, 75651, '<td valign="top">This is a nice scene, but for this Challenge of birds, I''d really like to see their eyes and the colors of those beaks.  If you were to crop it so they were sitting on that lower left thirds line though, you really do would have a nice "photographic scene" of birds on the lake.   With an overcast day, those beaks really popped too.</td>', 'This is a nice scene, but for this Challenge of birds, I''d really like to see their eyes and the colors of those beaks.  If you were to crop it so they were sitting on that lower left thirds line though, you really do would have a nice "photographic scene" of birds on the lake.   With an overcast day, those beaks really popped too.', '2008-01-30 21:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441798, 637980, 75651, '<td valign="top">Great composition, great focus, great angles, great crop- need I go on? okay then... great backdrop, great simplicity, blah blah blah- you get the point.</td>', 'Great composition, great focus, great angles, great crop- need I go on? okay then... great backdrop, great simplicity, blah blah blah- you get the point.', '2008-01-30 21:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441800, 638596, 75651, '<td valign="top">Perfect.  The composition of this photo is absolutely perfect.  It is a classic representation of ducks on the water and you absolutely captured a moment that makes this thing POP.  PERFECT 10!!  Why not. It''s Perfect</td>', 'Perfect.  The composition of this photo is absolutely perfect.  It is a classic representation of ducks on the water and you absolutely captured a moment that makes this thing POP.  PERFECT 10!!  Why not. It''s Perfect', '2008-01-30 21:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441802, 638899, 75651, '<td valign="top">Long, slender, and nicely catured.  Very great shot.  Background really works with these birds.</td>', 'Long, slender, and nicely catured.  Very great shot.  Background really works with these birds.', '2008-01-30 21:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441803, 638876, 75651, '<td valign="top">Greedy greedy animals.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Greedy greedy animals.  Nice shot.', '2008-01-30 21:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441808, 638787, 75651, '<td valign="top">either its a bit out of focus or the bird is shivering.  Actually, judging by the snow, the bird is shivering.  Nice shot<br/> <br/>(P.S. I''m jealous you have snow!!)</td>', 'either its a bit out of focus or the bird is shivering.  Actually, judging by the snow, the bird is shivering.  Nice shot (P.S. I''m jealous you have snow!!)', '2008-01-30 21:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441811, 637288, 75651, '<td valign="top">Whatever editing you did, it really makes it look like a movie- Birds, AHHH!!!!   Kinda scary!  Awesome shot!</td>', 'Whatever editing you did, it really makes it look like a movie- Birds, AHHH!!!!   Kinda scary!  Awesome shot!', '2008-01-30 21:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441816, 638122, 75651, '<td valign="top">VERY very interesting photograph.  Tighly crop that and it''ll give it a bit more ''WOW''.  Great for an abstract look at birds.</td>', 'VERY very interesting photograph.  Tighly crop that and it''ll give it a bit more ''WOW''.  Great for an abstract look at birds.', '2008-01-30 21:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441819, 638116, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very very complex group.  Nice DOF, but too much going on IMHO.</td>', 'Very very complex group.  Nice DOF, but too much going on IMHO.', '2008-01-30 21:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441821, 637814, 75651, '<td valign="top">ewww, dirty birds! great job giving this bird a personality. Awesome photograph.</td>', 'ewww, dirty birds! great job giving this bird a personality. Awesome photograph.', '2008-01-30 21:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4441822, 638682, 75651, '<td valign="top">Gotta get that wing in the shot- as picky as it sounds, it really does make a huge difference compoistion wise.  Nice timing though.</td>', 'Gotta get that wing in the shot- as picky as it sounds, it really does make a huge difference compoistion wise.  Nice timing though.', '2008-01-30 21:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
