(4441869, 638113, 75651, '<td valign="top">It is lacking that WOW.  The blue is definitely not helping it wither.  Shows those colors with pride!!  Might want to try a tight crop showing just a bit of the solid part of the post and all of those arcs on top.  Crop the top leaving just a bit of head room for the bird to think about flying away and leave the colors sharp and bright.  I think you''d be surprised what a difference it''ll make.  It only my opinion. (  .  ) Here''s the grain of salt to go with it.</td>', 'It is lacking that WOW.  The blue is definitely not helping it wither.  Shows those colors with pride!!  Might want to try a tight crop showing just a bit of the solid part of the post and all of those arcs on top.  Crop the top leaving just a bit of head room for the bird to think about flying away and leave the colors sharp and bright.  I think you''d be surprised what a difference it''ll make.  It only my opinion. (  .  ) Here''s the grain of salt to go with it.', '2008-01-30 21:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
