(4442396, 637453, 47541, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I''d say this isn''t a night/twilight shot but it does have that feel to it.  I can''t really see that the bird is seeking anything and he''s a bit small in the frame as the abundance of negative space isn''t adding a lot of value.  All my opinion of course ;)</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I''d say this isn''t a night/twilight shot but it does have that feel to it.  I can''t really see that the bird is seeking anything and he''s a bit small in the frame as the abundance of negative space isn''t adding a lot of value.  All my opinion of course ;)', '2008-01-31 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442413, 638943, 38477, '<td valign="top">the main subject does not really stand out with the background and foreground having similar color</td>', 'the main subject does not really stand out with the background and foreground having similar color', '2008-01-31 02:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
