(4442465, 639037, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it feels crowded on the left and right sides relative to the top and bottom. If you had the option of pulling out further I might have liked to see that, otherwise a more square crop by bringing the top and bottom closer may have worked equally well. I also think the bright purple inner border is a slight distraction.</td>', 'Nice photo, but it feels crowded on the left and right sides relative to the top and bottom. If you had the option of pulling out further I might have liked to see that, otherwise a more square crop by bringing the top and bottom closer may have worked equally well. I also think the bright purple inner border is a slight distraction.', '2008-01-31 04:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442466, 638267, 1054, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image. Great DOF and "pose."</td>', 'Very powerful image. Great DOF and "pose."', '2008-01-31 04:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442467, 638695, 1054, '<td valign="top">Very moody and the duotone adds to this.</td>', 'Very moody and the duotone adds to this.', '2008-01-31 04:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442469, 637199, 1054, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this feels rather like a snapshot to me. The roadside guardrail is a huge distraction and the saturation on the blue and/or cyan looks like it has been pushed up way too far, which tends to bring out sensor noise besides giving the ocean a "fake" look. The photo definitely meets the challenge, but it does nothing beyond that. A great photo should usually stand on its own.</td>', 'Sorry, but this feels rather like a snapshot to me. The roadside guardrail is a huge distraction and the saturation on the blue and/or cyan looks like it has been pushed up way too far, which tends to bring out sensor noise besides giving the ocean a "fake" look. The photo definitely meets the challenge, but it does nothing beyond that. A great photo should usually stand on its own.', '2008-01-31 04:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442470, 638411, 1054, '<td valign="top">Wow... great tone control. The left wing *almost* gets lost in the background, so I hope you''re not getting clobbered by users with uncalibrated monitors. Kudos for such a great capture of this bird in flight, too.</td>', 'Wow... great tone control. The left wing *almost* gets lost in the background, so I hope you''re not getting clobbered by users with uncalibrated monitors. Kudos for such a great capture of this bird in flight, too.', '2008-01-31 04:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442473, 638025, 1054, '<td valign="top">At first I was going to say this is a rather ordinary photo, but I do rather like how you''ve captured the ripples emanating out. A polarizer might have helped lessen the haze int he water at the top. I''d have also preferred to see the stray feather on the right side of the image cloned out. I say cloned rather than cropped, because cropping would have lost the symmetery of the ripples. The feather does seem to break the symmetry and the otherwise clean circles.</td>', 'At first I was going to say this is a rather ordinary photo, but I do rather like how you''ve captured the ripples emanating out. A polarizer might have helped lessen the haze int he water at the top. I''d have also preferred to see the stray feather on the right side of the image cloned out. I say cloned rather than cropped, because cropping would have lost the symmetery of the ripples. The feather does seem to break the symmetry and the otherwise clean circles.', '2008-01-31 04:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442477, 639030, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette effect against the sunset (sunrise?). Exposure is perfect and the bird is what makes this photo.</td>', 'Great silhouette effect against the sunset (sunrise?). Exposure is perfect and the bird is what makes this photo.', '2008-01-31 04:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442480, 638611, 1054, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say that photos of statues, especially straight-on ones rarely impress me. It just seems to me that they dodge the real, well, challenge of the challenge, which is to be creative with the subject matter.</td>', 'Sorry to say that photos of statues, especially straight-on ones rarely impress me. It just seems to me that they dodge the real, well, challenge of the challenge, which is to be creative with the subject matter.', '2008-01-31 04:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442490, 638662, 1054, '<td valign="top">I love the strong diagonals but the birds almost get lost in the water here. A polarizer probably would have been a tremendous help.</td>', 'I love the strong diagonals but the birds almost get lost in the water here. A polarizer probably would have been a tremendous help.', '2008-01-31 04:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442492, 639032, 1054, '<td valign="top">The bird really stands out against the deep blue of the sky. The more I look at this, the more I like it.</td>', 'The bird really stands out against the deep blue of the sky. The more I look at this, the more I like it.', '2008-01-31 04:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442493, 638705, 1054, '<td valign="top">The bird is quite difficult to find amongst the cluttered foreground and background.</td>', 'The bird is quite difficult to find amongst the cluttered foreground and background.', '2008-01-31 04:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442494, 638547, 1054, '<td valign="top">I quite like this, and the title made me laugh, too!</td>', 'I quite like this, and the title made me laugh, too!', '2008-01-31 05:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442498, 638038, 1054, '<td valign="top">Freedom costs a bird? ;-) Eagle-as-American-symbol notwithstanding, the title seems to just not quite fit. As to the photo itself, the technicals are very good, but I am not fond of the downward-looking pose. Perhaps the title and downward look are intended to convey sadness at our soldiers lost in battle? If so, the connection is just not quite getting there for me.</td>', 'Freedom costs a bird? ;-) Eagle-as-American-symbol notwithstanding, the title seems to just not quite fit. As to the photo itself, the technicals are very good, but I am not fond of the downward-looking pose. Perhaps the title and downward look are intended to convey sadness at our soldiers lost in battle? If so, the connection is just not quite getting there for me.', '2008-01-31 05:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442503, 636550, 89662, '<td valign="top">bold</td>', 'bold', '2008-01-31 05:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442519, 637352, 80908, '<td valign="top">Very hitchcock look to this. I can see a lot of voters dismissing it, but I am not one of them. Good luck!</td>', 'Very hitchcock look to this. I can see a lot of voters dismissing it, but I am not one of them. Good luck!', '2008-01-31 05:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442520, 638611, 80908, '<td valign="top">Too small, too soft and not particularly well lit. Technically not a hard photo to take of a stationary subject and sadly can''t compare with some of the fabulous shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Too small, too soft and not particularly well lit. Technically not a hard photo to take of a stationary subject and sadly can''t compare with some of the fabulous shots in this challenge.', '2008-01-31 05:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442521, 637454, 80908, '<td valign="top">Not really in focus and the coloured T-Shirt was not the ideal choice of background...</td>', 'Not really in focus and the coloured T-Shirt was not the ideal choice of background...', '2008-01-31 05:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442522, 637913, 80908, '<td valign="top">Technically a bit noisy and perhaps over-sharpened but such a priceless moment to capture, well done!</td>', 'Technically a bit noisy and perhaps over-sharpened but such a priceless moment to capture, well done!', '2008-01-31 05:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442532, 638648, 75651, '<td valign="top">I really want to say that that bird is alive, but it''s foot looks like it is floating in the air.  No one said it had to be a live bird though- right? (OR- it is so perfect, that its hard to comprehend how real it is!!LOL)  Nice crisp focus, good background and composition.  Excellent!</td>', 'I really want to say that that bird is alive, but it''s foot looks like it is floating in the air.  No one said it had to be a live bird though- right? (OR- it is so perfect, that its hard to comprehend how real it is!!LOL)  Nice crisp focus, good background and composition.  Excellent!', '2008-01-31 05:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442555, 637389, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good action capture - I do like the blur of wings in shots like these.  A bit of color noise, but not too bad.</td>', 'A good action capture - I do like the blur of wings in shots like these.  A bit of color noise, but not too bad.', '2008-01-31 06:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442556, 637603, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good shot, elegant pose!  These guys make such gorgeous models.</td>', 'Good shot, elegant pose!  These guys make such gorgeous models.', '2008-01-31 06:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442557, 637352, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the title but I like the shot!</td>', 'Not sure of the title but I like the shot!', '2008-01-31 06:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442558, 638730, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good shot to show off the colors but I''d like a little background to add a more three dimensional feel.</td>', 'Good shot to show off the colors but I''d like a little background to add a more three dimensional feel.', '2008-01-31 06:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442559, 638946, 30982, '<td valign="top">He''d probably still have that other leg if he didn''t keep standing on barbeque grills...  Light is a bit harsh/strong but a very good specimen to photograph.</td>', 'He''d probably still have that other leg if he didn''t keep standing on barbeque grills...  Light is a bit harsh/strong but a very good specimen to photograph.', '2008-01-31 06:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442560, 638232, 30982, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the background, ever so slight, gives this beautiful depth.</td>', 'The inclusion of the background, ever so slight, gives this beautiful depth.', '2008-01-31 06:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442562, 638855, 30982, '<td valign="top">Because of the angle you chose and the way water against the feathers appears, this looks like an iceberg with a personality.  :-)  I like the swoop of the neck.</td>', 'Because of the angle you chose and the way water against the feathers appears, this looks like an iceberg with a personality.  :-)  I like the swoop of the neck.', '2008-01-31 06:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442563, 638316, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice job of handling the cross-hatch of a cage to provide a very complimentary background.  Good color and detail on the bird.</td>', 'Nice job of handling the cross-hatch of a cage to provide a very complimentary background.  Good color and detail on the bird.', '2008-01-31 06:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442564, 637949, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the line of a pier or such into the water.  Nice way of showing how a bird probably sees our world - just sort of a hazy background off in the distance.</td>', 'Love the line of a pier or such into the water.  Nice way of showing how a bird probably sees our world - just sort of a hazy background off in the distance.', '2008-01-31 06:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442573, 638883, 21617, '<td valign="top">what did you do to his eye in post processing?  Or was it this way naturally?</td>', 'what did you do to his eye in post processing?  Or was it this way naturally?', '2008-01-31 06:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442574, 638270, 21617, '<td valign="top">great composition</td>', 'great composition', '2008-01-31 06:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442596, 637589, 30982, '<td valign="top">He almost looks like he''s a bit worried you''re going to take his seed from him.  Good side view to show his feathers.  Could be a bit sharper, maybe, to really emphasize the detail.</td>', 'He almost looks like he''s a bit worried you''re going to take his seed from him.  Good side view to show his feathers.  Could be a bit sharper, maybe, to really emphasize the detail.', '2008-01-31 06:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442597, 637393, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute little thing - and quite round.  Very nice use of DOF, good warm supporting bokeh, and a very pleasing composition.</td>', 'Cute little thing - and quite round.  Very nice use of DOF, good warm supporting bokeh, and a very pleasing composition.', '2008-01-31 07:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442598, 638928, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  He looks folded over in all the wrong directions!  A very interesting pose indeed.</td>', 'Heh!  He looks folded over in all the wrong directions!  A very interesting pose indeed.', '2008-01-31 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442599, 638980, 30982, '<td valign="top">Almost like time lapse but with three different birds.  Just a bit on the "is there more to this" side, though.</td>', 'Almost like time lapse but with three different birds.  Just a bit on the "is there more to this" side, though.', '2008-01-31 07:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442601, 637912, 30982, '<td valign="top">An EXCELLENT composition to showcase these often-hated birds.  I quite like ''em, even though they''re terribly dirty.  They''re also fun to watch and quite pretty.</td>', 'An EXCELLENT composition to showcase these often-hated birds.  I quite like ''em, even though they''re terribly dirty.  They''re also fun to watch and quite pretty.', '2008-01-31 07:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442603, 638696, 30982, '<td valign="top">I suspect this is also quite good in its more natural version - the electric treatment of the tree limb is kinda nifty but perhaps a bit much for this particular site.  I do like the way it outlines the closer gull.</td>', 'I suspect this is also quite good in its more natural version - the electric treatment of the tree limb is kinda nifty but perhaps a bit much for this particular site.  I do like the way it outlines the closer gull.', '2008-01-31 07:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442606, 637913, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing.  I like the action you captured a lot, but I''m not as sure about the way the lower bird, especially, looks almost drawn in rather than photographed.</td>', 'Interesting processing.  I like the action you captured a lot, but I''m not as sure about the way the lower bird, especially, looks almost drawn in rather than photographed.', '2008-01-31 07:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442612, 638076, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the fur stole - for giant not-so-pretty birds, they dress up nicely for their headshots!  I like the composition here.</td>', 'Love the fur stole - for giant not-so-pretty birds, they dress up nicely for their headshots!  I like the composition here.', '2008-01-31 07:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442614, 638809, 30982, '<td valign="top">If guessing the title, I would have said "Pretty in Pink" - reminds me of a ballerina.  Excellent capture.</td>', 'If guessing the title, I would have said "Pretty in Pink" - reminds me of a ballerina.  Excellent capture.', '2008-01-31 07:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442617, 636592, 30982, '<td valign="top">Neat - the processing and light makes these guys look like plastic flamingos in someone''s flooded front yard.</td>', 'Neat - the processing and light makes these guys look like plastic flamingos in someone''s flooded front yard.', '2008-01-31 07:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442621, 638899, 30982, '<td valign="top">The blue background serves to add a nice chill factor to this.</td>', 'The blue background serves to add a nice chill factor to this.', '2008-01-31 07:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442624, 638536, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  And we wonder where people get ideas like hair extensions... Very good capture of a fascinating bird.</td>', 'LOL!  And we wonder where people get ideas like hair extensions... Very good capture of a fascinating bird.', '2008-01-31 07:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442627, 638607, 30982, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot showing the whole brotherly concept.  To really bring out the details (one looks older than the other, for instance), you need a bit sharper focus.</td>', 'Pretty good shot showing the whole brotherly concept.  To really bring out the details (one looks older than the other, for instance), you need a bit sharper focus.', '2008-01-31 07:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442629, 637840, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!!  Just read the title - really suits this well.  Not only does the one look like he''s bragging, the other looks completely disinterested in the whole fish story.</td>', 'LOL!!  Just read the title - really suits this well.  Not only does the one look like he''s bragging, the other looks completely disinterested in the whole fish story.', '2008-01-31 07:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442632, 638017, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like he posed in a studio for you!  I''d kinda like to see those massively powerful feet.</td>', 'Looks like he posed in a studio for you!  I''d kinda like to see those massively powerful feet.', '2008-01-31 07:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442634, 638833, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - he does look like he''s late for an appointment, and only just remembered.  Probably not as crisp as you would have liked it to be, but good timing to catch the foot action in the water.</td>', 'Heh - he does look like he''s late for an appointment, and only just remembered.  Probably not as crisp as you would have liked it to be, but good timing to catch the foot action in the water.', '2008-01-31 07:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442637, 636961, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kinda cool that you''d not really notice there are two birds except by the shadow - then you notice the second beak.</td>', 'Kinda cool that you''d not really notice there are two birds except by the shadow - then you notice the second beak.', '2008-01-31 07:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442646, 638820, 88010, '<td valign="top">Fovus is a little soft, doesn''t quite POP. Composition is a little too far right, not leaving the subject any room to move into the frame, otherwisw very nice.</td>', 'Fovus is a little soft, doesn''t quite POP. Composition is a little too far right, not leaving the subject any room to move into the frame, otherwisw very nice.', '2008-01-31 07:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442651, 638832, 20530, '<td valign="top">I love pelicans and I LOVE this shot! Awesome colors, detail and sharpness. The dark BG creates a great contrast. You''ve really captured pelican personality.</td>', 'I love pelicans and I LOVE this shot! Awesome colors, detail and sharpness. The dark BG creates a great contrast. You''ve really captured pelican personality.', '2008-01-31 07:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442653, 638393, 88010, '<td valign="top">Love the blue sky, haven''t seen a blue sky in Michigan in weeks. composition good, colors good, contrast and saturation good. Focus good but not POPPING good. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Love the blue sky, haven''t seen a blue sky in Michigan in weeks. composition good, colors good, contrast and saturation good. Focus good but not POPPING good. Very nice shot.', '2008-01-31 07:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442654, 637422, 88010, '<td valign="top">A little soft, not quite popping sharp. But everything else is very nice.</td>', 'A little soft, not quite popping sharp. But everything else is very nice.', '2008-01-31 07:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442657, 637980, 88010, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite pop off the frame with sharpness, perhaps too much cropping?</td>', 'Doesn''t quite pop off the frame with sharpness, perhaps too much cropping?', '2008-01-31 07:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442659, 637906, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very colorful. Good focus, dof, colors, contrast, saturation, Nice background. Good job all around.</td>', 'Very colorful. Good focus, dof, colors, contrast, saturation, Nice background. Good job all around.', '2008-01-31 07:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442662, 638578, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a regal and royal looking creature!  He looks to be a crown prince about to hold court, dressed in his finest finery.  Nicely done on the composition, too.</td>', 'What a regal and royal looking creature!  He looks to be a crown prince about to hold court, dressed in his finest finery.  Nicely done on the composition, too.', '2008-01-31 07:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442663, 638776, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderul timing and the silver of the water is very elegant!  The shot as a whole says "elegance" to me.  Quite beautiful.</td>', 'Wonderul timing and the silver of the water is very elegant!  The shot as a whole says "elegance" to me.  Quite beautiful.', '2008-01-31 07:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442664, 638673, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice capture - I like the moss stuff both hanging around the bird and as shadows on it.  There''s a very good sense of depth to the shot.  The color is just right, and the centered composition works very well here because of the balance provided by the tree trunk.</td>', 'This is a very nice capture - I like the moss stuff both hanging around the bird and as shadows on it.  There''s a very good sense of depth to the shot.  The color is just right, and the centered composition works very well here because of the balance provided by the tree trunk.', '2008-01-31 07:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442665, 638869, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect title!  One definitely gets that impression from this.  Great soft light, very nice natural color.</td>', 'Perfect title!  One definitely gets that impression from this.  Great soft light, very nice natural color.', '2008-01-31 07:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442692, 638232, 88010, '<td valign="top">Just a tad too dark to really work for me. The idea was very good. And it''s a little soft.</td>', 'Just a tad too dark to really work for me. The idea was very good. And it''s a little soft.', '2008-01-31 07:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442693, 638768, 88010, '<td valign="top">Bottoms up. A little grainy. Not quite popping sharp.</td>', 'Bottoms up. A little grainy. Not quite popping sharp.', '2008-01-31 07:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442695, 637594, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the bird''s personality!</td>', 'Great capture of the bird''s personality!', '2008-01-31 07:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442697, 637844, 60698, '<td valign="top">He''s so cute and stands out nicely against the dark background. Great detail and colors!</td>', 'He''s so cute and stands out nicely against the dark background. Great detail and colors!', '2008-01-31 07:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442704, 638492, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great photo! Wonder why he''s picking up a pigeon like that? Interesting!</td>', 'Great photo! Wonder why he''s picking up a pigeon like that? Interesting!', '2008-01-31 07:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442731, 638776, 88010, '<td valign="top">Just slightly overexposed and a not popping sharp. But overall a decent image.</td>', 'Just slightly overexposed and a not popping sharp. But overall a decent image.', '2008-01-31 08:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442733, 638267, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very nice, sharp and crisp with good detail, nice composition, correct color and saturation. Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice, sharp and crisp with good detail, nice composition, correct color and saturation. Nice job.', '2008-01-31 08:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442735, 639023, 88010, '<td valign="top">A little soft, probably from cropping too much. And just slightly overexposed loosing the details in the feathers.</td>', 'A little soft, probably from cropping too much. And just slightly overexposed loosing the details in the feathers.', '2008-01-31 08:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442737, 638596, 88010, '<td valign="top">Tuff shot, the water is overexposed and the ducks ae underexposed, you have no detail in either.</td>', 'Tuff shot, the water is overexposed and the ducks ae underexposed, you have no detail in either.', '2008-01-31 08:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442758, 638457, 88010, '<td valign="top">Backlit can be so tuff. Your exposure looks ok on both sides, but it just doesn''t POP. Get any lighter for teh duck and you loose the background, Burning and dodging are about the only cure. But nice job on the focus etc.</td>', 'Backlit can be so tuff. Your exposure looks ok on both sides, but it just doesn''t POP. Get any lighter for teh duck and you loose the background, Burning and dodging are about the only cure. But nice job on the focus etc.', '2008-01-31 08:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442766, 638808, 88010, '<td valign="top">Kensington Metro Park in Milford MI, has birds that will eat from your hand. Very fun. Nice photo.</td>', 'Kensington Metro Park in Milford MI, has birds that will eat from your hand. Very fun. Nice photo.', '2008-01-31 08:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442767, 637456, 88010, '<td valign="top">Contrast is too high for me. And the focus across the plain of the birds seems a bit soft. The ocean line is totally blown out.</td>', 'Contrast is too high for me. And the focus across the plain of the birds seems a bit soft. The ocean line is totally blown out.', '2008-01-31 08:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442771, 637535, 88010, '<td valign="top">If he isn''t carefull he''ll be road kill himself and he''ll be someones dinner. I''m surprised he stayed there for you. But as a photo goes it''s too snapshotish. No pizzazz, he blends right in to the background, the contrast is a bit flat.</td>', 'If he isn''t carefull he''ll be road kill himself and he''ll be someones dinner. I''m surprised he stayed there for you. But as a photo goes it''s too snapshotish. No pizzazz, he blends right in to the background, the contrast is a bit flat.', '2008-01-31 08:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4442775, 638696, 88010, '<td valign="top">Well you really did something weird here. Kinda spooky looking. And the bird looks like he was cut and pasted. Not my cup of tea at all.</td>', 'Well you really did something weird here. Kinda spooky looking. And the bird looks like he was cut and pasted. Not my cup of tea at all.', '2008-01-31 08:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
