(4443435, 638695, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice photo other than the vignette. To me a vignette looks like a lens probelm so I don''t care for them.</td>', 'Nice photo other than the vignette. To me a vignette looks like a lens probelm so I don''t care for them.', '2008-01-31 12:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443437, 637868, 88010, '<td valign="top">No bird?</td>', 'No bird?', '2008-01-31 12:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443444, 638985, 88010, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice shot with good color, contrast and saturation. Focus is good. I would have composed for a little to the left, putting the head at the magic "thirds" mark.</td>', 'Pretty nice shot with good color, contrast and saturation. Focus is good. I would have composed for a little to the left, putting the head at the magic "thirds" mark.', '2008-01-31 12:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443449, 636622, 88010, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a lot of birds. Darned winter gray sky, sasme problem i have in Michigan. A blue sky and this would have been really cool.</td>', 'Now that''s a lot of birds. Darned winter gray sky, sasme problem i have in Michigan. A blue sky and this would have been really cool.', '2008-01-31 12:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443453, 638722, 88010, '<td valign="top">Not quite crisp like some here. But not as fuzzy as some either. Colors and contrast are ok. Maybe just a tad over-exposed leaving little detail in the whites.</td>', 'Not quite crisp like some here. But not as fuzzy as some either. Colors and contrast are ok. Maybe just a tad over-exposed leaving little detail in the whites.', '2008-01-31 12:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443459, 638673, 88010, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird, especially like the little pink strerak, our bluebirds don''t have that. Well composed, nice color, saturation and contrast. Nice job.</td>', 'Pretty bird, especially like the little pink strerak, our bluebirds don''t have that. Well composed, nice color, saturation and contrast. Nice job.', '2008-01-31 12:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443465, 638730, 88010, '<td valign="top">could be sharper around the eyes, also a little noise in there. Contrast might be  a tad too high as well.</td>', 'could be sharper around the eyes, also a little noise in there. Contrast might be  a tad too high as well.', '2008-01-31 12:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443468, 639013, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good exposure, could be a little sharper but not bad. If the sky were a tad darker blue this would really pop.</td>', 'Nice shot, good exposure, could be a little sharper but not bad. If the sky were a tad darker blue this would really pop.', '2008-01-31 12:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443474, 638594, 88010, '<td valign="top">good color, a little light in contrast but not much, nice saturation. And I like the composition.</td>', 'good color, a little light in contrast but not much, nice saturation. And I like the composition.', '2008-01-31 12:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443478, 637199, 88010, '<td valign="top">The bird is very blown out. Exposure is too long or your contrast is too high. Plus the composition has too much in it. I would shoot to exclude that guard rail. In photography, "less is more".</td>', 'The bird is very blown out. Exposure is too long or your contrast is too high. Plus the composition has too much in it. I would shoot to exclude that guard rail. In photography, "less is more".', '2008-01-31 12:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443486, 638788, 88010, '<td valign="top">Fairly good exposure, the light is quite harsh and hard to handle both highlights and shadows. The composition is nice. But the focus is not on the eyes and that is very important in animal photo''s.</td>', 'Fairly good exposure, the light is quite harsh and hard to handle both highlights and shadows. The composition is nice. But the focus is not on the eyes and that is very important in animal photo''s.', '2008-01-31 12:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443489, 638817, 88010, '<td valign="top">That''s a face only his mother could love. Nice composition and exposure. The focus is a bit soft though.</td>', 'That''s a face only his mother could love. Nice composition and exposure. The focus is a bit soft though.', '2008-01-31 12:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443494, 638943, 88010, '<td valign="top">looks a bit soft, perhaps from a big crop? I don''t mind the contrast at all and the colors look very natural. Composition is nice as well.</td>', 'looks a bit soft, perhaps from a big crop? I don''t mind the contrast at all and the colors look very natural. Composition is nice as well.', '2008-01-31 12:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443498, 638650, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice ans sharp, good colors and contrast and saturation. Good job.</td>', 'Nice ans sharp, good colors and contrast and saturation. Good job.', '2008-01-31 12:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443527, 638723, 88010, '<td valign="top">what a fun picture. Not quite sharp all around but fun. Also, it would be better if there were more space in front of the duck so the subject is moving into the frame and not leaving teh frame.</td>', 'what a fun picture. Not quite sharp all around but fun. Also, it would be better if there were more space in front of the duck so the subject is moving into the frame and not leaving teh frame.', '2008-01-31 13:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443530, 638858, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very soft, either from a big crop or camera movement or both. But what a nice sight to see.</td>', 'Very soft, either from a big crop or camera movement or both. But what a nice sight to see.', '2008-01-31 13:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443539, 638980, 88010, '<td valign="top">very soft and out of focus.</td>', 'very soft and out of focus.', '2008-01-31 13:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443541, 638613, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus.But i like the setting. TYhe colors look natural and not over saturated. A fill flash would have put a catchlight in the eyes and that would have helped a lot too.</td>', 'Very soft focus.But i like the setting. TYhe colors look natural and not over saturated. A fill flash would have put a catchlight in the eyes and that would have helped a lot too.', '2008-01-31 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443546, 638209, 88010, '<td valign="top">nice and sharp around the eyes, where it needs to be. colors look natural. background is totally OOF. Good job.</td>', 'nice and sharp around the eyes, where it needs to be. colors look natural. background is totally OOF. Good job.', '2008-01-31 13:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443547, 638914, 88010, '<td valign="top">Focus is very soft or camera movement. Nice composition, nice catchlight in the eyes.</td>', 'Focus is very soft or camera movement. Nice composition, nice catchlight in the eyes.', '2008-01-31 13:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443558, 638915, 88010, '<td valign="top">Love the title! Wish it were a hair sharper though and maybe a little less contrast. Colors look natural. The whites are blown out, maybe with less contrast or bracket exposures the whites could have been saved.</td>', 'Love the title! Wish it were a hair sharper though and maybe a little less contrast. Colors look natural. The whites are blown out, maybe with less contrast or bracket exposures the whites could have been saved.', '2008-01-31 13:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443559, 638988, 88010, '<td valign="top">It''s sharpest around the eyes, and the eyes need to be sharp, but still not as sharp as it should be. this could be from a large crop or a little camera movement. colors and contrast look great.</td>', 'It''s sharpest around the eyes, and the eyes need to be sharp, but still not as sharp as it should be. this could be from a large crop or a little camera movement. colors and contrast look great.', '2008-01-31 13:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443563, 638810, 88010, '<td valign="top">Very prety bird, but too soft either from a big crop or camera movement. Colors and contrast look fine.</td>', 'Very prety bird, but too soft either from a big crop or camera movement. Colors and contrast look fine.', '2008-01-31 13:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443861, 639014, 6534, '<td valign="top">This photograph just makes me smile :)</td>', 'This photograph just makes me smile :)', '2008-01-31 15:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4443944, 637983, 61961, '<td valign="top">The frame is so overdone, I wonder if it''s to disguise a lack of sharpness in the image.  However, the image is good and it will end up with at least a 6 from me.</td>', 'The frame is so overdone, I wonder if it''s to disguise a lack of sharpness in the image.  However, the image is good and it will end up with at least a 6 from me.', '2008-01-31 15:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444025, 638286, 41864, '<td valign="top">Love the title. Angle makes it a little difficult to see its face.</td>', 'Love the title. Angle makes it a little difficult to see its face.', '2008-01-31 16:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444172, 638038, 70875, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title.</td>', 'I don''t get the title.', '2008-01-31 17:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444196, 638440, 60698, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!</td>', 'Beautifully done!', '2008-01-31 17:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444257, 638142, 88010, '<td valign="top">The  biggest problem I see is that all of the subjects are walking away from us.</td>', 'The  biggest problem I see is that all of the subjects are walking away from us.', '2008-01-31 18:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444262, 638997, 88010, '<td valign="top">A little soft in focus, probably hand held? or too much cropping. And with a tall subject I would have cropped or shot in portrait, wide pic for wide objects, tall pic for tall subjects.</td>', 'A little soft in focus, probably hand held? or too much cropping. And with a tall subject I would have cropped or shot in portrait, wide pic for wide objects, tall pic for tall subjects.', '2008-01-31 18:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444263, 638032, 88010, '<td valign="top">Wow, pretty bird, a little soft in the focus dept. colors and saturation and contrast are all good. Background is a little hot.</td>', 'Wow, pretty bird, a little soft in the focus dept. colors and saturation and contrast are all good. Background is a little hot.', '2008-01-31 18:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444266, 637467, 88010, '<td valign="top">He is so ugly he''s cute. Nice focus. i would mabye consider portrait mode for tall subjects though for more impact.</td>', 'He is so ugly he''s cute. Nice focus. i would mabye consider portrait mode for tall subjects though for more impact.', '2008-01-31 18:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444269, 638782, 88010, '<td valign="top">Lots of contrast here and lots of color too. So much color from over saturation that it no longer looks real.</td>', 'Lots of contrast here and lots of color too. So much color from over saturation that it no longer looks real.', '2008-01-31 18:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444271, 638960, 88010, '<td valign="top">pretty well done. nice focus crisp and sharp. colors and saturation and contrast all good.</td>', 'pretty well done. nice focus crisp and sharp. colors and saturation and contrast all good.', '2008-01-31 18:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444272, 638270, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the bird, focus is good, contrast and colors good, but the background is really really really distracting.</td>', 'Nice job on the bird, focus is good, contrast and colors good, but the background is really really really distracting.', '2008-01-31 18:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444275, 638302, 88010, '<td valign="top">I thought they were more pink than orange ? maybe not. Anyway,the colors are nice and bright, focus isn''t real sharp, and the composition is not real appealing with the other bird right behind him.</td>', 'I thought they were more pink than orange ? maybe not. Anyway,the colors are nice and bright, focus isn''t real sharp, and the composition is not real appealing with the other bird right behind him.', '2008-01-31 18:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444277, 638752, 88010, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. Wish it were a little sharper. colors, contrast and saturation are all nice.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. Wish it were a little sharper. colors, contrast and saturation are all nice.', '2008-01-31 18:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444280, 638995, 88010, '<td valign="top">cool pic. focus is ok, colors and contrast good. And carrying the twigs is pretty cool. Nice job.</td>', 'cool pic. focus is ok, colors and contrast good. And carrying the twigs is pretty cool. Nice job.', '2008-01-31 18:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444281, 638946, 88010, '<td valign="top">The exposure is a bit too hot and he needs a little room in front of him to move into. But...he survives and that''s cool!</td>', 'The exposure is a bit too hot and he needs a little room in front of him to move into. But...he survives and that''s cool!', '2008-01-31 18:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444284, 638039, 88010, '<td valign="top">focus, color, contrast, saturation are all good. But....?</td>', 'focus, color, contrast, saturation are all good. But....?', '2008-01-31 18:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444289, 638876, 88010, '<td valign="top">I hate it when i see the food, but this is still a nice shot. contrast is right, exposure is good, colors realistic and the focus is where it belongs, which has been rare in this challenge. Nice job.</td>', 'I hate it when i see the food, but this is still a nice shot. contrast is right, exposure is good, colors realistic and the focus is where it belongs, which has been rare in this challenge. Nice job.', '2008-01-31 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444290, 636851, 88010, '<td valign="top">Niec title, and that''s one way to stay warm. But he is a not totally sharp, crisp and clear.</td>', 'Niec title, and that''s one way to stay warm. But he is a not totally sharp, crisp and clear.', '2008-01-31 18:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444292, 638327, 88010, '<td valign="top">colors are wrong, focus seems off, contrast is way too high, and I would guess that was all intended. But it still fails as art in my honest opinion. sorry.</td>', 'colors are wrong, focus seems off, contrast is way too high, and I would guess that was all intended. But it still fails as art in my honest opinion. sorry.', '2008-01-31 18:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
