(4444367, 637456, 45524, '<td valign="top">Tough lighting conditions for this shot. I do like the silhouettes, but there are some blown areas, wether they are intentional or not I''m not sure.</td>', 'Tough lighting conditions for this shot. I do like the silhouettes, but there are some blown areas, wether they are intentional or not I''m not sure.', '2008-01-31 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444371, 638863, 45524, '<td valign="top">I wish you had moved around a bit to get the boat out of the shot, it takes a bit away from the shot. I like the timing with the colors in the sky.</td>', 'I wish you had moved around a bit to get the boat out of the shot, it takes a bit away from the shot. I like the timing with the colors in the sky.', '2008-01-31 19:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444404, 638097, 45524, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of this processing, this looks more like a painting then a photograph. As a painting this is nice, however this is a photography site.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of this processing, this looks more like a painting then a photograph. As a painting this is nice, however this is a photography site.', '2008-01-31 19:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444462, 638893, 18374, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness and action in this shot, but in my opinion the dynamic contrast between the highlights on the beak and the dark space at the edges of the photo is a bit too harsh.</td>', 'I like the sharpness and action in this shot, but in my opinion the dynamic contrast between the highlights on the beak and the dark space at the edges of the photo is a bit too harsh.', '2008-01-31 20:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444471, 637454, 18374, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot is a bit harsh for my tastes (looks like direct, on-camera flash).  Perhaps diffusing or adding another light source would help produce some interesting lighting gradients or shadows.</td>', 'The lighting on this shot is a bit harsh for my tastes (looks like direct, on-camera flash).  Perhaps diffusing or adding another light source would help produce some interesting lighting gradients or shadows.', '2008-01-31 20:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444475, 636450, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp!  I like the soft background and the color.  My only suggestion would be for a different crop- the way it is right now feels a little heavily weighted towards left of the photo and is taking my eye out of the image rather than in.</td>', 'Nice and sharp!  I like the soft background and the color.  My only suggestion would be for a different crop- the way it is right now feels a little heavily weighted towards left of the photo and is taking my eye out of the image rather than in.', '2008-01-31 20:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444484, 637393, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice job with what appears to be a difficult, high dynamic range exposure.  Did you use a flash?</td>', 'Nice job with what appears to be a difficult, high dynamic range exposure.  Did you use a flash?', '2008-01-31 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444498, 638812, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice bird, but as a challenge entry, this is a little cluttered and the subject does not stand out very well.</td>', 'Nice bird, but as a challenge entry, this is a little cluttered and the subject does not stand out very well.', '2008-01-31 20:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444507, 638922, 18374, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what you were going for here, but the reflections in the glass are a bit distracting and the bright highlights in the background windows draw the eye from the main subject.</td>', 'I''m not sure what you were going for here, but the reflections in the glass are a bit distracting and the bright highlights in the background windows draw the eye from the main subject.', '2008-01-31 20:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444508, 638903, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like the sharp separation between the subject and the background.</td>', 'Very nice!  I like the sharp separation between the subject and the background.', '2008-01-31 20:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444513, 638946, 18374, '<td valign="top">I think the background is a distraction here.  I would recommend using a larger aperture to make the background more out of focus.</td>', 'I think the background is a distraction here.  I would recommend using a larger aperture to make the background more out of focus.', '2008-01-31 20:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444519, 638833, 18374, '<td valign="top">This is OK, though it looks a bit over-sharpened.  I like the reflection.</td>', 'This is OK, though it looks a bit over-sharpened.  I like the reflection.', '2008-01-31 20:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444525, 638887, 18374, '<td valign="top">I might prefer this with a different crop.  My eye is drawn all the way to the left where the swan''s eye is and out of the picture.</td>', 'I might prefer this with a different crop.  My eye is drawn all the way to the left where the swan''s eye is and out of the picture.', '2008-01-31 20:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444527, 638980, 18374, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the subjects are too small in this shot and also look out of focus or blurred from camera shake.  My recommendation would be to get closer or get a longer lens or zoom.</td>', 'Unfortunately the subjects are too small in this shot and also look out of focus or blurred from camera shake.  My recommendation would be to get closer or get a longer lens or zoom.', '2008-01-31 20:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444528, 637868, 83313, '<td valign="top">A shoehorn to be sure, but heck, I almost entered a shot of a MIG-15, so I''ll go easy on the DNMC. <br/> <br/>I really like this. She''s got a cute look on her face. I suppose the pursed lips are meant to look like a beak? Love the face paint as well. Also a fave for this. I want to be able to easily find this one again.</td>', 'A shoehorn to be sure, but heck, I almost entered a shot of a MIG-15, so I''ll go easy on the DNMC.  I really like this. She''s got a cute look on her face. I suppose the pursed lips are meant to look like a beak? Love the face paint as well. Also a fave for this. I want to be able to easily find this one again.', '2008-01-31 20:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444530, 638142, 18374, '<td valign="top">I might have preferred having the geese facing me in the photo rather than showing me their backsides.</td>', 'I might have preferred having the geese facing me in the photo rather than showing me their backsides.', '2008-01-31 20:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444542, 637542, 18374, '<td valign="top">A wider aperture might help blur the background more to make it less distracting from the subject.  Having the bird''s eye at the far left of the photo leads the viewer''s eye out of the photo rather than into it.</td>', 'A wider aperture might help blur the background more to make it less distracting from the subject.  Having the bird''s eye at the far left of the photo leads the viewer''s eye out of the photo rather than into it.', '2008-01-31 20:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444554, 638411, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp.  Great flight shot.  The contrasts seem a bit harsh and I am kind of bothered by the shadows(?) and hard lines on the wings</td>', 'Nice and sharp.  Great flight shot.  The contrasts seem a bit harsh and I am kind of bothered by the shadows(?) and hard lines on the wings', '2008-01-31 20:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4444563, 638904, 18374, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  That is certainly an ugly bird.</td>', 'Nice shot.  That is certainly an ugly bird.', '2008-01-31 20:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
