(4444911, 637467, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice details. The background appears to have been blurred in the computer, and the pattern is mildly distracting from the subject. If it was not, I would sure like to know how you achieved that look.</td>', 'Nice details. The background appears to have been blurred in the computer, and the pattern is mildly distracting from the subject. If it was not, I would sure like to know how you achieved that look.', '2008-01-31 23:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
