(4445904, 638232, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the glow of the egret with very dark background, although I find myself searchng the negative space for detail. Maybe too dark.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the glow of the egret with very dark background, although I find myself searchng the negative space for detail. Maybe too dark.', '2008-02-01 09:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
