(4446072, 638903, 51597, '<td valign="top">Outstanding!!  Simply the best!!!!!  11</td>', 'Outstanding!!  Simply the best!!!!!  11', '2008-02-01 09:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446075, 638862, 39850, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s rich color.  Shame about the couple of blown spots which detract a little.  Be nice to see the bird more centered or else more ''extreme thirds'', if you had interest in the rest of the image.  I''d like to see more detail, so I think perhaps center - but your call of course.</td>', 'Wow, that''s rich color.  Shame about the couple of blown spots which detract a little.  Be nice to see the bird more centered or else more ''extreme thirds'', if you had interest in the rest of the image.  I''d like to see more detail, so I think perhaps center - but your call of course.', '2008-02-01 09:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446077, 639014, 51597, '<td valign="top">There are so many good shot''s in here.. This one is outstanding tho..</td>', 'There are so many good shot''s in here.. This one is outstanding tho..', '2008-02-01 09:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446079, 637838, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and color capture - the blown beak dominates too much though in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice angle and color capture - the blown beak dominates too much though in my opinion.', '2008-02-01 09:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446085, 638979, 51597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Capture!!!!</td>', 'Beautiful Capture!!!!', '2008-02-01 09:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446088, 638209, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Looks like some grain visible on the left in the darker feathers.  ''If only'' the other eye with a little more light.  Fairly minor, but I wonder if a variation in crop/composition may have given this a little more.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Looks like some grain visible on the left in the darker feathers.  ''If only'' the other eye with a little more light.  Fairly minor, but I wonder if a variation in crop/composition may have given this a little more.', '2008-02-01 10:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446093, 638754, 51597, '<td valign="top">This is the wildest birdie... Unique..</td>', 'This is the wildest birdie... Unique..', '2008-02-01 10:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446100, 638929, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice - like the setup.  Must have taken you a few shots to get the bread visible like this.  Coloring of the birds, the contrast, is a little odd - but does grow on you and matches the ''oddness'' with the bread.  Minor, but a simpler title would refine this a fraction, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice - like the setup.  Must have taken you a few shots to get the bread visible like this.  Coloring of the birds, the contrast, is a little odd - but does grow on you and matches the ''oddness'' with the bread.  Minor, but a simpler title would refine this a fraction, in my opinion.', '2008-02-01 10:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446109, 638971, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice image.</td>', '7 - Nice image.', '2008-02-01 10:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4446118, 638438, 39850, '<td valign="top">What a lovely fruit parlor.  Perhaps cropping out the branch upper left and off-centering this may have given a bit more impact.</td>', 'What a lovely fruit parlor.  Perhaps cropping out the branch upper left and off-centering this may have given a bit more impact.', '2008-02-01 10:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
