(4447260, 638863, 39850, '<td valign="top">Your call of course, but given the lighting in this image and the fact that the bird on the right has some slight blur (seemingly), perhaps cropping out all the right side to allow the left one to dominate... or it may just be that the boat competes too much in this image - the birds seem in the darker area of the image, if that makes sense.</td>', 'Your call of course, but given the lighting in this image and the fact that the bird on the right has some slight blur (seemingly), perhaps cropping out all the right side to allow the left one to dominate... or it may just be that the boat competes too much in this image - the birds seem in the darker area of the image, if that makes sense.', '2008-02-01 14:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447261, 638781, 4162, '<td valign="top">That is one cool bird, a close up of this would be fantastic</td>', 'That is one cool bird, a close up of this would be fantastic', '2008-02-01 14:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447267, 636550, 66952, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Great timing, focus, DOF. Definitely a shot that makes me look at it. The only small thing would be the lack of detail on the highlight side of the bird, but I looked at the shot for a long time before I even noticed that.</td>', 'Excellent! Great timing, focus, DOF. Definitely a shot that makes me look at it. The only small thing would be the lack of detail on the highlight side of the bird, but I looked at the shot for a long time before I even noticed that.', '2008-02-01 14:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447268, 637603, 4162, '<td valign="top">A beautifully taken picture, I kind of miss his tail feathers though..apart from that it''s gorgeous</td>', 'A beautifully taken picture, I kind of miss his tail feathers though..apart from that it''s gorgeous', '2008-02-01 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447269, 637589, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great bird! I feel that the background is a bit distracting</td>', 'Great bird! I feel that the background is a bit distracting', '2008-02-01 14:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
