(4447275, 638916, 39850, '<td valign="top">Good capture - seems natural, which of course takes the capture to a whole different level.  Wish there was as much clarity on the face and eyes as appears to be on the fore talon, but of course difficult.  Overall there appears a dark ''haze'' on this image, but that could be intentional.  Not sure on your framing, don''t think it enhances the image as is, in my opinion.</td>', 'Good capture - seems natural, which of course takes the capture to a whole different level.  Wish there was as much clarity on the face and eyes as appears to be on the fore talon, but of course difficult.  Overall there appears a dark ''haze'' on this image, but that could be intentional.  Not sure on your framing, don''t think it enhances the image as is, in my opinion.', '2008-02-01 15:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4447278, 638316, 4162, '<td valign="top">A surprising background but it kind of works for me!</td>', 'A surprising background but it kind of works for me!', '2008-02-01 15:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
