(4448805, 637533, 45524, '<td valign="top">You forgot tilted horizon. :D</td>', 'You forgot tilted horizon. :D', '2008-02-01 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448809, 638820, 45524, '<td valign="top">That is one colorful bird.</td>', 'That is one colorful bird.', '2008-02-01 20:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448813, 637564, 45524, '<td valign="top">Nice fast shutter speed, good job filling the frame and great lighting. 7</td>', 'Nice fast shutter speed, good job filling the frame and great lighting. 7', '2008-02-01 20:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448817, 638925, 45524, '<td valign="top">This is totally opposite of what I would normally say in my comments, but I wish you had backed off a bit and get the full reflection of the bird in the shot. As is its a nice shot, but I wonder what it would have looked like with the full reflection.</td>', 'This is totally opposite of what I would normally say in my comments, but I wish you had backed off a bit and get the full reflection of the bird in the shot. As is its a nice shot, but I wonder what it would have looked like with the full reflection.', '2008-02-01 20:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448896, 637533, 43774, '<td valign="top">So how is your prediction turning out? This is a very artsy photo, the wall and window act as a frame and the bird is flying out of it, freedom as it were.</td>', 'So how is your prediction turning out? This is a very artsy photo, the wall and window act as a frame and the bird is flying out of it, freedom as it were.', '2008-02-01 21:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448898, 636622, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, a lot of birds!</td>', 'Wow, a lot of birds!', '2008-02-01 21:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448900, 638826, 43774, '<td valign="top">Juncos are so cute. I like your diagonal composition, very good. The bird doesn''t seem quite in focus, looks like you may have focused on the branch instead of the bird.</td>', 'Juncos are so cute. I like your diagonal composition, very good. The bird doesn''t seem quite in focus, looks like you may have focused on the branch instead of the bird.', '2008-02-01 21:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448901, 639046, 43774, '<td valign="top">The geese at the right are very clear and in good focus. The rest of the photo is not that interesting. Maybe getting closer would help.</td>', 'The geese at the right are very clear and in good focus. The rest of the photo is not that interesting. Maybe getting closer would help.', '2008-02-01 21:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448903, 637173, 43774, '<td valign="top">Ah, too bad it wasn''t flying towards us! I like the falling snow.</td>', 'Ah, too bad it wasn''t flying towards us! I like the falling snow.', '2008-02-01 21:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448905, 637542, 43774, '<td valign="top">A cold day, good thing someone is feeding them. Photo is a bit fuzzy and blurry and the light is a bit too harsh on the bird.</td>', 'A cold day, good thing someone is feeding them. Photo is a bit fuzzy and blurry and the light is a bit too harsh on the bird.', '2008-02-01 21:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448906, 638812, 43774, '<td valign="top">This shows the Bittern''s habitat well and how good they are at camouflage.</td>', 'This shows the Bittern''s habitat well and how good they are at camouflage.', '2008-02-01 21:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448909, 638803, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the water drops, the colours are kind of neat too.</td>', 'Good capture of the water drops, the colours are kind of neat too.', '2008-02-01 21:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448911, 638943, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear and good colour on the ducks but I''d love to see them closer.</td>', 'Nice and clear and good colour on the ducks but I''d love to see them closer.', '2008-02-01 21:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448913, 638382, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute bird, is it a kingfisher? I like how it''s peeking out from the fence.</td>', 'Cute bird, is it a kingfisher? I like how it''s peeking out from the fence.', '2008-02-01 21:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448915, 638920, 43774, '<td valign="top">A decent landscape but the birds are not that prominent. I like the fish-eye look though.</td>', 'A decent landscape but the birds are not that prominent. I like the fish-eye look though.', '2008-02-01 21:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448918, 636871, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting how you have birds in the foreground and a plane in the background. I like the colours.</td>', 'Interesting how you have birds in the foreground and a plane in the background. I like the colours.', '2008-02-01 21:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448923, 638666, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a bluebird before, we don''t have them here. This photo is suffering, though. The exposure is just not right, lots of purple fringing caused by overexposure and the bird is underexposed so we can''t see the detail.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a bluebird before, we don''t have them here. This photo is suffering, though. The exposure is just not right, lots of purple fringing caused by overexposure and the bird is underexposed so we can''t see the detail.', '2008-02-01 21:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448925, 637456, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good wave action in the background. This photo shows the birds habitat well. But it''s overexposed and we can''t see the detail of the birds. If you had made it a true silhouette that may have improved it.</td>', 'Good wave action in the background. This photo shows the birds habitat well. But it''s overexposed and we can''t see the detail of the birds. If you had made it a true silhouette that may have improved it.', '2008-02-01 21:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448928, 638097, 43774, '<td valign="top">Is that a mockingbird? Your heavy use of filters may be artistic but I am not sure it works for this photo. I want to see the detail of the bird. The composition with the bird sitting on a diagonal branch seems to work.</td>', 'Is that a mockingbird? Your heavy use of filters may be artistic but I am not sure it works for this photo. I want to see the detail of the bird. The composition with the bird sitting on a diagonal branch seems to work.', '2008-02-01 21:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448931, 638611, 43774, '<td valign="top">This looks like a sculpture. Even so, I wish it were bigger and clearer.</td>', 'This looks like a sculpture. Even so, I wish it were bigger and clearer.', '2008-02-01 21:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448935, 638996, 43774, '<td valign="top">You''ve started with a good idea to show the birds and their reflections but it is overexposed and grainy and that is not adding to the photo.</td>', 'You''ve started with a good idea to show the birds and their reflections but it is overexposed and grainy and that is not adding to the photo.', '2008-02-01 21:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448939, 637258, 43774, '<td valign="top">Backlighting is good for showing silhouettes but in this case I think the light is too harsh and the swans are all jumbled together so we don''t really see a strong silhouette.</td>', 'Backlighting is good for showing silhouettes but in this case I think the light is too harsh and the swans are all jumbled together so we don''t really see a strong silhouette.', '2008-02-01 21:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448942, 638274, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like this composition with the head cut off.</td>', 'Not sure I like this composition with the head cut off.', '2008-02-01 21:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448946, 637199, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think the composition would be stronger if the gull were looking out to sea. The photo appears very grainy and the light is too harsh on the bird because it is overexposed.</td>', 'I think the composition would be stronger if the gull were looking out to sea. The photo appears very grainy and the light is too harsh on the bird because it is overexposed.', '2008-02-01 21:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448947, 638039, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute stone but I think people are looking for real birds in this challenge.</td>', 'Cute stone but I think people are looking for real birds in this challenge.', '2008-02-01 21:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448949, 638833, 43774, '<td valign="top">You caught a good moment but the technicals are not working. It appears out of focus and then it seems as if there was too much noise reduction used.</td>', 'You caught a good moment but the technicals are not working. It appears out of focus and then it seems as if there was too much noise reduction used.', '2008-02-01 21:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448952, 639005, 43774, '<td valign="top">Ha, my aunt had one of these when I was a kid and I was fascinated by it. Not sure I get what is on the screen but it probably has some meaning.</td>', 'Ha, my aunt had one of these when I was a kid and I was fascinated by it. Not sure I get what is on the screen but it probably has some meaning.', '2008-02-01 21:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448954, 638130, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the dark ripples in the water, they match the dark reflection of the swan. But I think the photo needs to be in focus.</td>', 'I like the dark ripples in the water, they match the dark reflection of the swan. But I think the photo needs to be in focus.', '2008-02-01 21:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448956, 637454, 43774, '<td valign="top">Coordinating colours, good catch. But the photo doesn''t seem to be in focus.</td>', 'Coordinating colours, good catch. But the photo doesn''t seem to be in focus.', '2008-02-01 21:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448958, 637259, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, 2 eagles fighting, what a capture! Shame you couldn''t get closer.</td>', 'Wow, 2 eagles fighting, what a capture! Shame you couldn''t get closer.', '2008-02-01 21:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448961, 636739, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the mist and stillness. I really wish either (a) the birds were closer or (b) there were more birds flying.</td>', 'Love the mist and stillness. I really wish either (a) the birds were closer or (b) there were more birds flying.', '2008-02-01 21:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448965, 638922, 43774, '<td valign="top">I think people are looking for real birds in this challenge. This might be better if there were no reflections.</td>', 'I think people are looking for real birds in this challenge. This might be better if there were no reflections.', '2008-02-01 21:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448966, 638705, 43774, '<td valign="top">The bird is really hard to find with all the reflections of the trees. The reflections are neat though.</td>', 'The bird is really hard to find with all the reflections of the trees. The reflections are neat though.', '2008-02-01 21:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448967, 638962, 43774, '<td valign="top">A lovely beach scene but I wish the birds were easier to see.</td>', 'A lovely beach scene but I wish the birds were easier to see.', '2008-02-01 21:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448973, 636592, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Wondering why you chose to go with B&amp;W when Flamingos are so colourful and people like to see that colour. I am not sure how you did your B&amp;W conversion but some of the flamingos necks seem a little odd and devoid of detail.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Wondering why you chose to go with B&W when Flamingos are so colourful and people like to see that colour. I am not sure how you did your B&W conversion but some of the flamingos necks seem a little odd and devoid of detail.', '2008-02-01 21:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448976, 638696, 43774, '<td valign="top">It looks like you have good detail in the flying gull but I find your processing to be very strange. It''s like the birds are cut and pasted ont the background.</td>', 'It looks like you have good detail in the flying gull but I find your processing to be very strange. It''s like the birds are cut and pasted ont the background.', '2008-02-01 21:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448978, 638980, 43774, '<td valign="top">I really wish the birds were closer, I just think there is too much empty space here</td>', 'I really wish the birds were closer, I just think there is too much empty space here', '2008-02-01 21:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448979, 638986, 43774, '<td valign="top">Definitely an out of the box entry</td>', 'Definitely an out of the box entry', '2008-02-01 21:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448983, 637868, 43774, '<td valign="top">An out of the box entry to be sure. It''s a great portrait with good colours. Good luck!</td>', 'An out of the box entry to be sure. It''s a great portrait with good colours. Good luck!', '2008-02-01 21:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448984, 638327, 43774, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I am not liking your processing. The colours are very strange (of course you know this because of your title). The ducks also don''t appear to be in focus. Sometimes natural is better.</td>', 'Sorry but I am not liking your processing. The colours are very strange (of course you know this because of your title). The ducks also don''t appear to be in focus. Sometimes natural is better.', '2008-02-01 21:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4448986, 638912, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this is a bit of a stretch. I can''t even call it artistic license. Good luck.</td>', 'I''m sorry but this is a bit of a stretch. I can''t even call it artistic license. Good luck.', '2008-02-01 21:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
