(4450364, 638833, 75651, '<td valign="top">Great focus, shutter speed added motion, however extremely contrasty and a bit too complex up on the top half. The reflection part is clean and crisp and adds a nice touch to the movement of the bird.  Perhaps a tighter crop would eliminate the noise up top.  Still a very nice capture.</td>', 'Great focus, shutter speed added motion, however extremely contrasty and a bit too complex up on the top half. The reflection part is clean and crisp and adds a nice touch to the movement of the bird.  Perhaps a tighter crop would eliminate the noise up top.  Still a very nice capture.', '2008-02-02 11:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450367, 638916, 70270, '<td valign="top">Feeding day at the aviary?  Well composed, tack sharp, and nicely processed.  8</td>', 'Feeding day at the aviary?  Well composed, tack sharp, and nicely processed.  8', '2008-02-02 11:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
