(4450378, 638942, 88010, '<td valign="top">Exposure is a tad hot, leaving no detail in the white highlights, but overall not bad on a difficult subject. Focus is excellent, wish he/she was look at us though.</td>', 'Exposure is a tad hot, leaving no detail in the white highlights, but overall not bad on a difficult subject. Focus is excellent, wish he/she was look at us though.', '2008-02-02 11:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
