(4450389, 638097, 70270, '<td valign="top">I love the way you''ve processed this picture, the artistic filter really fits the subject matter.  Too bad DPC hates shots like this, but maybe you''ll prove them wrong this time out.  Bumping you to an 8 just because I can.</td>', 'I love the way you''ve processed this picture, the artistic filter really fits the subject matter.  Too bad DPC hates shots like this, but maybe you''ll prove them wrong this time out.  Bumping you to an 8 just because I can.', '2008-02-02 12:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450390, 639036, 88010, '<td valign="top">exposure, contrast, color, saturation and composition are all very good. However, the eyes are soft. The eyes should always get the sharpest focus on animals, bird or even insects.</td>', 'exposure, contrast, color, saturation and composition are all very good. However, the eyes are soft. The eyes should always get the sharpest focus on animals, bird or even insects.', '2008-02-02 12:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450393, 638895, 88010, '<td valign="top">Now thats a pretty hair-do. Nice focus, right on the eye. Good color, contrast and saturation. Pleasant composition. Nice pic.</td>', 'Now thats a pretty hair-do. Nice focus, right on the eye. Good color, contrast and saturation. Pleasant composition. Nice pic.', '2008-02-02 12:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450396, 638881, 75651, '<td valign="top">GReat color and muted background. Good focus and color.  Sad feeling for some reason. Maybe that''s what being wet does!lol-9</td>', 'GReat color and muted background. Good focus and color.  Sad feeling for some reason. Maybe that''s what being wet does!lol-9', '2008-02-02 12:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450397, 639031, 88010, '<td valign="top">Composition is a bit too far to the right, he needs to move within the frame. contrast is a bit too hot. saturation is too high skewing the true feather colors and detail.</td>', 'Composition is a bit too far to the right, he needs to move within the frame. contrast is a bit too hot. saturation is too high skewing the true feather colors and detail.', '2008-02-02 12:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450401, 638827, 88010, '<td valign="top">What a pretty bird, wish we were actually at his eye level, but that might require a ladder :)<br/>Good color, saturation, and contrast. Good focus and acceptable composition with him being higher than you were.</td>', 'What a pretty bird, wish we were actually at his eye level, but that might require a ladder :)Good color, saturation, and contrast. Good focus and acceptable composition with him being higher than you were.', '2008-02-02 12:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450405, 638972, 88010, '<td valign="top">exposure is a little hot. contrast maybe needs boosted a hair. colors and saturation seem ok.</td>', 'exposure is a little hot. contrast maybe needs boosted a hair. colors and saturation seem ok.', '2008-02-02 12:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450407, 636505, 59926, '<td valign="top">Very Good Detail. I love it!!!</td>', 'Very Good Detail. I love it!!!', '2008-02-02 12:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450414, 638863, 88010, '<td valign="top">I seldom like landscape shots where the horizon divides the pic in half. The rule of thirds for the horizon would have strangthened this shot considerably. Specifically, I would crop to remove sky, therefore making the foreground, where the birds are, more important. This would put more emphasis on the birds. Technicals all seem ok.</td>', 'I seldom like landscape shots where the horizon divides the pic in half. The rule of thirds for the horizon would have strangthened this shot considerably. Specifically, I would crop to remove sky, therefore making the foreground, where the birds are, more important. This would put more emphasis on the birds. Technicals all seem ok.', '2008-02-02 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450421, 638788, 75651, '<td valign="top">Clean with great lines.  The angle is what doesn''t go well with the photo.  Need to get down on their angle- otherwise you''re on another level than the subject.</td>', 'Clean with great lines.  The angle is what doesn''t go well with the photo.  Need to get down on their angle- otherwise you''re on another level than the subject.', '2008-02-02 12:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450425, 638887, 88010, '<td valign="top">Hey, a B&amp;W of a B&amp;W swan. Good job on the exposure and contrast. focus looks good with the eyes very sharp and a nice catchlight in the eye. Compositon is a little tight and could have used a little room to the left, putting the head at the "rule of thirds" mark.</td>', 'Hey, a B&W of a B&W swan. Good job on the exposure and contrast. focus looks good with the eyes very sharp and a nice catchlight in the eye. Compositon is a little tight and could have used a little room to the left, putting the head at the "rule of thirds" mark.', '2008-02-02 12:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450431, 637393, 88010, '<td valign="top">Too bad that background is so hot, otherwise this is very nice. Good color and saturation on the bird. Very nice focus and nice composition. I like that you have a nice catchlight in the eyes too.</td>', 'Too bad that background is so hot, otherwise this is very nice. Good color and saturation on the bird. Very nice focus and nice composition. I like that you have a nice catchlight in the eyes too.', '2008-02-02 12:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450432, 638922, 75651, '<td valign="top">Use what you''ve got!! The lines are good the subject is good and overall it is creative.  I would suggest that if you are not going to use the reflection for visual purposes to support the photo however, that you try to use a polarizing filter and be careful of your focus.</td>', 'Use what you''ve got!! The lines are good the subject is good and overall it is creative.  I would suggest that if you are not going to use the reflection for visual purposes to support the photo however, that you try to use a polarizing filter and be careful of your focus.', '2008-02-02 12:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450438, 638543, 88010, '<td valign="top">Well congrats on a different perspective. I do wish they were both in focus though. Nice color, contrast and saturation.</td>', 'Well congrats on a different perspective. I do wish they were both in focus though. Nice color, contrast and saturation.', '2008-02-02 12:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450444, 638767, 75651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and focus of the eye and droplets.  Falls off a bit at the feet and you need that entire other foot to complete the framing.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and focus of the eye and droplets.  Falls off a bit at the feet and you need that entire other foot to complete the framing.', '2008-02-02 12:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450448, 637949, 88010, '<td valign="top">I do not like the top or bottom framing. contrast is a little soft and so is the focus on the bird. Otherwise an interesting composition. And I like the ship entering from the pother side and that it is soft in focus.</td>', 'I do not like the top or bottom framing. contrast is a little soft and so is the focus on the bird. Otherwise an interesting composition. And I like the ship entering from the pother side and that it is soft in focus.', '2008-02-02 12:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450453, 638662, 88010, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of cropping cut down on the quality. Or perhaps just too much movement to be sharp. Also, contrast is too high.</td>', 'Looks like a lot of cropping cut down on the quality. Or perhaps just too much movement to be sharp. Also, contrast is too high.', '2008-02-02 12:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450458, 638737, 75651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph.  The composition, the lines the simplicity... you have an eye for great photos.  Great Job -9. (Not a Ten because it is not outside the box.  Everything else though is absolutely perfect!!)</td>', 'Beautiful photograph.  The composition, the lines the simplicity... you have an eye for great photos.  Great Job -9. (Not a Ten because it is not outside the box.  Everything else though is absolutely perfect!!)', '2008-02-02 12:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450460, 637840, 88010, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, good color and contrast. very nice focus. But they are missing that catchlight in teh eyes. That really adds a lot to animal or bidr photo''s.</td>', 'Nice perspective, good color and contrast. very nice focus. But they are missing that catchlight in teh eyes. That really adds a lot to animal or bidr photo''s.', '2008-02-02 12:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450467, 638705, 88010, '<td valign="top">I see it, just barley. it really takes up too little importance in the shot. This is really a landscape that happens to have a bird.</td>', 'I see it, just barley. it really takes up too little importance in the shot. This is really a landscape that happens to have a bird.', '2008-02-02 12:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
