(4450498, 638865, 88010, '<td valign="top">wow, I wish I could get that close. But it''s totally blown out with no detail at all. I did hold my hand over the rock and with that gone it looks kinda cool. But with the rock there it just looks over-exposed.</td>', 'wow, I wish I could get that close. But it''s totally blown out with no detail at all. I did hold my hand over the rock and with that gone it looks kinda cool. But with the rock there it just looks over-exposed.', '2008-02-02 12:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
