(4450503, 638705, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very very complex photo.  Yes the bird is in there, though the scene, in its entirety, is the focus.  Good job turning it b&amp;w to further diminish the complexity, however, the landscape is very uninteresting.  Try to have the landscape speak throught the photo and tell a story with it.</td>', 'Very very complex photo.  Yes the bird is in there, though the scene, in its entirety, is the focus.  Good job turning it b&w to further diminish the complexity, however, the landscape is very uninteresting.  Try to have the landscape speak throught the photo and tell a story with it.', '2008-02-02 12:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
