(4450624, 638946, 811, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to notice the missing foot.  Would be interesting to see this guy in action.  Lighting seems a bit harsh on the bird and dark in the background.</td>', 'Took me a second to notice the missing foot.  Would be interesting to see this guy in action.  Lighting seems a bit harsh on the bird and dark in the background.', '2008-02-02 13:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450644, 638673, 61961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird photo, I love the textures on his breast and the colors on his wing.  The twisting branches that create a natural frame around him really make the photo magical.  Although the background is good and blurry, for some reaosn I find it a bit distracting.  Anyhow, one of my challenge favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful bird photo, I love the textures on his breast and the colors on his wing.  The twisting branches that create a natural frame around him really make the photo magical.  Although the background is good and blurry, for some reaosn I find it a bit distracting.  Anyhow, one of my challenge favorites.', '2008-02-02 13:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450647, 636450, 61961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird, very nicely captured.  The colors are outstanding and the photo is sharp.  I would suggest cloning out the light speck on his beak (near his eye) -- although it is tiny, it keeps drawing my eye.  A high score from me.</td>', 'Beautiful bird, very nicely captured.  The colors are outstanding and the photo is sharp.  I would suggest cloning out the light speck on his beak (near his eye) -- although it is tiny, it keeps drawing my eye.  A high score from me.', '2008-02-02 13:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450648, 638820, 61961, '<td valign="top">One aspect of photography is to show the viewer something he''s never seen before -- and you''ve certainly done that!  What an amazing creature.  The photo is good and sharp and I like the background.  Well done.</td>', 'One aspect of photography is to show the viewer something he''s never seen before -- and you''ve certainly done that!  What an amazing creature.  The photo is good and sharp and I like the background.  Well done.', '2008-02-02 13:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450654, 636592, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot just kinda made me stop and keep looking at it.  At first glance, I wasn''t too impressed.  But, the more I look, the more I like. . .</td>', 'This shot just kinda made me stop and keep looking at it.  At first glance, I wasn''t too impressed.  But, the more I look, the more I like. . .', '2008-02-02 13:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450660, 637467, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture of expression.</td>', 'Good capture of expression.', '2008-02-02 13:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450673, 638812, 811, '<td valign="top">Proof that camouflage works in nature -- I almost missed the bird!</td>', 'Proof that camouflage works in nature -- I almost missed the bird!', '2008-02-02 13:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450827, 636450, 66524, '<td valign="top">The contrasting colors and DOF really make this a top notch shot! 10! Best of luck</td>', 'The contrasting colors and DOF really make this a top notch shot! 10! Best of luck', '2008-02-02 14:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450831, 636505, 66524, '<td valign="top">wonderful clarity</td>', 'wonderful clarity', '2008-02-02 14:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450837, 638789, 66524, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF - maybe a tighter crop?  Still a great entry!</td>', 'I love the DOF - maybe a tighter crop?  Still a great entry!', '2008-02-02 14:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450842, 637533, 66524, '<td valign="top">can''t wait to see the results for this shot - great timing!</td>', 'can''t wait to see the results for this shot - great timing!', '2008-02-02 14:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450851, 639008, 66524, '<td valign="top">shot well too!</td>', 'shot well too!', '2008-02-02 14:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450860, 638964, 66524, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2008-02-02 14:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450861, 638816, 66524, '<td valign="top">great timing!</td>', 'great timing!', '2008-02-02 14:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450888, 637533, 66494, '<td valign="top">10!  This is pure art, and magnificently seen. Further, sometimes art is not sharp ... but instead brilliant!</td>', '10!  This is pure art, and magnificently seen. Further, sometimes art is not sharp ... but instead brilliant!', '2008-02-02 14:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450890, 636871, 66494, '<td valign="top">Oh man, I hope voters take the time to really check this one out. The coloring is magnificent, the birds next to the big ol'' metal bird is absolutely amazing. 10</td>', 'Oh man, I hope voters take the time to really check this one out. The coloring is magnificent, the birds next to the big ol'' metal bird is absolutely amazing. 10', '2008-02-02 14:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450903, 638646, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and has good feather detail. Seems a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Nicely composed and has good feather detail. Seems a bit oversharpened.', '2008-02-02 14:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450914, 638032, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think this is definitely on the good side of good/bad, but the DOF is so shallow it makes the bird seem blurry.  Nice composition -- I especially like how the branches frame the bird naturally.  I also like how the pale colors contrast with the bright bird.</td>', 'I think this is definitely on the good side of good/bad, but the DOF is so shallow it makes the bird seem blurry.  Nice composition -- I especially like how the branches frame the bird naturally.  I also like how the pale colors contrast with the bright bird.', '2008-02-02 15:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450915, 638782, 62249, '<td valign="top">Duck seems a tad oversharpened, but the water appearance is spectacular.</td>', 'Duck seems a tad oversharpened, but the water appearance is spectacular.', '2008-02-02 15:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450921, 638929, 62249, '<td valign="top">Creat capture of the bread slice.</td>', 'Creat capture of the bread slice.', '2008-02-02 15:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450923, 638613, 61961, '<td valign="top">I love the composition.  It appears as if heavy noise reduction or slightly-off focus has rendered the bird textureless.  Still at least a 6 from me.</td>', 'I love the composition.  It appears as if heavy noise reduction or slightly-off focus has rendered the bird textureless.  Still at least a 6 from me.', '2008-02-02 15:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450924, 638754, 62249, '<td valign="top">The bird isn''t distinct enough from the background. Interesting looking bird, though.</td>', 'The bird isn''t distinct enough from the background. Interesting looking bird, though.', '2008-02-02 15:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450928, 639017, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cute caption and good detail in the bird feathers.</td>', 'Cute caption and good detail in the bird feathers.', '2008-02-02 15:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450932, 638054, 62249, '<td valign="top">Interesting! Love this different viewpoint, and the details of the feathers (hairs?) on the foot are great.</td>', 'Interesting! Love this different viewpoint, and the details of the feathers (hairs?) on the foot are great.', '2008-02-02 15:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450946, 638270, 62249, '<td valign="top">The billboard in the background draws my attention more than the bird, and the out of focus lamp is just a distraction. The juxtaposition of the billboard and pigeon could still work well, but the photo would need to be cropped differently: eliminate the right side of the photo, turning the shot into a vertical with the pigeon in the lower right area.</td>', 'The billboard in the background draws my attention more than the bird, and the out of focus lamp is just a distraction. The juxtaposition of the billboard and pigeon could still work well, but the photo would need to be cropped differently: eliminate the right side of the photo, turning the shot into a vertical with the pigeon in the lower right area.', '2008-02-02 15:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450954, 638637, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like the way you captured the bird in mid stride.</td>', 'Cute. I like the way you captured the bird in mid stride.', '2008-02-02 15:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450957, 636871, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this one. Wish the birds were a bit more prominent. Still, contrasting the birds with the plane via your title is clever.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this one. Wish the birds were a bit more prominent. Still, contrasting the birds with the plane via your title is clever.', '2008-02-02 15:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450961, 638241, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh.</td>', 'Nice bokeh.', '2008-02-02 15:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450971, 638986, 62249, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo, even if it is shoehorned into this challenge.</td>', 'This is a good photo, even if it is shoehorned into this challenge.', '2008-02-02 15:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450976, 638912, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lol - I hope that''s a lot warmer than it looks  :- )</td>', 'Lol - I hope that''s a lot warmer than it looks  :- )', '2008-02-02 15:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450987, 638087, 68586, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully crazy look - looks like Gonzo from the muppets  :- )</td>', 'Wonderfully crazy look - looks like Gonzo from the muppets  :- )', '2008-02-02 15:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450988, 637542, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like the way you tried to tell a story with this. Wish the bird were in sharper focus, though, and it would be good if its face &amp; beak stood out more from the background.</td>', 'I like the way you tried to tell a story with this. Wish the bird were in sharper focus, though, and it would be good if its face & beak stood out more from the background.', '2008-02-02 15:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450991, 638816, 68586, '<td valign="top">ROFL . . great title, and nice capture.</td>', 'ROFL . . great title, and nice capture.', '2008-02-02 15:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4450998, 638755, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good title.</td>', 'Good title.', '2008-02-02 15:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451004, 637342, 62249, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird. Wish the head had sharper focus and better lighting for more detail. The yellowish bits at the right edge of the photo are distracting.</td>', 'Pretty bird. Wish the head had sharper focus and better lighting for more detail. The yellowish bits at the right edge of the photo are distracting.', '2008-02-02 15:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451016, 638986, 68586, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the challenge - in some ways things like skating probably are as close as we get to soaring like a bird. Maybe she could get even closer to soaring if you cought her some in-line skates  :- )</td>', 'interesting take on the challenge - in some ways things like skating probably are as close as we get to soaring like a bird. Maybe she could get even closer to soaring if you cought her some in-line skates  :- )', '2008-02-02 15:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451019, 637533, 62249, '<td valign="top">I love the abstract, arty quality of this one.</td>', 'I love the abstract, arty quality of this one.', '2008-02-02 15:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451029, 638666, 68586, '<td valign="top">a aatractive, colourful bird, but unfortunately in this shot the details are just not clear enough to really appreciate his plumage. <br/>Perhaps (as it was advanced editing) you could have selected the bird and lightened him a bit ?</td>', 'a aatractive, colourful bird, but unfortunately in this shot the details are just not clear enough to really appreciate his plumage. Perhaps (as it was advanced editing) you could have selected the bird and lightened him a bit ?', '2008-02-02 15:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451035, 637448, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice catchlight in his eye - but for me the crop is a little too close to his head, and all the lines in the background are distracting</td>', 'nice catchlight in his eye - but for me the crop is a little too close to his head, and all the lines in the background are distracting', '2008-02-02 15:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451045, 638666, 64086, '<td valign="top">I think your composition is great in this photo. The bird is in the perfect spot of the frame. The backlighting seems too strong and it''s hard too appreciate the details of the bird, especially the all important eye. Perhaps some fill flash would have helped to even out the exposure or a slightly different angle.</td>', 'I think your composition is great in this photo. The bird is in the perfect spot of the frame. The backlighting seems too strong and it''s hard too appreciate the details of the bird, especially the all important eye. Perhaps some fill flash would have helped to even out the exposure or a slightly different angle.', '2008-02-02 15:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451047, 638536, 68586, '<td valign="top">Incredible looking bird, and a good job of capturing the details around his face and in his plumage.</td>', 'Incredible looking bird, and a good job of capturing the details around his face and in his plumage.', '2008-02-02 15:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451053, 638594, 68586, '<td valign="top">Wonderful eyes</td>', 'Wonderful eyes', '2008-02-02 15:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451114, 638972, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice capture of the rain - the first pigeon is begining to look pretty damp.</td>', 'nice capture of the rain - the first pigeon is begining to look pretty damp.', '2008-02-02 15:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451190, 638915, 68586, '<td valign="top">ROFL - nice timing and good title  :- )</td>', 'ROFL - nice timing and good title  :- )', '2008-02-02 16:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451203, 637467, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great haircut  :- )</td>', 'Great haircut  :- )', '2008-02-02 16:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451221, 638488, 68586, '<td valign="top">Has this bird just fallen out of the ''Ugly Tree'' ? Cos if he did he''s sure hit a lot of branches on the way down :- )</td>', 'Has this bird just fallen out of the ''Ugly Tree'' ? Cos if he did he''s sure hit a lot of branches on the way down :- )', '2008-02-02 16:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451236, 638776, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lovely subtle colours and good capture of the duck</td>', 'Lovely subtle colours and good capture of the duck', '2008-02-02 16:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451238, 637533, 68586, '<td valign="top">A really nice arty, almost impressionist picture. Wonderful background textures and gentle blur in the wings to show movement. Great picture.<br/> <br/>But why, oh, why that title ?</td>', 'A really nice arty, almost impressionist picture. Wonderful background textures and gentle blur in the wings to show movement. Great picture. But why, oh, why that title ?', '2008-02-02 16:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451240, 638648, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lovely and sharp - but perhaps cropped a little too close ?</td>', 'Lovely and sharp - but perhaps cropped a little too close ?', '2008-02-02 16:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451241, 638274, 68586, '<td valign="top">powerful shot.</td>', 'powerful shot.', '2008-02-02 16:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451254, 638832, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great shot - love the blue eyes.</td>', 'Great shot - love the blue eyes.', '2008-02-02 16:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451280, 636851, 68586, '<td valign="top">Superb capture.</td>', 'Superb capture.', '2008-02-02 16:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451284, 638893, 89757, '<td valign="top">Stellar - beautiful stuff.</td>', 'Stellar - beautiful stuff.', '2008-02-02 16:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451285, 638393, 68586, '<td valign="top">Magnificent shot and perfect title -  a winner all the way for me.</td>', 'Magnificent shot and perfect title -  a winner all the way for me.', '2008-02-02 16:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451294, 639017, 68586, '<td valign="top">Delightful shot. Great PP and a great title.</td>', 'Delightful shot. Great PP and a great title.', '2008-02-02 16:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451306, 638781, 68586, '<td valign="top">Yay !! Fancy dress night at the Flamingo pool  :- )</td>', 'Yay !! Fancy dress night at the Flamingo pool  :- )', '2008-02-02 16:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451312, 637949, 68586, '<td valign="top">nice shot.</td>', 'nice shot.', '2008-02-02 16:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451320, 638688, 68586, '<td valign="top">I love the stare of the front owl - but I''m not quite convinced by the overall crop. I would like to have seen slightly more of the first owl and none of the second.<br/> <br/>The first one carries the shot on his own, and (for me anyway) the second one distracts.</td>', 'I love the stare of the front owl - but I''m not quite convinced by the overall crop. I would like to have seen slightly more of the first owl and none of the second. The first one carries the shot on his own, and (for me anyway) the second one distracts.', '2008-02-02 16:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451325, 638135, 68586, '<td valign="top">charming indeed</td>', 'charming indeed', '2008-02-02 16:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451327, 637956, 68586, '<td valign="top">Amazing looking bird</td>', 'Amazing looking bird', '2008-02-02 16:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451437, 638038, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  A little dark overall for me.</td>', '8 - Very good.  A little dark overall for me.', '2008-02-02 17:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451439, 638722, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like the action captured in this shot.</td>', 'Very nice!  I like the action captured in this shot.', '2008-02-02 17:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451440, 638209, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Sharp.</td>', 'Very nice!  Sharp.', '2008-02-02 17:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451441, 638925, 18374, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Great color.</td>', 'Excellent!  Great color.', '2008-02-02 17:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451442, 638332, 18374, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think the unnatural background color works well here and the headless birds make for a cool anonymity.</td>', 'Interesting.  I think the unnatural background color works well here and the headless birds make for a cool anonymity.', '2008-02-02 17:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451444, 638234, 18374, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  Cool bird.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  Cool bird.', '2008-02-02 17:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451446, 638312, 18374, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I like the composition and color.</td>', 'Excellent!  I like the composition and color.', '2008-02-02 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451448, 638820, 18374, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I love the color and the bird.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Excellent!  I love the color and the bird.  Nice capture.', '2008-02-02 17:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4451449, 636505, 18374, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I like the pose.</td>', 'Excellent!  I like the pose.', '2008-02-02 17:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
