(4452767, 638492, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now how did he catch one?  I like how the one guy in the back is watching - trying to find out the fate of his friend.  The others are more content to just eat and ignore.  Excellent photograph.</td>', 'Now how did he catch one?  I like how the one guy in the back is watching - trying to find out the fate of his friend.  The others are more content to just eat and ignore.  Excellent photograph.', '2008-02-03 06:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
