(4452911, 638343, 74209, '<td valign="top">This is one of the finest images of this challenge.  I love the play of subtle beiges around the arresting orange of the beak, crest, and wings.  The one thing I would like to do with the image is reframe so that my eye would have more room to the right where the cardinal is looking.  So I wanted to give you higher than a 7... OK, let mercy triumph over judgment: 8!  Well done.</td>', 'This is one of the finest images of this challenge.  I love the play of subtle beiges around the arresting orange of the beak, crest, and wings.  The one thing I would like to do with the image is reframe so that my eye would have more room to the right where the cardinal is looking.  So I wanted to give you higher than a 7... OK, let mercy triumph over judgment: 8!  Well done.', '2008-02-03 08:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4452919, 638038, 74209, '<td valign="top">Or, having paid the price, how sobering and sad to see it erode.  Well done, indeed.</td>', 'Or, having paid the price, how sobering and sad to see it erode.  Well done, indeed.', '2008-02-03 08:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
