(4453257, 637422, 3087, '<td valign="top">Stunning... I love the pose of the bird and the composition formed from it''s turned body and the branch; the light in it''s eye and on it''s beak is lovely as is the berry in it''s beak and the colour palette of the image as a whole is lovely.</td>', 'Stunning... I love the pose of the bird and the composition formed from it''s turned body and the branch; the light in it''s eye and on it''s beak is lovely as is the berry in it''s beak and the colour palette of the image as a whole is lovely.', '2008-02-03 11:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453261, 638595, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely capture with the sky and clouds forming the perfect backdrop.</td>', 'A lovely capture with the sky and clouds forming the perfect backdrop.', '2008-02-03 11:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453264, 637815, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautifully serene image with lovely muted colours, a beautiful composition full of loose horizontals punctuated with the bird and the person on the same vertical line... just lovely.</td>', 'A beautifully serene image with lovely muted colours, a beautiful composition full of loose horizontals punctuated with the bird and the person on the same vertical line... just lovely.', '2008-02-03 11:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453267, 638820, 3087, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite birds, makes me long to be on safari this very minute. Amazingly sharp and wonderfully vibrant detail... lovely light, perfect DOF to create that wonderfully rich blurred backdrop. Love it!</td>', 'One of my favourite birds, makes me long to be on safari this very minute. Amazingly sharp and wonderfully vibrant detail... lovely light, perfect DOF to create that wonderfully rich blurred backdrop. Love it!', '2008-02-03 11:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453273, 638903, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait - that berry is a great focal point that pulls me straight to the bird''s head/ beak/ eye.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait - that berry is a great focal point that pulls me straight to the bird''s head/ beak/ eye.', '2008-02-03 11:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453278, 638810, 3087, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! I love how the backdrop complements the colour of the tit''s breast; it''s pose on the thorny branch and the catchlight in it''s eyes. Your composition, with it''s use of negative space, is also really strong.</td>', 'Gorgeous! I love how the backdrop complements the colour of the tit''s breast; it''s pose on the thorny branch and the catchlight in it''s eyes. Your composition, with it''s use of negative space, is also really strong.', '2008-02-03 11:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453279, 638695, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and your choice of toning gives is a melancholy feel that works very well.</td>', 'Beautiful, and your choice of toning gives is a melancholy feel that works very well.', '2008-02-03 11:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453281, 638492, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of shallow DOF to strip out the detail from the child and background - they both provide a context without being the main focus of the image.</td>', 'Great use of shallow DOF to strip out the detail from the child and background - they both provide a context without being the main focus of the image.', '2008-02-03 11:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453283, 638987, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great capture... must have taken a lot of time and patience!</td>', 'Great capture... must have taken a lot of time and patience!', '2008-02-03 11:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453286, 638578, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail; I can almost feel the different textures. Close crop creates a striking composition with just a few strong colours - almost abstract in feel.</td>', 'Lovely detail; I can almost feel the different textures. Close crop creates a striking composition with just a few strong colours - almost abstract in feel.', '2008-02-03 11:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453288, 639049, 3087, '<td valign="top">On of my favourites - a cross between serenity and melancholy. One I can just keep looking at.</td>', 'On of my favourites - a cross between serenity and melancholy. One I can just keep looking at.', '2008-02-03 11:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453292, 638722, 3087, '<td valign="top">The title is perfect for the image - great detail, great sense of energy.</td>', 'The title is perfect for the image - great detail, great sense of energy.', '2008-02-03 11:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453444, 636622, 22970, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well. Even though the scenery is nice and has great parallel lines along with contrast is very easy to see that the birds are the main focus. Again one of the the more interesting shots in this challenge. Great work.</td>', 'Fits the challenge well. Even though the scenery is nice and has great parallel lines along with contrast is very easy to see that the birds are the main focus. Again one of the the more interesting shots in this challenge. Great work.', '2008-02-03 11:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453449, 637912, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and detail. Interesting POV. Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice colors and detail. Interesting POV. Nice shot.', '2008-02-03 11:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453461, 638964, 22970, '<td valign="top">Had to give this one high marks. Focus great and I like the unusual pose of the cardinal. The DOF is amazing. The only thing that I wish was not in the picture is the shadow line across the bird. But I know that was something you could not help. Great shot</td>', 'Had to give this one high marks. Focus great and I like the unusual pose of the cardinal. The DOF is amazing. The only thing that I wish was not in the picture is the shadow line across the bird. But I know that was something you could not help. Great shot', '2008-02-03 11:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453473, 638594, 22970, '<td valign="top">His expression is what makes this photograph, IMO. He has the look of confusion, or don''t care in his eyes. You did a good job balancing color and placing the focus on the birds eyes. One of the best close up picture in the challenge. Good job.</td>', 'His expression is what makes this photograph, IMO. He has the look of confusion, or don''t care in his eyes. You did a good job balancing color and placing the focus on the birds eyes. One of the best close up picture in the challenge. Good job.', '2008-02-03 11:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453478, 639044, 67258, '<td valign="top">Amongst my favourite in this strong challenge - the wide depth of field is impressive and contributes hugely to the success of this photograph.</td>', 'Amongst my favourite in this strong challenge - the wide depth of field is impressive and contributes hugely to the success of this photograph.', '2008-02-03 12:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453482, 638306, 67258, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have expected a high-key approach to work in this challenge, but your bold exposure and/or processing really does appeal to me.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have expected a high-key approach to work in this challenge, but your bold exposure and/or processing really does appeal to me.', '2008-02-03 12:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453491, 637983, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is a super capture, and certainly up there in my own personal top 10.  The soft sunset palette is very attractive.</td>', 'This is a super capture, and certainly up there in my own personal top 10.  The soft sunset palette is very attractive.', '2008-02-03 12:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453493, 638787, 22970, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Seems to be a little soft but it works with your photograph. Great shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Seems to be a little soft but it works with your photograph. Great shot.', '2008-02-03 12:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453496, 638865, 22970, '<td valign="top">How can someone not love this shot? Great lighting not letting the white get blown out. I love the way the bird seems to disappear into the his surroundings. One of my favorite photos of the challenge. Great job!</td>', 'How can someone not love this shot? Great lighting not letting the white get blown out. I love the way the bird seems to disappear into the his surroundings. One of my favorite photos of the challenge. Great job!', '2008-02-03 12:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453498, 638777, 22970, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites not only because of the beauty of the shot but I was looking for something in this challenge that stood out. This one does. Great shot.</td>', 'One of my favorites not only because of the beauty of the shot but I was looking for something in this challenge that stood out. This one does. Great shot.', '2008-02-03 12:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453506, 636739, 22970, '<td valign="top">In a challenge with so many up close and personal shots of birds, this is very refreshing. You photo is well balance and the composition is great. The mist adds to the photograph but the birds (by there placement) still stands out as the subject. Great nature shot while making it work in this challenge. bump.</td>', 'In a challenge with so many up close and personal shots of birds, this is very refreshing. You photo is well balance and the composition is great. The mist adds to the photograph but the birds (by there placement) still stands out as the subject. Great nature shot while making it work in this challenge. bump.', '2008-02-03 12:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453507, 639049, 22970, '<td valign="top">Now this is nice. I love the shot, the processing, the simpleness, "the complete photograph". One of my favorites in this challenge. Great job and I wish you well in placement. Bump</td>', 'Now this is nice. I love the shot, the processing, the simpleness, "the complete photograph". One of my favorites in this challenge. Great job and I wish you well in placement. Bump', '2008-02-03 12:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453520, 638904, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha, a Muscovy Duck - there is a town in England, Ely, where they are almost overrun with these; I believe the original ones escaped from a private collection and they bred, and bred!  You have captured the ugliness wonderfully here, and displayed the duck well against the oof background.</td>', 'Ha, a Muscovy Duck - there is a town in England, Ely, where they are almost overrun with these; I believe the original ones escaped from a private collection and they bred, and bred!  You have captured the ugliness wonderfully here, and displayed the duck well against the oof background.', '2008-02-03 12:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4453522, 638903, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent and timing, and additional marks for showing something of the bird''s habitat and behaviour.  Bumped to 9.</td>', 'Excellent and timing, and additional marks for showing something of the bird''s habitat and behaviour.  Bumped to 9.', '2008-02-03 12:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
