(4454100, 638210, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic shot, the legs reaching towards the branch, the silhouttes of the wings and branches.  I think this one is going to get overlooked.  Bumping you to a 7</td>', 'Nice graphic shot, the legs reaching towards the branch, the silhouttes of the wings and branches.  I think this one is going to get overlooked.  Bumping you to a 7', '2008-02-03 16:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454112, 638863, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and birds.  The problem for me here is that the focus is on the boat, both in the sharpness and in the lighting, rather than on the birds.  The boat adds a nice element, but for me it might have been stronger with a tighter shot on just one of the birds with the boat moving by in the background.</td>', 'Nice sky and birds.  The problem for me here is that the focus is on the boat, both in the sharpness and in the lighting, rather than on the birds.  The boat adds a nice element, but for me it might have been stronger with a tighter shot on just one of the birds with the boat moving by in the background.', '2008-02-03 16:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454117, 638543, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot, but could use some more depth of field to bring the foreground claws into sharp focus, and there''s an overall green cast to the image that is not pleasing to the eye.  The close shot on the rear foot and claw is awesome, though.</td>', 'Nice macro shot, but could use some more depth of field to bring the foreground claws into sharp focus, and there''s an overall green cast to the image that is not pleasing to the eye.  The close shot on the rear foot and claw is awesome, though.', '2008-02-03 16:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
