(4454550, 639049, 61651, '<td valign="top">This has a lovely, quiet atmosphere.  Nicely composed, and good sense of depth conveyed, with the zigzags of birds, and the barely perceptible landform in the  background.  One of my 10s for the challenge.</td>', 'This has a lovely, quiet atmosphere.  Nicely composed, and good sense of depth conveyed, with the zigzags of birds, and the barely perceptible landform in the  background.  One of my 10s for the challenge.', '2008-02-03 17:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454551, 638596, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the quality of light here - looks like it could be an oil painting.  Well done!</td>', 'I like the quality of light here - looks like it could be an oil painting.  Well done!', '2008-02-03 17:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454556, 637815, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful juxtaposition and I think the subdued tones are a good choice - gives a certain sense of wistfulness to the image.</td>', 'Beautiful juxtaposition and I think the subdued tones are a good choice - gives a certain sense of wistfulness to the image.', '2008-02-03 17:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454568, 638492, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot - one of my 10s.</td>', 'I like this one a lot - one of my 10s.', '2008-02-03 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454589, 637533, 61651, '<td valign="top">Almost afraid to vote on it, and possibly spoil your prediction.  :)  I enjoy looking at this, has a certain poetry to it.  The freer form of the bird winging away from the harsh and rigid background - this is very nice.  9</td>', 'Almost afraid to vote on it, and possibly spoil your prediction.  :)  I enjoy looking at this, has a certain poetry to it.  The freer form of the bird winging away from the harsh and rigid background - this is very nice.  9', '2008-02-03 17:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454603, 637983, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, I like how the composition is punctuated all over by these bird shadows.</td>', 'Very pretty, I like how the composition is punctuated all over by these bird shadows.', '2008-02-03 17:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454606, 636871, 61651, '<td valign="top">Started this at a 9, bumping to a 10 - love how the concept is so understated.</td>', 'Started this at a 9, bumping to a 10 - love how the concept is so understated.', '2008-02-03 17:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454626, 636851, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice catch and cute title. :)  Has a poignancy to it.</td>', 'Nice catch and cute title. :)  Has a poignancy to it.', '2008-02-03 18:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454633, 638929, 61651, '<td valign="top">Trying to imagine how many times you had to throw the bread to capture it in the clear like that - can''t have been easy, those suckers are fast!  The high key effect is bordering on too-sharp-hurts-my-eyes, but only just.  Nice idea overall, to get a bit of chaos in your composition.</td>', 'Trying to imagine how many times you had to throw the bread to capture it in the clear like that - can''t have been easy, those suckers are fast!  The high key effect is bordering on too-sharp-hurts-my-eyes, but only just.  Nice idea overall, to get a bit of chaos in your composition.', '2008-02-03 18:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454649, 638543, 61651, '<td valign="top">Unusual perspective - very nice.  As a personal preference, I might have cropped a smidgen off the left side, so that there''s no gap, and the bird leg acts as a frame all the way down that side.</td>', 'Unusual perspective - very nice.  As a personal preference, I might have cropped a smidgen off the left side, so that there''s no gap, and the bird leg acts as a frame all the way down that side.', '2008-02-03 18:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454660, 636450, 66267, '<td valign="top">Crisp, vibrant, wonderful.</td>', 'Crisp, vibrant, wonderful.', '2008-02-03 18:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454661, 638971, 61651, '<td valign="top">Simple and direct, and the toning is great.  Title is perfect.</td>', 'Simple and direct, and the toning is great.  Title is perfect.', '2008-02-03 18:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454823, 637422, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but a different POV, IMO, would of helped.</td>', 'Nice shot but a different POV, IMO, would of helped.', '2008-02-03 19:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454828, 638925, 22970, '<td valign="top">A great subject to work with. I like the low POV and the reflection in the water adds a nice touch. Colors, focus, lighting, and DOF are great. Bump</td>', 'A great subject to work with. I like the low POV and the reflection in the water adds a nice touch. Colors, focus, lighting, and DOF are great. Bump', '2008-02-03 19:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454834, 638995, 22970, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I would of like to have seen a little motion in the wings. Other than that, a good photograph.</td>', 'Good composition. I would of like to have seen a little motion in the wings. Other than that, a good photograph.', '2008-02-03 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4454841, 638912, 22970, '<td valign="top">Sorry - I just don''t feel this meets the challenge by description. Funny photo though.</td>', 'Sorry - I just don''t feel this meets the challenge by description. Funny photo though.', '2008-02-03 19:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
