(4455862, 638855, 67697, '<td valign="top">Yours is better than mine :P<br/> <br/>I love the angle of the neck you captured here.  I think the flexibility of these animals kind of gets taken for granted.  It still looks graceful, even in that twisted out yoga pose.  Love the drips of water coming from the mouth and and also on the feathers.  Beautiful capture of the feather details.  Should have scored higher IMHO.</td>', 'Yours is better than mine :P I love the angle of the neck you captured here.  I think the flexibility of these animals kind of gets taken for granted.  It still looks graceful, even in that twisted out yoga pose.  Love the drips of water coming from the mouth and and also on the feathers.  Beautiful capture of the feather details.  Should have scored higher IMHO.', '2008-02-04 00:14:12.000000', NULL, 0),
