(4455866, 638594, 39184, '<td valign="top">This was your Nikolai?!?  I''m cruising through the entries to find out where some of the competition finished.  This was one of the shots that really had me concerned.  I believed that it was going to edge my entry out and I am very surprised that it didn''t finish in the top 5.  Fantastic shot!</td>', 'This was your Nikolai?!?  I''m cruising through the entries to find out where some of the competition finished.  This was one of the shots that really had me concerned.  I believed that it was going to edge my entry out and I am very surprised that it didn''t finish in the top 5.  Fantastic shot!', '2008-02-04 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4455868, 638929, 67697, '<td valign="top">So this was you!  And you seriously caught that piece of bread floating in the air?  What great timing.  I love seeing all the birds in their own little world, flying in rhapsody.  I love the beedy little eyes too.</td>', 'So this was you!  And you seriously caught that piece of bread floating in the air?  What great timing.  I love seeing all the birds in their own little world, flying in rhapsody.  I love the beedy little eyes too.', '2008-02-04 00:15:45.000000', NULL, 0),
