(4456064, 638916, 58785, '<td valign="top">You know, I had one with a mouse... the bird was eating a mouse, but I found it kind of disturbing, and didn''t enter... I really prefer a fish rather than mouse in definitely. This is a good photo, very sharp :) frame is very nicely done also.</td>', 'You know, I had one with a mouse... the bird was eating a mouse, but I found it kind of disturbing, and didn''t enter... I really prefer a fish rather than mouse in definitely. This is a good photo, very sharp :) frame is very nicely done also.', '2008-02-04 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 0),
