(4456350, 638210, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fret not the score.  There are a few of us out there who enjoy "seeing" the picture, not just rating the picture - you''ll see comments from a few of those below.  Shots like this are meant for a selective audience, not the DPC audience in total.  If you''re going to enter something like this, you live for the rare but delightfully appreciated viewers who "get it" or at least take the time to see something in it, even if it isn''t what you intended.  And everyone sees things differently - depends on frame of reference, frame of mind, likes and dislikes.  (You should see my personal top ten list in most challenges - nary a color to be found anywhere!)  At any rate, don''t sweat the score.  Enjoy what you''ve accomplished for yourself and revel in those that saw what you intended.  (And remind me of all of this the next time I''m complaining about low scores, too!)</td>', 'Fret not the score.  There are a few of us out there who enjoy "seeing" the picture, not just rating the picture - you''ll see comments from a few of those below.  Shots like this are meant for a selective audience, not the DPC audience in total.  If you''re going to enter something like this, you live for the rare but delightfully appreciated viewers who "get it" or at least take the time to see something in it, even if it isn''t what you intended.  And everyone sees things differently - depends on frame of reference, frame of mind, likes and dislikes.  (You should see my personal top ten list in most challenges - nary a color to be found anywhere!)  At any rate, don''t sweat the score.  Enjoy what you''ve accomplished for yourself and revel in those that saw what you intended.  (And remind me of all of this the next time I''m complaining about low scores, too!)', '2008-02-04 06:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456351, 639027, 30982, '<td valign="top">Woefully underappreciated.  One of the more delightful shots to sit and visit with in the challenge.  Thanks for entering it!</td>', 'Woefully underappreciated.  One of the more delightful shots to sit and visit with in the challenge.  Thanks for entering it!', '2008-02-04 06:17:30.000000', NULL, 0),
