(4456486, 638735, 7889, '<td valign="top">A big thank you for all your comments and an extra thank you to Sally for making it a favourite.<br/> <br/>The tail bugged me also ! I had entered another shot of this robin but pulled it and put this one in place. This little chap was very happy for me to shot him , even flash did not put him off, however he did hop around a lot an move from tree to tree so it was quite difficult to get a clear shot of him. I will post some of the other shots later.<br/> <br/>thanks again<br/>Mike<br/> <br/></td>', 'A big thank you for all your comments and an extra thank you to Sally for making it a favourite. The tail bugged me also ! I had entered another shot of this robin but pulled it and put this one in place. This little chap was very happy for me to shot him , even flash did not put him off, however he did hop around a lot an move from tree to tree so it was quite difficult to get a clear shot of him. I will post some of the other shots later. thanks againMike ', '2008-02-04 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456493, 636450, 66597, '<td valign="top">Timothy, you are a master with these cardinals! What a beautiful shot - the little catchlight in his eye is just perfect!</td>', 'Timothy, you are a master with these cardinals! What a beautiful shot - the little catchlight in his eye is just perfect!', '2008-02-04 07:47:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456494, 638696, 50674, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by xianart:</b></div><hr/><i> very nice sabatier effect.  the sky is wonderful, well done indeed. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you for your comment. As so often is the case, the shots I like the most don''t go down well at dpc. It will not stop me from submitting them. Getting a ribbon or being close is of course a thrill, that goes without saying.</td>', 'Originally posted by xianart: very nice sabatier effect.  the sky is wonderful, well done indeed.  Thank you for your comment. As so often is the case, the shots I like the most don''t go down well at dpc. It will not stop me from submitting them. Getting a ribbon or being close is of course a thrill, that goes without saying.', '2008-02-04 07:47:44.000000', NULL, 0),
