(4456502, 638916, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot. I was pretty sure it was in the wild and am happy to see that it is. Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'This is an amazing shot. I was pretty sure it was in the wild and am happy to see that it is. Congrats on your ribbon!', '2008-02-04 07:51:45.000000', NULL, 0),
