(4456515, 637814, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb, maybe you didn''t get top marks, but look at the number of 10''s and faves for this. I love the fact that you entered this knowing how it would score and that it would appeal very much to a certain group of people (I''m one of the fans, by the way). Very cool.</td>', 'Deb, maybe you didn''t get top marks, but look at the number of 10''s and faves for this. I love the fact that you entered this knowing how it would score and that it would appeal very much to a certain group of people (I''m one of the fans, by the way). Very cool.', '2008-02-04 07:57:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456530, 637533, 66494, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your placement, even more congrats on Don''s vision to award the posthumous blue, and I hate to agree with the majority ... but the title probably held you back. <br/>Beautiful!</td>', 'Congrats on your placement, even more congrats on Don''s vision to award the posthumous blue, and I hate to agree with the majority ... but the title probably held you back. Beautiful!', '2008-02-04 08:12:16.000000', NULL, 0),
