(4456563, 638788, 34462, '<td valign="top">Love the detail in the feathers in this Jon.  You did a great job bringing out the colors of the bill. I don''t believe I have ever seen a Black Swan before.</td>', 'Love the detail in the feathers in this Jon.  You did a great job bringing out the colors of the bill. I don''t believe I have ever seen a Black Swan before.', '2008-02-04 08:34:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456567, 638991, 34462, '<td valign="top">He''s as cute as he can be. Nice capture Sherryl.</td>', 'He''s as cute as he can be. Nice capture Sherryl.', '2008-02-04 08:36:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456569, 638393, 69008, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote, but did look thru the images for this challenge. I suspected that this was one of your Anhinga Trail shots, because I could see that you were close when you got the shot from the perspective, and I know that the egrets are in mating plumage at this time. <br/>It''s appropriate that it''s mid winter, and the bird that you chose is a snowy egret. It''s about as close to snow as we get down here LOL.  <br/>This is the "plume bird" that was hunted to near extinction for feathers for ladies hats last century, but they are getting more common now. I have seen flocks of over 50 of them in the ''Glades.  <br/>Big congrats on the blue.   Go Nikon!</td>', 'I didn''t vote, but did look thru the images for this challenge. I suspected that this was one of your Anhinga Trail shots, because I could see that you were close when you got the shot from the perspective, and I know that the egrets are in mating plumage at this time. It''s appropriate that it''s mid winter, and the bird that you chose is a snowy egret. It''s about as close to snow as we get down here LOL.  This is the "plume bird" that was hunted to near extinction for feathers for ladies hats last century, but they are getting more common now. I have seen flocks of over 50 of them in the ''Glades.  Big congrats on the blue.   Go Nikon!', '2008-02-04 08:37:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456579, 638803, 34462, '<td valign="top">I think we both suffered from too many swans in the challenge. This is a great photo with the splashing water,  the reflections and the wonderful colors from that swan.</td>', 'I think we both suffered from too many swans in the challenge. This is a great photo with the splashing water,  the reflections and the wonderful colors from that swan.', '2008-02-04 08:39:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456596, 638130, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6, but I underrated it. I was scoring swans low because I was tired of them. I think 6 was the highest score that I gave a swan (or an eagle). The reason I gave you the extra point was for the lovely shapes of the shadows and how they interacted with the swan''s shape. I didn''t even think about the focus, which is too bad because I agree with you. The soft focus adds to this. Well done.</td>', 'I gave this a 6, but I underrated it. I was scoring swans low because I was tired of them. I think 6 was the highest score that I gave a swan (or an eagle). The reason I gave you the extra point was for the lovely shapes of the shadows and how they interacted with the swan''s shape. I didn''t even think about the focus, which is too bad because I agree with you. The soft focus adds to this. Well done.', '2008-02-04 08:44:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456597, 638541, 39850, '<td valign="top">Disappointing to see this finish so low.  The lighting was / is very nice.</td>', 'Disappointing to see this finish so low.  The lighting was / is very nice.', '2008-02-04 08:44:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456601, 637422, 51269, '<td valign="top">You are justifiably proud- i know how hard it is to get one ! One of my faves in this very "challenging" challenge, Mary- well done :) P</td>', 'You are justifiably proud- i know how hard it is to get one ! One of my faves in this very "challenging" challenge, Mary- well done :) P', '2008-02-04 08:45:44.000000', NULL, 0),
