(4456610, 638007, 84440, '<td valign="top">Great shot in habitat. Underrated because the average voter know nothing about birds. I agree that the center of focus needs to be on the eye not the sides. But I''ve been trying for a good shot of a woodcock for three years!!</td>', 'Great shot in habitat. Underrated because the average voter know nothing about birds. I agree that the center of focus needs to be on the eye not the sides. But I''ve been trying for a good shot of a woodcock for three years!!', '2008-02-04 08:53:52.000000', NULL, 0),
