(4456661, 638895, 51597, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.. Great Shot!!  Nice finish and well deserved.<br/> <br/>Wouldn''t of guessed this one in a million yrs:) Her red eye caught me tho in the challenge as well as the lighting --- failed to mention but noticed... <br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations.. Great Shot!!  Nice finish and well deserved. Wouldn''t of guessed this one in a million yrs:) Her red eye caught me tho in the challenge as well as the lighting --- failed to mention but noticed...  ', '2008-02-04 09:19:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456703, 638916, 70270, '<td valign="top">This was in the wild?!?  Holy shnikeys!  What an awesome shot.  You didn''t deserve the 8 I gave you; should have been a 10.  Sorry for bringing you down a tad, but glad to see you ribboned.  Congrats!</td>', 'This was in the wild?!?  Holy shnikeys!  What an awesome shot.  You didn''t deserve the 8 I gave you; should have been a 10.  Sorry for bringing you down a tad, but glad to see you ribboned.  Congrats!', '2008-02-04 09:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456713, 638097, 46177, '<td valign="top">I just read your post in reflections without mirrors and remembered this shot and also remembered I loved it.  I am glad some people take chances with there processing it makes it so much more interesting to view. I can and can''t beleive this finished so low. Its beautiful and well done so imo should have finished higher however I do know alot of the voters here don''t like this sort of thing.  I am definately not one of them and am adding this to my favorites.  It really is lovely!</td>', 'I just read your post in reflections without mirrors and remembered this shot and also remembered I loved it.  I am glad some people take chances with there processing it makes it so much more interesting to view. I can and can''t beleive this finished so low. Its beautiful and well done so imo should have finished higher however I do know alot of the voters here don''t like this sort of thing.  I am definately not one of them and am adding this to my favorites.  It really is lovely!', '2008-02-04 09:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4456733, 638986, 66494, '<td valign="top">Again, let me say this was truly and outrageously underrated. I could see the connection even without the title. What I truly don''t understand is the 36 ones, sheeeeeeesh.</td>', 'Again, let me say this was truly and outrageously underrated. I could see the connection even without the title. What I truly don''t understand is the 36 ones, sheeeeeeesh.', '2008-02-04 09:42:03.000000', NULL, 0),
