(4457293, 638393, 714, '<td valign="top">This rocks.. I like the crop better on the outtake than the winner.  I like to see a little space between the border, but my preference isn''t usually what others like.  He is definitely a cool looking bird.</td>', 'This rocks.. I like the crop better on the outtake than the winner.  I like to see a little space between the border, but my preference isn''t usually what others like.  He is definitely a cool looking bird.', '2008-02-04 13:12:02.000000', NULL, 0),
