(4457323, 638883, 714, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure why this didn''t do as well as the other eagle shots.  I actually like this one much better than the first head shot because he doesn''t have a huge reflection in his eyes.  You captured this bird well, he looks like he is very proud of who he is.  Great softness in the whiter feathers.</td>', 'Not quite sure why this didn''t do as well as the other eagle shots.  I actually like this one much better than the first head shot because he doesn''t have a huge reflection in his eyes.  You captured this bird well, he looks like he is very proud of who he is.  Great softness in the whiter feathers.', '2008-02-04 13:24:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4457325, 639049, 714, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!  Nice to see something that isn''t so close up and amazing b/w.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-02-04 13:25:55.</i></td>', 'AWESOME!  Nice to see something that isn''t so close up and amazing b/w.', '2008-02-04 13:25:29.000000', '2008-02-04 13:25:55.000000', 0),
