(4458203, 638862, 15305, '<td valign="top">The pose captured along with the overall composition and colors of the image are magnificent. I wonder why it scored so low...<br/>Congratulations on an excellent shot!!</td>', 'The pose captured along with the overall composition and colors of the image are magnificent. I wonder why it scored so low...Congratulations on an excellent shot!!', '2008-02-04 18:50:41.000000', NULL, 0),
