(4460864, 637422, 88923, '<td valign="top">Ooops, I see now that I really gave it a 10.  I''m new to DP, and just now found out that the red bar is how I voted, so ignore my last comment about the "nine".  Ginny</td>', 'Ooops, I see now that I really gave it a 10.  I''m new to DP, and just now found out that the red bar is how I voted, so ignore my last comment about the "nine".  Ginny', '2008-02-05 16:50:44.000000', NULL, 0),
