(4461734, 638274, 61651, '<td valign="top">What a horrible thing to befall a migratory bird. You were right to focus it as you did, and compose it headless as you did - zeros right in on the point of the piece and makes it all the more poignant.  B&amp;W was absolutely the way to go with this one.</td>', 'What a horrible thing to befall a migratory bird. You were right to focus it as you did, and compose it headless as you did - zeros right in on the point of the piece and makes it all the more poignant.  B&W was absolutely the way to go with this one.', '2008-02-05 23:14:14.000000', NULL, 0),
