(4462257, 638393, 41802, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Wow I haven''t critiqued in a while and first one I get is this beautiful piece.  I remember seeing it when I was voting thinking it had to ribbon and yes it did.  Congratulations.  I love how in the details you commented about what you learned in the a forum I think that really puts it into perspective for all of us, how much we can learn.  <br/> <br/>Over the image is very striking, I think the contrast between the blue sky and white bird are prefect for this shot.  The border is a very nice way to frame up the shot.  I also love the include of the stick the bird is standing on.  The focus all the way down to the feet is prefect.  There is not much I can say because it is so prefect.  Nice job.</td>', '*Critique Club* Wow I haven''t critiqued in a while and first one I get is this beautiful piece.  I remember seeing it when I was voting thinking it had to ribbon and yes it did.  Congratulations.  I love how in the details you commented about what you learned in the a forum I think that really puts it into perspective for all of us, how much we can learn.   Over the image is very striking, I think the contrast between the blue sky and white bird are prefect for this shot.  The border is a very nice way to frame up the shot.  I also love the include of the stick the bird is standing on.  The focus all the way down to the feet is prefect.  There is not much I can say because it is so prefect.  Nice job.', '2008-02-06 01:09:23.000000', NULL, 0),
