(4463824, 638210, 66348, '<td valign="top">Holy crap man, this is incredible. Can''t believe I missed this in the challenge. You should be so proud of this, which I am assuming you are as its on your front page. :P Everything about this works. The angle, the view, the takeoff, the composition, love the B&amp;W. It honestly looks like it could be a cover to a book. Congrats on a great capture.</td>', 'Holy crap man, this is incredible. Can''t believe I missed this in the challenge. You should be so proud of this, which I am assuming you are as its on your front page. :P Everything about this works. The angle, the view, the takeoff, the composition, love the B&W. It honestly looks like it could be a cover to a book. Congrats on a great capture.', '2008-02-06 10:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
