(4464192, 638986, 69008, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a darn good shot. I knew that it would get hammered in voting and DNMC''s but it is because it isn''t a literal photo of a bird.  Thumbs up for you for running with your take on the challenge theme.  : )</td>', 'I thought this was a darn good shot. I knew that it would get hammered in voting and DNMC''s but it is because it isn''t a literal photo of a bird.  Thumbs up for you for running with your take on the challenge theme.  : )', '2008-02-06 11:33:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464750, 638816, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh I liked this one during the challenge and I would have thought it would have scored higher.  What cracked me up was that it looked like the one bird was mooning the other and the white duck was just like "wha?"  Too bad it''s bill wasn''t open too.  Great catch of the action!</td>', 'Oh I liked this one during the challenge and I would have thought it would have scored higher.  What cracked me up was that it looked like the one bird was mooning the other and the white duck was just like "wha?"  Too bad it''s bill wasn''t open too.  Great catch of the action!', '2008-02-06 14:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464763, 638971, 67697, '<td valign="top">My favorite part was seeing the other bird in the background.  It''s like we are seeing a scene where the one in the foreground has been hurt and is walking away from the other.  And the one in the background just watches and wonders.  I''m sure it''s just me, but these are the kinds of things I look for in animal pictures.</td>', 'My favorite part was seeing the other bird in the background.  It''s like we are seeing a scene where the one in the foreground has been hurt and is walking away from the other.  And the one in the background just watches and wonders.  I''m sure it''s just me, but these are the kinds of things I look for in animal pictures.', '2008-02-06 14:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4464768, 638578, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this would do well.  The clarity is excellent and the color is amazing!   It''s a beautiful capture.</td>', 'I thought this would do well.  The clarity is excellent and the color is amazing!   It''s a beautiful capture.', '2008-02-06 14:28:25.000000', NULL, 0),
