(4495103, 638920, 42013, '<td valign="top">I forgot to come back to this one... I thought it wierd/cool how the BG birds approaching the bridge structhre looked like the same bird caught in 4 different positions. Does that make sense? Which is why I wondered about time lapse/several different fames. Anyway, i found it pretty bizarre.</td>', 'I forgot to come back to this one... I thought it wierd/cool how the BG birds approaching the bridge structhre looked like the same bird caught in 4 different positions. Does that make sense? Which is why I wondered about time lapse/several different fames. Anyway, i found it pretty bizarre.', '2008-02-18 16:52:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4495151, 638920, 80096, '<td valign="top">Now that you mention it, it''s a bit weird how the birds lined up. But, rest assured it wasn''t a time-lapse trick at all, just a single capture of a flock of gulls. <br/> <br/>Thanks for noticing!</td>', 'Now that you mention it, it''s a bit weird how the birds lined up. But, rest assured it wasn''t a time-lapse trick at all, just a single capture of a flock of gulls.  Thanks for noticing!', '2008-02-18 17:08:58.000000', NULL, 0),
