(4498198, 638097, 67145, '<td valign="top">you may''v got a woeful score but its most definitely not a woeful image .. brilliant in fact .. excellent colours .. love the softness that the process gives this ... its like a beautiful painting .. <br/>i really dont understand the ppl who say stuff like ''doesnt look like a photograph to me'' .. when we do any processing we change the appearance of a photograph, its just a matter of degree .. ppl absolutely love the overlay/texture look for example yet they dont look like photographs either .. and there are heaps of stunning images in dpc that are nothing like the original photograph but ppl dont say ''doesnt look like a photograph to me'' coz the processing is less obtrusive .. (couldnt think of a word there, so obtrusive will have to do ..!! ..) ..:)</td>', 'you may''v got a woeful score but its most definitely not a woeful image .. brilliant in fact .. excellent colours .. love the softness that the process gives this ... its like a beautiful painting .. i really dont understand the ppl who say stuff like ''doesnt look like a photograph to me'' .. when we do any processing we change the appearance of a photograph, its just a matter of degree .. ppl absolutely love the overlay/texture look for example yet they dont look like photographs either .. and there are heaps of stunning images in dpc that are nothing like the original photograph but ppl dont say ''doesnt look like a photograph to me'' coz the processing is less obtrusive .. (couldnt think of a word there, so obtrusive will have to do ..!! ..) ..:)', '2008-02-19 15:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
