(5058224, 638274, 54645, '<td valign="top">Michelle...what a powerful photograph. I would love to see you reprocess this and post a larger version. Absolutely stunning and moving, and have not read the details yet, but I can only imagine what it says.<br/> <br/>I love Canadian Geese, too many stories...<br/> <br/>ETA: Much better than my entry despite the score. I went for a straight portrait...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-11 23:36:27.</i></td>', 'Michelle...what a powerful photograph. I would love to see you reprocess this and post a larger version. Absolutely stunning and moving, and have not read the details yet, but I can only imagine what it says. I love Canadian Geese, too many stories... ETA: Much better than my entry despite the score. I went for a straight portrait...', '2008-11-11 23:34:46.000000', '2008-11-11 23:36:27.000000', 0),
